<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Esekiyeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esekiyeli bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Esekiyeli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ese</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esekiyeli bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Esekiyeli findixi Ala xa namiɲɔnmɛ nan na Yudaya bɔxi ma. Ala nu bara natɛ tongo Yudayakae birin xa xanin konyiya kui Babilɔn bɔxi ma, alɔ a naxan naba Isirayilakae ra naxee nu sabatixi kɔɔla mabiri. Na birin fatanxi e xa yunubie nan ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala mu na rabaxi tɛmui keren xa ra. A naxa a ragiri Babilɔnkae xa ɲama saxan xanin ɲɛ fu nun solofere bun ma, beenun e xa Darisalamu kana kerenyi ra. Annabi Esekiyeli nu na ɲama firin nde ya ma, naxan sabati Babilɔn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na ɲama a maɲɔxun nɛ a e mu buma konyiya kui. E xa diinɛ mixie nu a falama nɛ e bɛ, a e gbilenma nɛ e xɔnyi hɛɛri kui. Kɔnɔ Ala naxa a masen e bɛ Annabi Esekiyeli saabui ra, a e mu gbilenma mafuren mafuren e xa yunubie xa fe ra. E xa kuye batui nan a niyaxi e xa xanin Babilɔn bɔxi ma, e xa Ala xa ɲaxankatɛ xungbe sɔtɔ konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔnɔ Ala xa namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi mu danma mɛnni xɛ. Annabi Esekiyeli naxa a masen e bɛ a Ala fama nɛ kaabanakoe rabade e ragbilenfe ra Darisalamu. A naxɛ Alatala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi fama nɛ gorode e ma, a a niya e xa tuubi, e man xa Ala xa marafanyi kolon e bɔɲɛ kui. A ngaxakerenyie gbegbe mu nu laxi na masenyi ra, kɔnɔ ndee naxa e xaxili ti na xibaaru fanyi ra, e e tunnabɛxi na kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Esekiyeli naxa a masen e bɛ, Ala fama a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tide a firin nde ra ki naxɛ. Na tide nu gbo Isirayilakae bɛ. Babilɔnkae to e xa salide xungbe kana, e naxa a maɲɔxun Ala nu bara a rabolo. Yi kitaabui nu a masenma nɛ e bɛ a Ala nu bara e rabolo e xa yunubie xa fe ra, kɔnɔ a mu tondima e raminide na ɲaxankatɛ kui, a e rakisi. Ala tantu, mixi naxan Ala xa hɛɛri fenma, a a toma nɛ. Ala sago nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa won mali birade a xa kira fɔxɔ ra, kira naxan won xaninma ariyanna. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esekiyeli bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ala a yɛtɛ masenfe Annabi Esekiyeli bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />Ɲɛ tongo saxan nde, a kike naani nde, xi suuli nde ra, n nu na Isirayilaka suxuxie ya ma Kebara xure fɛ ma. Koore naxa rabi, n naxa Ala xa laamatunyi to. <verse eid="EZK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" />Na ɲɛ nu findixi Yudaya Mangɛ Yehoyakini xa ɲɛ suuli nde nan na konyiya kui. Na xi suuli nde <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" />Alatala naxa masenyi ti n tan sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Esekiyeli bɛ, Busi xa di. N nu na Kalidi bɔxi nan ma Kebara xure fɛ ma. Alatala xɔnyɛ nu na n ma.<verse eid="EZK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" />N naxa turunnaadɛ to kelife kɔɔla mabiri, nuxui xungbe yanbama naxan nabilinxi naiyalanyi magaaxuxi ra. A xɔri nu luxi nɛ alɔ wure raxunuxi. <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" />Daalise naani nu na na tɛ xɔɔra. E nu maniyaxi xɛmɛe nan na, <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />kɔnɔ yatagi naani nun gabutenyi naani nan nu na kankan ma. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" />E sanwurie nu tinxin, e sanbɔnbɔlae nu maniyaxi ninge toree nan na naxee yanbaxi alɔ wure gbeeli. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" />Mixi bɛlɛxɛe nu na e bɛ e gabutenyie bun ma e sɛɛti naanie ma. Yatagie nun gabutenyie nu na e naani birin ma, <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" />e gabutenyie nu dɔxɔxi e bore ra. Na ki e mu nu e ya ragbilenma sigafe ra, e nu siga yare tun.<verse eid="EZK 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" />E yatagie nu na yi ki nɛ: yatagi adama daaxi, yatagi yɛtɛ daaxi, yatagi ninge daaxi, nun yatagi sɛgɛ daaxi nan nu na kankan bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" />E yatagie nu na na ki nɛ. Gabutenyi naani nu na kankan ma. Firin na sɛɛti keren ma, naxee nu italaxi e bore fɛ ma. Gabutenyi firin nan fan nu e fatee makotoxi.<verse eid="EZK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" />Kankan nu biraxi Ala Xaxili nan fɔxɔ ra. Na kui, e mu nu e ya ragbilenma, e nu fa siga yare tun. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" />Na daalisee lahalɛ nu luxi nɛ alɔ tɛ wolee nun tɛ fulefulee. Na tɛ yanbaxi nu a lintanma na daalisee longori ra alɔ seyamakɔnyie. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" />Na daalisee nu siga e gi ra, e xulun alɔ seyamakɔnyi.<verse eid="EZK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" />N to nu yi daalisee matofe, n naxa sanyi radigilinxi keren to bɔxi ma kankan sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Nee nu yanbama alɔ diyaman, e birin nu maniya. E rafala ki nu luxi nɛ alɔ sanyi radigilinxi nu na sanyi radigilinxi gbɛtɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" />E nɛ sigama, e nu e ɲɛrɛma e sɛɛti naani nan ma, e mu nu e mafindima e xa ɲɛrɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" />E nu ite, e tofan, e luxi alɔ yae nu na e bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" />Daalisee na e ɲɛrɛ, e sanyie fan e ɲɛrɛ. E na te koore ma, e sanyie fan te. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Ala Xaxili nu siga dɛdɛ, e fan nu birama nɛ a fɔxɔ ra, a nun e sanyie, barima na daalisee xaxili nu na e sanyie nan kui. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Na daalisee na siga, e sanyie fan siga. Daalisee na ti, e sanyie fan ti. Daalisee na te koore ma, e sanyi fan te, barima na daalisee xaxili nu na e sanyie nan kui.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />Koore walaxɛ tofanyi alɔ diyaman nu italaxi e xun ma. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" />Na daalisee gabutenyi firin nu italaxi e bore sɛɛti ma, gabutenyi firin nu e fate makotoxi. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" />E e ɲɛrɛ tɛmui naxɛ, xui nde nu minima alɔ baa mɔrɔnyi xui, alɔ Ala Sɛnbɛma xui, alɔ sɔɔri gaali xui. Daalisee na ti, e nu fa e gabutenyie iso.<verse eid="EZK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Na tɛmui xui nde naxa mini koore walaxɛ fari naxan nu na daalisee xun ma, e gabutenyie isoxi. <verse eid="EZK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />Se nde nu na na koore walaxɛ fari naxan nu luxi alɔ kibanyi naxan yailanxi diyaman na. Se nde nu na kibanyi kui naxan nu maniyaxi adamadi nde ra. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" />A kanke nu yanbama alɔ wure raxunuxi, a sanyie fan nu yanba alɔ tɛ. Naiyalanyi magaaxuxi nu na a rabilinyi birin ma. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" />A yanbɛ nu luxi nɛ alɔ senkui naxan minima koore ma tunɛ furu tɛmui. N to na to, n naxa bira n na n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, n naxa xui nde mɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="s">Alatala Annabi Esekiyeli xɛɛfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, keli, n xa masenyi ti i bɛ.» <verse eid="EZK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" />A fɛfɛ na wɔyɛnyi fala n bɛ, Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro n ma, a n ti n sanyie xun ma. N naxa a xui mɛ a falafe ra n bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" />«I tan adamadi, n tan nan i xɛɛfe Isirayilakae ma, naxee bara muruta n ma, kelife e benbae xa tɛmui ma han yi waxati. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" />N i xɛɛma naxee xɔn, e tuli xɔrɔxɔ. I xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Alatala yi masenyi nan tixi.› <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" />Bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi nan e ra, kɔnɔ e fama nɛ a kolonde namiɲɔnmɛ nde bara lu e ya ma, hali e tondi i xui suxude. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" />I tan adamadi, i naxa gaaxu e ya ra, i naxa kɔntɔfili e xa wɔyɛnyi xa fe ra, hali na birin fa findi tɔɔrɛ ra i bɛ, e fa lu alɔ talie. I naxa gaaxu na bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi ya ra. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" />Fo i xa n ma masenyi ti e bɛ, hali e tondi e tuli matide i ra e xa matandi kui. <verse eid="EZK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />Kɔnɔ i tan adamadi, i xa i tuli mati n xui ra, i naxa muruta alɔ yi bɔnsɔɛ a rabama ki naxɛ. I xa i dɛ rabi, i xa donse don n naxan soma i yi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" />Na tɛmui n naxa bɛlɛxɛ italaxi nde to n ya i, kɛɛdi mafilinxi nu na a kui. <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" />A naxa a itala n ya i, sɛbɛli nu tixi a kui nun a fari naxan tɔɔrɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ xa fe masenma.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Esekiyeli xa xɛɛraya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i xa yi kɛɛdi don, i sa masenyi tife Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ.» <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Awa, n naxa n dɛ rabi, a naxa na kɛɛdi raso n dɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" />A man naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i xa yi kɛɛdi birin don n naxan soxi i yi ra.» N to a don, a nu ɲɔxun n dɛ i alɔ kumi.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, siga Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ yire, i sa n ma masenyi ti e bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />N mu na i xɛɛfe ɲama xa ma, i mu naxan xa xui xɔrɔxɔɛ mɛma. N bara i xɛɛ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />N mu na i xɛɛfe bɔnsɔɛ wuyaxi xa ma, i mu naxee xa xui falama, i mu naxee xa xui mɛma. Xa a sa li n i xɛɛ nɛ nee fan ma nu, e i xui suxuma nɛ keren na. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila tan mu wama a tuli matife i ra, barima e mu tinma n ma masenyi ra. E xaxili xɔrɔxɔ, matandi bara e bɔɲɛ suxu. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Kɔnɔ n i ya xɔrɔxɔma nɛ dangife e tan na, n i xa limaniya xun masama nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" />N a niyama nɛ i xa i tunnabɛxi alɔ fanye, i xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ naxan xɔrɔxɔ alɔ gɛmɛ. I naxa gaaxu e ya ra, i naxa ifu e ya i de, hali e to findixi bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, I tuli mati n ma masenyi ra n naxan masenfe i bɛ. I xa e ragata i bɔɲɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" />Yakɔsi i xa siga i xa ɲama yire, naxan na konyiya kui, i sa wɔyɛn e ra. I xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Ala xa masenyi nan ya.› Xa e sa e tuli mati ba, xa e mu e tuli mati ba, i tan xa n ma masenyi ti.»<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />Na tɛmui Alatala Xaxili naxa n tongo, n naxa xui nde mɛ n xanbi ra a falafe ra, «Matɔxɔɛ na Alatala nɔrɛ kanyi bɛ a sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ!» <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" />N naxa na daalisee gabutenyie xui mɛ e garinfe e bore ra, a nun e sanyi digilinxie xui. Na sɛnbɛ gbo. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" />Ala xaxili naxa n nate koore ma, a n xanin. Xɔnɛ nu bara n bɔɲɛ rate, kɔnɔ Ala xɔnyɛ naxa nɔ n na. <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" />Na kui n naxa n ma ɲama li naxan nu na konyiya kui Teli Abibi taa kui Kebara xure fɛ ma. N naxa xi solofere raba e tagi, n nakorixi kɔfu.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Xi solofere to dangi, Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" />«Adamadi, n bara i findi Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ kantama ra. I na n ma masenyi mɛ, i xa na fala e bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" />N na a masen mixi ɲaaxi bɛ, ‹I faxama nɛ,› xa i mu a rasi a xa gbilen fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra alako a xa kisi, n a faxama nɛ a xa yunubi xa fe ra. Na kui n a nii sare maxɔrinma i tan nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Kɔnɔ xa i bara a rasi, a fa lu a mu a yɛtɛ ragbilen n ma, a faxama nɛ a xa yunubi kui, kɔnɔ a lima nɛ i tan nii bara rakisi.»<verse eid="EZK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" />«Xa tinxintɔɛ nde sa gbilen tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra, a kira gbɛtɛ suxu, n a tɔɔrɔma nɛ na kira xɔn, alako a naxa fa faxa. Xa i mu a rasi, a faxama nɛ a xa yunubi kui. A xa wali fanyie birin luma nɛ fu. Na kui n a nii sare maxɔrinma i tan nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" />Kɔnɔ xa i bara a rasi alako a naxa yunubi raba, a fa a tuli mati i ra, a kisima i tan nan saabui ra. Na kui i bara i yɛtɛ fan nakisi.»<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />Alatala xɔnyɛ nu na n ma mɛnni, a fa a masen n bɛ, «Keli, mini fiili ma. N sa wɔyɛnma i bɛ mɛnni nɛ.» <verse eid="EZK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" />N naxa keli, n siga fiili ma. Mɛnni n naxa Alatala xa nɔrɛ to, alɔ n a toxi Kebara xure dɛ ra ki naxɛ. N naxa n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" />Alatala Xaxili naxa so n bɔɲɛ kui, a naxa n nakeli. A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Siga i xɔnyi, i so banxi, i naadɛ balan i yɛtɛ xun na. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" />I tan Adamadi, e i xirima nɛ luuti ra alako i naxa so ɲama ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" />N i nɛnyi xirima nɛ, alako i naxa nɔ sese falade na bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" />Kɔnɔ n nɛ wɔyɛnma i bɛ, n i nɛnyi fulunma nɛ, alako i xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi wo bɛ.› Xa a naxan kɛnɛn, a xa na ramɛ. Xa a mu naxan kɛnɛn, a xa na lu na. Bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi nan e ra.»<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu suxuxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />«I tan adamadi, i xa walaxɛ bɛndɛ daaxi tongo, i fa pirinti korin a ma naxan misaalixi Darisalamu taa ra. <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" />I xa se ndee yailan na walaxɛ rabilinyi ma naxan misaalixi gere ra Darisalamu xili ma. Bɛndɛ nde malan misaali ra yaxuie fama tede tɛtɛ ra naxan fari. Wuri die tongo naxee misaalixi wurie ra yaxuie naxee rawalima naadɛ kanafe ra. Yonkindee yailan misaali ra yaxuie luma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" />Wure nde ti i tan nun na walaxɛ tagi. Na xa findi misaali ra Darisalamu suxuma ki naxɛ. A xa findi tɔnxuma ra Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />«I xa i sa i kɔɔla sɛɛti ma na walaxɛ ya i. Na misaalima Isirayila xa yunubie nan na, naxee luma i ma i xa xi xasabi. <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" />I xa xi xasabi lanma e xa yunubi raba ɲɛ xasabi nan ma. Na findixi xi kɛmɛ saxan xi tongo solomanaani nan na. Isirayilakae xa yunubi kote dɔxɔma i xun ma na ki nɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" />«I na gɛ na rabade, i man xa i sa i yirefanyi sɛɛti ma. Na kui i xa Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa yunubi kote tongo xi tongo naani bun ma, naxan a masenma e lu yunubi raba ra na ɲɛ nan na. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />I xa i ya ti na walaxɛ ra, i i bɛlɛxɛ itala, i wɔyɛn Darisalamu bɛ n xili ra. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" />N i xirima nɛ luutie ra alako i naxa fa i mafindi i sɛɛti nde ma, han i gɛ na waxati rakamalide.»<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />«Mɛngi xɔrie, toge, tenge, nun na maniyɛ tongo, i e sa se sase kui taami yailanfe ra i bɛ na waxati. I fama nɛ na donde i saxi i sɛɛti ma na xi kɛmɛ saxan xi tongo solomanaani bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />I xa na donse maniya giramu kɛmɛ firin, kɛmɛ firin ma, i naxan donma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ a waxati ma. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />I xa ye fan litiri tagi maniya, i naxan minma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ a waxati. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />I xa taami yailan na mɛngi ra ɲama ya xɔri. I na gan mixi gbi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa a masen, «Na kui Isirayilakae fama nɛ taami sɛniyɛntare donde ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe tagi, n e rayensenma dɛnnaxɛ.» <verse eid="EZK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" />N naxa a yaabi, «N Marigi Alatala astɔfulahi! N tan luma sɛniyɛnyi nan kui. Kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui n mu sese raharamuxi don, alɔ sube naxan faxaxi a yɛtɛ ma, xa na mu a ra sube naxan ibɔɔxi sube xaaɲɛ nde saabui ra.» <verse eid="EZK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />Na nan a ra, a naxa a fala n bɛ, «Awa yire, i i xa taami ganma ninge ɲaɲɛ nan fari, n bara mixi gbi fe lu na.»<verse eid="EZK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" />Na tɛmui a naxa a fala n bɛ, «Adamadi, n mu tinma baloe xa Darisalamu li. Taakae fama donse nun ye sɔtɔde a xuri xuri nan na, e fa lu tɔɔrɛ nun kɔntɔfili kui. <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" />Baloe nun ye xurunma nɛ e yi, e fate ɲɔn e gaaxu e bore tofe ra. Na birin e lima e xa yunubi nan xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />«I tan adamadi, i xa i xunyi nun i dɛxabe bi. I na gɛ na rabade, i xa na xunsɛxɛ nun na dɛxabe itaxun dɔxɔ saxan na. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" />Darisalamu xa suxui xi kɔnti na gɛ kamalide, i xunsɛxɛ nun dɛxabe dɔxɔ keren gan taa pirinti ma. I xa dɔxɔ keren maxaba santidɛgɛma ra pirinti rabilinyi ma. I xa dɔxɔ keren woli koore ma, foye xa a rayensen. Na birin a masenma nɛ n fama i keride santidɛgɛma ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" />Kɔnɔ i xa xunsɛxɛ dondoronti tongo, i nee nɔxun i xa dugi kui. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" />I man xa xunsɛxɛ nde woli tɛ xɔɔra, naxan a masenma yi ɲaxankatɛ fama nɛ dinde Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin na.»<verse eid="EZK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />«N tan Marigi Alatala nan yi masenxi: Darisalamu nan ya n naxan dɔxɔ sie tagi. Ɲamanɛe nan na a rabilinyi birin ma. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" />Kɔnɔ a bara muruta n ma sɛriyɛ nun n ma yaamarie ma a xa ɲaaxuɲa kui. A bara a kobe raso n na, a gbilen n fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="EZK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" />«N tan Marigi Alatala nan yi masenxi: Wo bara ɲaaxu dangife wo dɔxɔbooree birin na. Wo to mu tinxi birade n ma kira fɔxɔ ra, wo mu n ma sɛriyɛ suxu. Hali wo dɔxɔbooree xa sɛriyɛ, wo mu a binyama.»<verse eid="EZK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" />«N tan Marigi Alatala nan yi masenxi: N tan bara ti wo kanke Darisalamukae. N fama nɛ wo ɲaxankatade sie ya xɔri. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" />Wo to bira kuye xɔnxie batufe ra, n fe rabama nɛ wo ra n mu naxan singe rabaxi, n mu naxan nabama yare. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" />Wo babae fama nɛ e xa die donde, wo xa die fama nɛ e babae donde. N wo ɲaxankatama na ki nɛ, naxee luxi n fa e rayensen ɲamanɛe ma.»<verse eid="EZK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" />«N tan Marigi Alatala n bara n kali: Wo to n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi rafe kuye ɲaaxie ra, wo fa batui raba n naxan xɔnxi, n na n ma hinnɛ bama nɛ wo yi ra, n mu kinikinima wo ma, n mu wo rakisima fefe ma. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" />Wo xa ɲama dɔxɔ keren faxama nɛ wuganyi nun kaamɛ ra. A dɔxɔ firin nde faxama santidɛgɛma nan na taa fari ma. A dɔxɔ saxan nde rayensen yɛ ɲamanɛe ma, n e keri santidɛgɛma ra.»<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />«Na tɛmui, n ma xɔnɛ danma nɛ. N gbe fama nɛ ɲɔxɔde na kui. N na xɔnɔ e ma na ki, e fama nɛ a kolonde n tan Alatala bɔɲɛ na ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" />N i findima yire kanaxi nan na, si gbɛtɛe na naa to, e fa wo mabere. <verse eid="EZK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" />N na gɛ wo ɲaxankatade n ma xɔnɛ kui, e fe ɲaaxi falama nɛ wo xun ma, e wo konbi. Wo findima masenyi magaaxuxi nan na sie bɛ naxee na wo rabilinyi. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" />«N na n ma xali faxatise wolima nɛ wo ma, naxan lanxi kaamɛ ma. Nee wolima nɛ alako n xa wo sɔntɔ. N luma nɛ wo xa kaamɛ xun masa ra, wo xa baloe xa ɲɔn feo. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" />N kaamɛ radinma nɛ wo ma, n sube xaaɲɛe xɛɛma nɛ wo yire. Na birin wo xa die sɔntɔma nɛ. Wuganyi, faxɛ, nun gere mu ɲɔnma wo tagi. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ geyae fari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti n bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" />«Adamadi, i ya rafindi Isirayila geyae ma, i xa n xui radangi e ma. <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" />I xa a fala, ‹Isirayilakae, wo wo tuli mati wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi ra. N naxɛ wo tan naxee na geyae fari nun gulunbae kui, n fama nɛ wo sɔntɔde santidɛgɛma ra, n wo xa kuye batudee kana. <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Wo xa sɛrɛxɛbadee kanama nɛ, wo xa surayi sɛrɛxɛbadee yensen, wo faxa wo xa kuyee ya xɔri. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" />N wo tan Isirayilakae binbie luma nɛ na sɛrɛxɛbadee rabilinyi, wo xɔrie rayensenma nɛ naa. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />Wo sabati dɛdɛ, wo xa taae nun wo xa batudee kanama nɛ. Wo xa sɛrɛxɛbadee nun wo xa kuyee butuxunma nɛ, wo xa surayi sɛrɛxɛbadee rabira. Wo xa wali birin xun nakanama nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Mixi gbegbe na faxa wo ya ma, wo fama a kolonde a Alatala na n tan nan na.›»<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />«Kɔnɔ n wo dɔnxɔɛe ratangama nɛ santidɛgɛma ma, n fa wo lu ɲamanɛe ma. <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" />Na tɛmui wo xa mixi naxee xaninxi konyiya kui, e fama nɛ ratude n ma. E fa e xa yanfanteya kolon n mabiri, e xa birɛ kuyee fɔxɔ ra, na birin bara n bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔ. E na fahaamui sɔtɔ e xa ɲaaxuɲa ma, e bɔɲɛ fan tɔɔrɔma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Na tɛmui e a kolonma nɛ a Alatala na n tan nan na. N mu wɔyɛnxi fufafu ra n to yi gbaloe fe fala e bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />«Wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Wo wo bɛlɛxɛ bɔnbɔ, wo wo sanyi ramaxa, a falafe ra, ‹Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xa ɲaaxuɲa birin bara a niya e xa faxa gere, kaamɛ, nun wuganyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" />Naxee makuya, wuganyi nan nee faxama. Naxee makɔrɛ, nee faxama gere nan kui. Naxee na ratanga na gbaloe ma, kaamɛ nan nee fan faxama. N na n ma xɔnɛ fulunma nɛ e xili ma. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" />E na e xa mixi binbie to e xa kuyee sɛɛti ma na sɛrɛxɛbadee yire geyae fari wurie bun ma e nu surayi fanyi ganma dɛnnaxɛ sɛrɛxɛ ra e xa kuyee bɛ, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" />N fama nɛ n bɛlɛxɛ italade e xili ma, e xa bɔxi fa kana kelife gbengberenyi ma han Dibila. Na kui e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa fe raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" />«I tan adamadi, wo Marigi Alatala xui nan yi ki Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, ‹Wo xa fe raɲɔnyi bara wo xa bɔxi tunxun naani birin li! <verse eid="EZK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" />A gbe mu luxi n xa n ma xɔnɛ radin wo ma, wo xa wo xa wali ɲaaxi sare sɔtɔ, wo xa fe xa ɲɔn. <verse eid="EZK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" />N mu kinikinima wo ma fefe ma. N wo xa wali kobi birin nagbilenma nɛ wo ma. Na kui wo fama nɛ a kolonde n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />«Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan yi ki, wo xa gbaloe magaaxuxi bara wo li. <verse eid="EZK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Wo xa fe raɲɔnyi bara fa, a bara wo yire li, a bara keli wo xili ma! <verse eid="EZK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" />Fe xɔrɔxɔɛ bara wo li, wo tan naxee sabatixi Isirayila bɔxi ma. N ma kiiti lɔxɔɛ bara fa. Sɛɛwɛ bara masara kɔntɔfili ra wo xa geyae fari. <verse eid="EZK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" />A gbe mu luxi n xa n ma xɔnɛ radin wo ma a ɲaaxi ra. N wo makiitima nɛ wo xa wali ɲaaxi xa fe ra, n wo xa yunubie sare ragbilen wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" />N mu kinikinima wo ma fefe ma. N wo xa wali kobi birin nagbilenma nɛ wo ma. Na kui wo fama nɛ a kolonde n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />«Na lɔxɔɛ nan yi ki! Gbaloe bara ramini alɔ fuge minima sansi wuri ma ki naxɛ. Wo xa yɛtɛ igboɲa bara dangɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Wo xa fe kobi bara findi luxusinyi ra n bɛlɛxɛ kui. Ɲama yo mu luma wo xɔnyi, e harige birin ɲɔnma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" />Kiiti waxati bara fa, na lɔxɔɛ bara a li. Saresoe naxa sɛɛwa, saremati naxa sunnun, barima Alatala xa xɔnɛ na tefe ɲama birin xili ma. <verse eid="EZK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Saresoe mu sese fima sarematie ma e xa duniɲɛigiri kui, barima Ala xa natɛ mu masarama. E birin faxama nɛ e xa yunubie xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Hali e sara fe, e gere fe yailan, mixi yo mu sigama gere sode barima n ma xɔnɛ bara din e birin na sinnanyi ma.»<verse eid="EZK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" />«Gere na taa fari ma, wuganyi nun kaamɛ na taa kui. Naxan na daaxa na faxama gere nan kui, naxan na taa kui na kanyi faxa kaamɛ nun wuganyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" />Naxee na ratanga na ma, nee sa e nɔxunma geyae nan fari. E wama nɛ alɔ kolokonde e xa yunubie xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" />E sɛnbɛ ɲɔnma nɛ, e xinbie rakori. <verse eid="EZK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" />E sunnunyi dugi nan nagoroma e ma, e e xunyi nun e dɛxabe bi yaagi kui. <verse eid="EZK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" />E gbeti nun xɛɛma wolima nɛ tande alɔ se sɛniyɛntare, kɔnɔ na sese mu findima kisi ra e bɛ Ala xa xɔnɛ lɔxɔɛ. Na naafuli mu findima donse ra e bɛ, barima a findi nɛ e ratantanse ra. <verse eid="EZK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" />E nu bara ɲɛlɛxin e xa xunmase fanyie ra, e naxee rawalixi kuye ɲaaxie yailanfe ra. Na kui n nee findima nɛ se sɛniyɛntaree ra, <verse eid="EZK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" />n nee so e yaxui ɲaaxie yi ra naxee e rawalima fe kobi ra ɲamanɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />N na n kobe soma nɛ e ra. E fama nɛ sode n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e fe sɛniyɛntare raba naa, e n ma see muɲa.»<verse eid="EZK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" />«Yɔlɔnxɔnyie xa yailan, barima wo xa bɔxi rafexi suute nun faxɛtie nan na. <verse eid="EZK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" />N mixi ɲaaxie nan nafama kelife ɲamanɛe ma, alako e xa wo xa banxie tongo, e xa wo rayaagi, e xa wo xa batudee mabere. <verse eid="EZK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" />Fe xɔrɔxɔɛ na wo li, wo bɔɲɛsa fenma nɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu na toma fefe ma. <verse eid="EZK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" />Gbaloe luma fa ra nɛ a bore fɔxɔ ra. Wo luma nɛ fe xɔrɔxɔɛ mɛ ra. Wo xibaaru fanyi fenma nɛ namiɲɔnmɛ ra, kɔnɔ marasi yo mu luma sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun forie yi ra. <verse eid="EZK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" />Mangɛ luma nɛ sunnun na, a xa kuntigie nimisa, a xa ɲama birin sɛrɛn gaaxui kui. N e makiitima e ɲɛrɛ ki nan ma, alɔ e darixi a ra ki naxɛ. Na tɛmui e a kolonma nɛ n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuye batufe Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />A ɲɛ senni nde, kike senni, xi suuli nde ra, n nu dɔxɔxi n ma banxi nan kui, Yuda forie fan nu na n sɛɛti ma. Na tɛmui Muxu Marigi Alatala naxa a sɛnbɛ masen n bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" />N naxa laamatunyi to naxan lanxi xɛmɛ nde ma naxan sanyie nu luxi alɔ tɛ, a kanke nu yanbama alɔ bafata raxunuxi. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" />A naxa a bɛlɛxɛ itala, a n xunsɛxɛ suxu. Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa n tongo, a n ite koore nun bɔxi tagi, a fa laamatunyi masen n bɛ. N naxa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi to Darisalamu. N to na sode dɛ li naxan nu na kɔɔla ma, n naxa kuye nde to naa naxan Ala raxɔnɔma. <verse eid="EZK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" />Isirayila Marigi Ala xa nɔrɛ fan nu na mɛnni, alɔ n a to ki naxɛ a singe ra fiili ma.<verse eid="EZK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Ala naxa a masen n bɛ, «I tan Adamadi, i ya ti kɔɔla biri ra.» N to n ya rasiga naa, n naxa na kuye to hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ kɔɔla biri ra, naxan Alatala raxɔnɔma. <verse eid="EZK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" />Ala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i bara Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xa wali ɲaaxi to, wali naxan a niyama n xa n makuya n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi ra? I fama nɛ fe gbɛtɛ tode naxee ɲaaxu na bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Ala naxa n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ gbɛtɛ ra. Mɛnni n naxa yale nde to tɛtɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i xa na yale raxungbo.» N to na raba, n naxa naadɛ nde to. <verse eid="EZK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «I xa so naa ɲama xa wali ɲaaxi matode.» <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" />N to so mɛnni kui, n naxa bubusee, sube raharamuxie, nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xa kuye birin xa pirinti to na banxi xalɛ rabilinyi ma. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Isirayila fori tongo solofere nun Safan xa di Yaasaniya nu na mɛnni, surayi ganse suxuxi kankan yi ra, tuuri nu fa te a fa mɛnni rafe.<verse eid="EZK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" />Ala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i bara Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ forie xa wali to, e naxan nabafe dimi kui e xa kuyee ra? E naxɛ, ‹Alatala mu won toxi feo. A bara won ma bɔxi rabolo.›» <verse eid="EZK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Ala man naxa a masen n bɛ, «I fama nɛ fe gbɛtɛ tode naxee ɲaaxu na bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Na tɛmui a naxa n xanin Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra kɔɔla mabiri. N naxa ginɛ ndee li mɛnni, e dɔxɔxi, e ɲɔnfe rabafe kuye nde bɛ naxan xili Tamusu. <verse eid="EZK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i bara a to? I fama nɛ fe gbɛtɛ tode naxee ɲaaxu na bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />A naxa n naso Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa tɛtɛ kui. N naxa mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli to hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra, gbutunyi nun sɛrɛxɛbade tagi, e kobe soxi Alatala xa banxi ra, e ya rafindixi sogetede ma e nu suyidi soge bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" />Ala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, i bara a to? Fe xuri di nan yi ra Yudayakae na naxee rabafe be? E man na fe ɲaaxi nan nabama bɔxi birin kui, fe naxan n naxɔnɔma han. A mato e na kuye salonsee sunbufe ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" />Na kui n na n gbe ɲɔxɔma n ma xɔnɛ kui. N mu kinikinima e ma, n mu gbilenma na ɲaxankatɛ fɔxɔ ra. Hali e n maxandi e xui itexi ra, n mu n tuli matima e ra fefe ma.»<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuye batuie xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Na tɛmui n naxa Ala xui itexi mɛ, a naxɛ, «Taa kantamae, wo xa fa wo xa geresosee ra!» <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" />Xɛmɛ senni naxa mini naadɛ fuge biri ra, naadɛ naxan ya rafindixi kɔɔla ma, birin nun a xa geresose ra a bɛlɛxɛ i. Xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ nu na e ya ma, dugi fiixɛ ragoroxi a ma, sɛbɛli ti se nu na a bɛlɛxɛ i. E naxa fa, e ti sɛrɛxɛbade fɛ ma, naxan yailanxi wure gbeeli ra.<verse eid="EZK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />Isirayila Marigi Ala xa nɔrɛ naxa keli malekɛe sawurɛe xun, a nu magoroxi naxee fari, a a xun ti banxi sode dɛ ra. Alatala naxa na xɛmɛ xili dugi fiixɛ ragoroxi naxan ma, sɛbɛli ti se nu na naxan bɛlɛxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" />a a masen a bɛ, «I xa i ɲɛrɛ Darisalamu taa kui tɔnxuma safe ra xɛmɛe birin tigi ra, naxee na tɔɔrɔfe, naxee na wafe yi fe ɲaaxie xa fe ra naxee rabama Darisalamu.»<verse eid="EZK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />A man naxa a masen a booree bɛ n ya xɔri, «Wo bira yi xɛmɛ fɔxɔ ra, wo xa faxɛ ti kinikinitareɲa kui! <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" />Wo xa mixi birin faxa, forie, sɛgɛtalae, sungbutunyie, ginɛe nun dimɛdie. Kɔnɔ tɔnxuma na naxee tigi ma, wo nee lu na! Wo xa yi wali fɔlɔ n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi yire.» Na kui e naxa na forie faxa naxee nu tixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi ya ra. <verse eid="EZK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />A man naxa a masen e bɛ, «Hali a findixi fe sɛniyɛntare nan na, wo xa n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa tɛtɛ rafe binbie ra! Yakɔsi, wo siga!» Na kui e naxa mini, e faxɛ belebele ti taa kui.<verse eid="EZK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" />E nu faxɛ tima tɛmui naxɛ, n naxa n felen bɔxi ma n keren. N nu n mawafe Ala bɛ a falafe ra, «N Marigi Alatala, i wama Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin sɔntɔfe nɛ i xa xɔnɛ kui naxan na tefe Darisalamu taa kui?» <verse eid="EZK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />A naxa n yaabi, «Isirayila nun Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa yunubi gbo! E luma faxɛ ti ra tɛmui birin, e fe tinxintaree raba bɔxi birin kui. E naxɛ, ‹Alatala bara yi bɔxi rabolo, a mu won ma fe toma sɔnɔn.› <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" />Na kui n mu kinikinima e ma fefe ma. N e xa wali ɲaaxi sare ragbilenma nɛ e ma a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra.»<verse eid="EZK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Na tɛmui na xɛmɛ dugi fiixɛ ragoroxi naxan ma, sɛbɛli ti se suxuxi naxan yi ra, a naxa gbilen, a dɛntɛgɛ sa a xɛɛma bɛ, «N bara gɛ i xa yaamari rabade.»<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa nɔrɛ xa keli a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />Na laamatunyi kui n naxa kibanyi nde to malekɛe xun ma naxan nu luxi alɔ diyaman maniyɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" />Alatala naxa a masen xɛmɛ bɛ dugi fiixɛ nu ragoroxi naxan ma, «I xa so malekɛe bun ma, sanyi radigilinxie na dɛnnaxɛ, i xa tɛ wolee tongo, i e rayensen taa ma.» A naxa na raba n ya xɔri.<verse eid="EZK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" />Na malekɛe nu tixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi yirefanyi ma na xɛmɛ so tɛmui naxɛ. Kunda nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" />Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa keli na malekɛe xun ma, a siga hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra. Kunda naxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi rafe, Alatala xa nɔrɛ xa yanbɛ fanyi nu na tɛtɛ birin kui. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" />Na malekɛe gabutenyie xui nu mɛma boore tɛtɛ kui, a nu gbo alɔ Ala Sɛnbɛma wɔyɛn xui.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />Alatala to xɛmɛ yamari, dugi fiixɛ nu ragoroxi naxan ma, a xa tɛ wolee tongo se digilinxie tagi malekɛe bun ma, a naxa so, a sa ti naa. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7" />Na malekɛ keren naxa tɛ wole ndee kɔ, a a sa na xɛmɛ bɛlɛxɛ i. Na naxa a rasuxu, a mini. <verse eid="EZK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8" />Mixi bɛlɛxɛ maniyɛ nan nu minima na malekɛe gabutenyie bun ma.<verse eid="EZK 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" />N naxa sanyi radigilinxi naani to malekɛe fɛ ma, keren keren nu na kankan bun ma. E nu mayanbama alɔ diyaman maniyɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Na sanyi radigilinxi naani birin nu maniya, kankan luxi alɔ a nu na sanyi radigilinxi gbɛtɛ nan kui. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" />E nɛ sigama, malekɛ yatagi nu tixi dɛnnaxɛ ra e nu e ɲɛrɛma mɛnni biri nɛ, hali na sanyi to nu a mafindima. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" />Yae nu na na malekɛ naanie birin fatee ma, a nun e farie ma, e bɛlɛxɛe ma, e gabutenyie ma, nun e sanyi radigilinxi naanie ma <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" />N naxa a mɛ, e na sanyi radigilinxie xilima «sanyi firi firi.» <verse eid="EZK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" />Yatagi naani nan nu na na malekɛe birin bɛ. Keren nu luxi nɛ alɔ malekɛ yatagi, a firin nde nu luxi nɛ alɔ mixi yatagi, a saxan nde nu luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ yatagi, a naani nde nu luxi nɛ alɔ sɛgɛ yatagi.<verse eid="EZK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />Na tɛmui na malekɛe naxa keli. E nu maniyaxi na daalisee nan na n nu bara naxee to Kebara xure dɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" />Na malekɛe nɛ e ɲɛrɛma, e nun na sanyi radigilinxie nan a ra. E na e gabutenyie itala e xa keli, e nun na sanyie nan a ra. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" />E na ti, e nun e sanyie nan a ra, e na te, e nun e sanyie nan a ra, barima na daalisee nii nu na e sanyi radigilinxie nan kui.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />Na tɛmui Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa keli hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra, a sa a magoro na malekɛe xun ma. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" />E naxa e gabutenyie itala, e keli bɔxi ma n ya xɔri e nun e sanyi radigilinxie ra. E naxa e sa ti Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi dɛ ra sogetede biri ra. Isirayila Marigi Ala xa nɔrɛ nu na e xun ma.<verse eid="EZK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />A raɲɔnyi n naxa a kolon n na daalise naani n naxee toxi Kebara xure dɛ ra, e nu maniyaxi malekɛe nan na. <verse eid="EZK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" />Yatagi naani nun gabutenyi naani nu na e birin ma. Bɛlɛxɛe fan nu na e gabutenyie bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" />E yatagie nu maniyaxi yatagie nan na n naxee to Kebara xure dɛ ra. E birin nu sigama yare nan tun.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu xa ɲaxankatɛ nun Isirayila xa bɔɲɛ masarɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />Na tɛmui Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa n tongo mɛnni, a n xanin Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ ra, naxan na sogetede biri ra. Xɛmɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nu na mɛnni. Ɲama kuntigie Asuru xa di Yaasaniya nun Bɛnaya xa di Pɛlataya fan nu na e ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Adamadi, yi mixie na fe ɲaaxi kui. E wama ɲama ratantanfe e xa marasi ra. <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" />E naxɛ, ‹Hali won mu banxi ti, barima yi taa luxi nɛ alɔ tunde won ɲinma naxan kui.› <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />Na kui i tan adamadi, i xa n ma wɔyɛnyi radangi e ma.»<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />Na tɛmui Alatala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro n ma, a yi masenyi ti n bɛ n xa a radangi e ma, «Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Wo tan Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, n wo xa maɲɔxunyi kolon. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Wo bara mixi gbegbe faxa yi taa kui, wo bara e binbie lu kira ra. <verse eid="EZK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" />Na kui n tan, wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Wo binbie naxee wolixi kira ra, e findixi subee nan na naxan fama gande yi tunde kui, kɔnɔ n wo tan kerima nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" />Wo to gaaxuxi gere ya ra, n gere rafama nɛ wo ma! N tan Alatala xui nan ya. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" />N wo raminima nɛ taa kui, n wo sa si gbɛtɛ sagoe. Na nan findima wo xa ɲaxankatɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" />Wo faxama gere nan kui Isirayila naaninyi ra. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" />Yi taa mu findima wo bɛ tunde ra, wo tan mu findima sube ra naxan ganma be taa kui. N wo tan makiitima Isirayila naaninyi nan na. <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" />Wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra, wo tondi birade naxan xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra. Wo bara n ma sɛriyɛ rabolo, wo bira si gbɛtɛe xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />N to gɛ na masenyi falade, Bɛnaya xa di Pɛlataya naxa faxa. N naxa n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma keren na, n fa a fala n xui itexi ra, «N Marigi Alatala, i wama Isirayila mixi dɔnxɔɛ birin sɔntɔfe nɛ?» <verse eid="EZK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />Alatala naxa n yaabi, <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />«Adamadi, Darisalamukae na a falafe i baribooree nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin bɛ e xa e makuya Alatala ra, barima e naxɛ yi bɔxi findixi e gbe nan na. <verse eid="EZK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" />Na kui i xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Alatala xa masenyi nan ya. Hali n e makuya, n e xanin ɲamanɛe ma, n luma nɛ e sɛɛti ma mɛnni fan.›»<verse eid="EZK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" />«I xa yi masenyi ti: ‹Wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya. N wo malanma nɛ kelife ɲamanɛe tagi wo yensenxi dɛnnaxɛ, n man Isirayila bɔxi so wo yi ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" />«E gbilenma nɛ e xa bɔxi ma, e fa kuye ɲaaxie birin ba naa. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" />N e bɔɲɛ findima bɔɲɛ keren nan na. N xaxili nɛɛnɛ so e yi ra. N e xa bɔɲɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ bama nɛ, n bɔɲɛ fanyi so e yi ra, <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" />alako e xa bira n ma yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, e xa n ma sɛriyɛ binya. E findima n ma ɲama nan na fa, n tan findi e Marigi Ala ra. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" />Kɔnɔ mixi naxee birama e xa kuye batufe fɔxɔ ra, n e xa wali ɲaaxi sare ragbilenma nɛ e ma. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />Na tɛmui na malekɛe naxa e gabutenyie itala nun e sanyi radigilinxie, Isirayila Marigi Alatala xa nɔrɛ nu na e xun ma. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" />Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa keli taa kui, a sa a magoro geya fari naxan nu na sogetede. <verse eid="EZK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" />Na laamatunyi kui, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa n tongo mɛnni, a n xanin Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ yire naxan nu na konyiya kui Kalide bɔxi ma. Laamatunyi to ɲɔn, <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />n naxa Alatala xa masenyi birin nadangi e ma, a naxee masen n bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s">Taali konyiya xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" />«Adamadi, i na bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi nan tagi yi ki. E ya na na, kɔnɔ e mu se toma. E tuli na na, kɔnɔ e mu fe mɛma, barima bɔnsɔɛ murutɛla nan e ra. <verse eid="EZK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" />Adamadi, i naxan nabama, i xa kote yailan alɔ i na sigafe konyiya nan kui. I xa mini e ya xɔri yanyi xare ra alɔ mixi suxuxi naxan xaninfe ɲamanɛ ma. Na kui, hali e findixi bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi nan na, e fama nɛ fahaamui sɔtɔde i xa taali kui. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />I xa i xa kote yailan yanyi ra e ya xɔri. Nunmare tɛmui i xa mini taa kui e ya xɔri alɔ i na sigafe konyiya nan kui ɲamanɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />I xa yale ti taa tɛtɛ ma e ya xɔri, i fa mini na kui a nun i xa kote. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" />I xa i xa kote dɔxɔ i tunki ma e ya xɔri, i mini nunmare tɛmui. I xa i yatagi makoto alako i naxa nɔ bɔxi tode. Na birin bara findi tɔnxuma ra Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />N naxa na raba alɔ Ala a masen n bɛ ki naxɛ. N naxa n ma kote yailan yanyi xare ra. Nunmare ra, n naxa yale ti taa tɛtɛ ma n bɛlɛxɛ ra, n fa mini n ma kote ra e ya xɔri. <verse eid="EZK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />Na kuye iba, Alatala naxa n maxɔrin, <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" />«Adamadi, yi bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi mu i maxɔrin nu, i na fe naxan nabafe? <verse eid="EZK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi: Yi kiiti saxi Darisalamu mangɛe nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nan birin ma naxee sabatixi be.› <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" />A fala e bɛ, ‹N tan findixi wo bɛ tɔnxuma nan na. N naxan nabaxi na ki, na nan fama rabade wo fan na. E wo suxuma nɛ, e wo xanin konyiya kui ɲamanɛ ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" />«Mangɛ naxan na e xun ma, a a xa kote dɔxɔma a tunki nan ma nunmare tɛmui, a a gi. E yale tima nɛ taa tɛtɛ ma alako a xa mini na ra. A a yatagi makotoma nɛ alako a naxa bɔxi to. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" />N na n ma yɛlɛ italama nɛ a xun ma, n ma gantanyi a suxu. N a xaninma nɛ Babilɔn, Kalidi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma, kɔnɔ a mu mɛnni toma a ya ra. A faxama naa. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" />N fama nɛ a xa mixi birin nayensende, a xa kuntigie nun a xa sɔɔrie. N e birin nakerima nɛ santidɛgɛma ra.»<verse eid="EZK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />«N na e keri ɲamanɛe ma duniɲa yire birin, e a kolonma nɛ na kui a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" />Kɔnɔ n mixi ndee ratangama nɛ e ya ma gere kui, n e ratanga kaamɛ nun wuganyi ma, alako e xa nɔ e xa wali kobie mataalide si gbɛtɛe bɛ e na lu dɛnnaxɛ. E a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" />«Adamadi, i nɛ i dɛgema tɛmui naxɛ, i xa sɛrɛn gaaxui ra. I nɛ ye minma tɛmui naxɛ, i imaxa kɔntɔfili ra. <verse eid="EZK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" />A fala ɲama bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi Darisalamukae nun Isirayilakae xa fe ra. A naxɛ e e dɛgema gaaxui nan kui, e ye min kɔntɔfili ra, barima gbaloe ɲaaxi a niyama nɛ harige birin ba e xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" />Taae kanama nɛ, bɔxi xara. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" />«Adamadi, munse na yi taali wɔyɛnyi ra, naxan na falafe wo tagi Isirayila bɔxi ma? Na taali naxɛ, ‹Lɔxɔɛe na e ikuyafe de, kɔnɔ Alatala xa laamatunyi mu kamalixi fefe ma.› <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi: N fama nɛ na taali wɔyɛnyi ifalɛ dande. Mixi yo mu na falama sɔnɔn Isirayila bɔxi ma.› A fala e bɛ, ‹A gbe mu luxi laamatunyi birin xa kamali. <verse eid="EZK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" />Wule laamatunyi nun wule masenyi ɲɔnma nɛ sematoe yi ra Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" />Kɔnɔ n tan Alatala na naxan masen, na kamalima nɛ a waxati ma. N fama n ma masenyi rakamalide wo tan murutɛlae nan bɛ. Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />Alatala naxa a masen bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" />«Adamadi, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ luma nɛ a fala ra i xa laamatunyi fe masen naxan buma a fa raba. A naxɛ namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi mu kamalima fo ɲɛ wuyaxi na dangi. <verse eid="EZK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" />Na kui, a fala e bɛ, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi: N mu dugundima n ma masenyi rakamalide sɔnɔn. N naxan masenxi, na fama nɛ rabade. Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s">Sematoe wule falɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" />«Adamadi, i xa masenyi ti n xili ra Isirayila namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ. A fala e bɛ, naxee masenyi tima e yɛtɛ bɔɲɛ ma fe ma, i naxɛ, ‹Wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra! <verse eid="EZK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Ɲaxankatɛ na namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛe bɛ, naxee birama e yɛtɛ xaxili fɔxɔ ra, e mu laamatunyi yo toxi. <verse eid="EZK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />Isirayila, wo xa namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛe luma nɛ alɔ xulumasee banxi kanaxi kui. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" />Wo mu Isirayila xa tɛtɛ yailanxi alako a xa ti gere kui Alatala xa lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" />E xa laamatunyie findixi wule nan na. E xa masenyi mu findixi nɔndi ra fefe ma. E naxɛ, Alatala xui nan na ki, a fa li Alatala xa mu e xɛɛxi. E wama na xa kamali tun. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Fu xa mu na wo xa laamatunyie nun wo xa masenyie ra? Wo a falama, Ala xui nan na ki, a fa li n tan Ala xa xui mu a ra!›»<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi wo xa fe ra, a naxɛ: ‹N bara keli wo xili ma wo xa wule masenyie nun wo xa wule laamatunyie xa fe ra. Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" />N na n bɛlɛxɛ italama nɛ namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛe bɛ, naxee wule laamatunyie nun wule masenyie xa fe falama. E mu luma n ma ɲama kuntigie ya ma, e xili bama nɛ Isirayila xa taruxui kui, e mu soma Isirayila bɔxi ma sɔnɔn. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" />«E to fa na n ma ɲama ralɔɛfe nɛ na ki a falafe ra, ‹Wo bɔɲɛ xa sa,› kɔnɔ a fa li gbaloe na na. E tɛtɛ kobi nan ti, e fa a pɛnti a fiixɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" />A fala e bɛ na tɛtɛ birama nɛ. Turunnaadɛ nun tunɛ xungbe na fa, balabalanyi goroma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />Na tɛtɛ na bira, a mu falama xɛ wo bɛ, ‹Wo mu a pɛntixi xɛ? Munse fa niyaxi?›»<verse eid="EZK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹N turunnaadɛ xungbe radinma nɛ wo ma n ma xɔnɛ kui, tunɛ belebele nun balabalanyi sinma nɛ wo ma sɛnbɛ ra, a kasarɛ ti. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />N tɛtɛ rabirama nɛ, wo naxan pɛntixi, n a sanbunyi maba. A na bira wo ma, wo faxa a bun ma. Na tɛmui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />N na n ma xɔnɛ birin naminima nɛ na tɛtɛ ma, nun mixi naxee a pɛntixi. N a falama nɛ wo bɛ, Tɛtɛ mu na sɔnɔn, naxee fan a pɛntixi, nee fan mu na sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" />Nee findixi na namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛe nan na, naxee nu wɔyɛnma Darisalamu xa fe ra, a bɔɲɛsa xa fe fala e bɛ, a fa li gbaloe nan tun nu na fafe e ma. Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />«Yakɔsi adamadi, i ya rafindi i xa ɲama xa ginɛ dimɛdie ma, naxee namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi tima e yɛtɛ bɔɲɛ ma fe ma. I xa masenyi ti e xili ma, <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />a falafe ra, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi e bɛ, «Ɲaxankatɛ na ginɛe bɛ naxee bɛlɛxɛkɔnnasoe yailanma karafili ra, xa na mu a ra e mafelenyie yailan mixi ratantanfe ra. Wo a maɲɔxunxi nɛ a wo na n ma mixie ratantan, wo mu tɔɔrɛ sɔtɔma na kui? <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" />Wo bara n mabere donse di xa fe ra. Wo to wule fala n ma ɲama bɛ naxan a tuli matima wule ra, wo bara mixi faxa naxan mu nu lanma a xa faxa, wo bara mixi lu naa naxan mu nu lanma a xa lu naa.»›»<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹Wo xa karafilie mu rafan n ma, wo mixi ratantanma naxan na alɔ gantanyi sama xɔnie bɛ ki naxɛ. N na karafilie bama nɛ wo bɛlɛxɛe ra, n xɔrɛya fima nɛ mixi ma wo naxan suxu gantanyi kui alɔ xɔnie. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />N wo xa mafelenyie bama nɛ wo ma, n na n ma ɲama ba wo xa nɔɛ bun ma. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" />Wo bara limaniya ba tinxintɔɛe yi ra wo xa wulee ra, n nu wama naxan malife. Wo bara tinxintare rasi e xa lu e xa fe ɲaaxie kui, n nu wama naxan nakisife. <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" />Wo to na mɔɔli raba, wo mu wule masenyi tife sɔnɔn, wo mu luma sematoe xa wali kui. N fama nɛ n ma ɲama ratangade wo bɛlɛxɛ. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa katɛ Isirayila bɔɲɛ ragbilenfe a ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />Isirayila fori ndee naxa fa n xɔnyi. E to dɔxɔ, <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" />«Adamadi, yi mixie bara kuyee fe tongo e a sa e nii ra, e fe ɲaaxie suxu naxee e rabirama. A lanma n xa tin e xa n maxandi? <verse eid="EZK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Isirayilaka naxan yo kuye fe sa a nii ra, a fe ɲaaxi suxu naxan a rabirama, a na siga namiɲɔnmɛ yire Ala maxandide, n a xa duba mafindima a xa yunubi raba xasabi nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />N yi rabama nɛ alako n xa Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɔɲɛ rafindi n ma, hali e to bara e makuya n na e xa kuye batufe ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />«A fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Wo tuubi, wo gbilen wo xa kuye batufe fɔxɔ ra, wo wo kobe so wo xa fe ɲaaxie ra! <verse eid="EZK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />Isirayilakae birin, xa na mu a ra wo xa xɔɲɛe, mixi yo naxan kuye fe sama a nii ra, a fe ɲaaxi suxu naxan a rabirama, na kanyi na siga namiɲɔnmɛ yire n maxandife ra, n tan Alatala yati fama na kanyi yaabide. <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" />N tima nɛ a kanke, n a findima misaali nan na ɲama bɛ, a xili findi konbi ra e ya ma. N a kerima nɛ n ma ɲama ya ma. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" />«Xa na namiɲɔnmɛ fa tin masenyi falade n xili ra, n tan yati bara a madaxu a xa na raba. Na kui n na n bɛlɛxɛ itala a xili ma, n a xa fe xun nakana n ma ɲama Isirayila ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />E bara yunubi sɔtɔ na kui, namiɲɔnmɛ yo, nun mixi yo naxan maxandi tima a saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" />Na tɛmui Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ mu luma e makuya ra n na, e sɛniyɛntareɲa bɛɲinma nɛ. E findima nɛ n ma ɲama ra, n fan findi e Marigi Ala ra. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" />«Adamadi, xa ɲama nde n bɛɲin e xa yunubie xa fe ra, n fama nɛ n bɛlɛxɛ italade e xili ma, n e xa baloe ɲɔn, n kaamɛ radin e ma, n e xa mixie nun e xa xurusee faxa. <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" />Hali Annabi Nuha, Annabi Daniyɛli, nun Annabi Ayuba nu na e ya ma nu, ɲama nɔma kiside e xa tinxinyi gbansan nan saabui ra. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" />«Xa n sube xaaɲɛe radin na bɔxi ma e xa dimɛe faxa, mixi birin xa keli naa na subee xa fe ra, <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" />hali na namiɲɔnmɛ saxan sa lu naa, n tan wo Marigi Alatala bara n kali, ɲama mu nɔma e xa die rakiside. Na namiɲɔnmɛe gbansan nan kisima, bɔxikae tan lɔɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" />«Xa n gere rabula na bɔxi ma, n fa a fala ‹Santidɛgɛma xa be kana,› n fa a niya na bɔxikae nun e xa xurusee birin xa sɔntɔ, <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" />hali na namiɲɔnmɛ saxan sa lu naa, n tan wo Marigi Alatala bara n kali, ɲama mu nɔma e xa die rakiside. Na namiɲɔnmɛe gbansan nan kisima.»<verse eid="EZK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" />«Xa n wuganyi radin na bɔxi ma e xa mixi birin nun e xa xurusee faxa fe ra n ma xɔnɛ xa fe ma, <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" />hali Annabi Nuha, Annabi Daniyɛli, nun Annabi Ayuba sa lu naa, n tan wo Marigi Alatala bara n kali, ɲama mu nɔma e xa die rakiside. Ɲama nɔma kiside e xa tinxinyi gbansan nan saabui ra.»<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />«Wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: Wo xa fe xɔrɔxɔma nɛ dangife na tan na n na n ma kasarɛ naani ti wo bɛ, naxee findixi gere, kaamɛ, sube xaaɲɛe, nun wuganyi ra. Na birin wo xa mixie nun wo xa xurusee sɔntɔma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" />Kɔnɔ wo xa di ndee fama nɛ ratangade na ma. E fama nɛ wo yire, wo fa sɛɛwa e ɲɛrɛ ki matofe ra, wo fa madundu gbaloe xa fe ra n naxan nagirixi Darisalamu ma. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" />Wo madundui sɔtɔma nɛ e ɲɛrɛ ki matofe ra, barima wo fama nɛ a kolonde a n na birin naba fe nde nan ma. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ: <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" />«Adamadi, wɛni bili fan fɔtɔnyi wuri salonyi bɛ? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Wɛni bili wuri rawalima a xa findi se gbaku se ra, xa na mu a ra se gbɛtɛ naxan tide na na? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" />Na wuri mɔɔli na gan, keli a xunyi ma han a sa dɔxɔ a xɔrɛ ra, a nɔma rawalide se nde ra fa? <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />Xa a mu nu nɔma rawalide se nde ra a to nu sixi, a na gan, tide yo mu luma a ma sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="EZK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />«Na kui, wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: N fe rabama nɛ Darisalamukae ra, alɔ n fe naxan naba na wɛni bili wuri ra n naxan ganxi. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" />N tima nɛ e kanke. Hali e mini tɛ i, na tɛ fanma e donde. N na ti e kanke ma, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" />N e xa bɔxi xun nakanama nɛ, barima e bara n yanfa. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa yɛnɛ Ala mabiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi ti n bɛ, a naxɛ: <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" />«Adamadi, Darisalamu rakolon a xa fe kobie ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />A fala a bɛ, ‹I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: I barixi Kanaan bɔxi nan ma, Amorika nan nu na i baba ra, i nga findixi Xitika nan na. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />I barixi lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, mixi yo mu wo furixuli xaba, e mu i maxa ye nun fɔxɛ ra alako i xa sɛniyɛn, e mu i mafilin dugi kui. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Mixi yo mu kinikini i ma na fe mɔɔli rabafe ra. E i wɔli burunyi, barima i nu maɲaaxin birin bɛ.›»<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />«N nu na dangife i yire tɛmui naxɛ, n naxa i to i na i nii magagafe i saxi wuli xɔɔra. N naxa a fala i bɛ, ‹I xa kisi.› <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />N naxa i ramɔ alɔ sansi mɔma ki naxɛ. I bara findi ginɛdimɛdi tofanyi ra. I fate bara mɔ, i xunsɛxɛ bara kuya, kɔnɔ han na tɛmui dugi mu nu ragoroxi i ma. I mageli nan nu a ra.»<verse eid="EZK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />«Tɛmui nde to dangi, n naxa a to i findixi sungbutunyi ra. Na kui n naxa n ma dugi sanbunyi felen i ma i suturafe ra, a findi saatɛ ra won tagi. Na kui i findixi n tan nan gbe ra, i Marigi Alatala.»<verse eid="EZK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />«N naxa i maxa ye ra, n wuli ba i ma, n fa ture xiri fanyi so i ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />N naxa dugi fanyi dɛgɛ i bɛ, n na ragoro i ma. N naxan sankiri fanyi so i sanyi. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" />N naxa i raxunma bɛlɛxɛ rasoe nun kɔnmagore ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />N naxa xurundɛ sa i ɲɔɛ ra, n tulirasoe sa i tulie ra, n mangɛ tɔnxuma dusu i xun na. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />I nu raxunmaxi xɛɛma nun gbeti nan na, i nu maxirixi dugi tofanyie nan na, i nu donse fanyi donma naxan findi kumi nun ture ra. I xa tofanyi xun nu fa masa tun, mangɛya naxa radaxa i bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" />I xili naxa din ɲamanɛe ra i xa tofanyi xa fe ra, barima tofanyi kamalixi nan nu a ra i xa nɔrɛ saabui ra n naxan fixi i ma. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />«Kɔnɔ na tɛmui i naxa la fɔlɔ i xa tofanyi nun i xili fanyi ra, i fa so langoeɲa rabafe. I nu i yɛtɛ soma mixi birin yi ra, i lu e sagoe. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />I naxa i xa dugi tofanyie itala geya fari i langoeɲa raba dɛnnaxɛ. Na fe mɔɔli mu lanma feo. Na rabafe mu fan. <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" />I naxa i xa xunmase xɛɛma nun gbeti daaxie tongo, n naxee fixi i ma, i e yailan kuye xɛmɛe ra, i fa langoeɲa raba nee ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" />I naxa i xa dugi tofanyie ragoro e ma, i fa n ma ture nun n ma surayi ba sɛrɛxɛ ra e bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />N donse naxan so i yi ra, i bara na taami fanyi, na ture, nun na kumi birin ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra e bɛ. I na nan nabaxi. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" />«I naxa i xa die tongo, n naxee fixi i ma, i e fan ba sɛrɛxɛ ra na kuyee bɛ. I xa langoeɲa mu nu i wasama nu? <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />I bara n ma die kɔn naxaba, i e ba sɛrɛxɛ ra kuyee bɛ! <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" />I xa fe kobie nun i xa langoeɲa birin kui, i mu ratu a ma n naxan nabaxi i bɛ i mageli to nu a ra, i nu i nii magagafe i wuli xɔɔra tɛmui naxɛ?»<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23" />«Ɲaxankatɛ na i bɛ! Alatala xui nan na ki. Safe i xa wali ɲaaxi xun ma, i bara fe gbɛtɛ fan naba. <verse eid="EZK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24" />I bara yiree ti taa tagi kira dɛ ra, <verse eid="EZK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />i fa i fate xa tofanyi masen ɲama bɛ kɛnɛ ma, alɔ langoe naxan wama xɛmɛ mabɛndunfe a ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" />I bara langoeɲa raba Misirakae ra, i dɔxɔboore naxee xa ginɛ fe xɔrɔxɔ. I xa langoeɲa radangixi bara n naxɔnɔ. <verse eid="EZK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" />Na kui n bara n bɛlɛxɛ itala i xili ma, n fa nde ba i xa bɔxi ra, n a sa i yaxuie Filisitakae sagoe, i xa wali kobie xa fe ra naxee bara e ratɛrɛnna. <verse eid="EZK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" />I bara langoeɲa raba Asiriyakae fan na, barima sese mu i wasama. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" />Na dangi xanbi i bara langoeɲa raba Babilɔn yulɛe ra, kɔnɔ nee fan mu i wasa.»<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />«I bɔɲɛ kobi! Alatala xui nan na ki. I yi langoeɲa mɔɔli rabama di? <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" />I to i xa langoe yiree ti taa kui kira dɛ ra, i mu nu luxi alɔ langoe yati barima i nu langoeɲa rabafe nɛ tun kɔbiri xanbi!»<verse eid="EZK 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />«Yɛnɛ ginɛ, xɔɲɛe rafan i ma dangife i xa mɔri ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Langoe birin wama langoe sare xɔn, kɔnɔ i tan nan luma i ɲɛngɛe ki ra, alako i xa e mabɛndun i ma a mɔɔli birin na. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />I mu luxi alɔ langoe gbɛtɛe. Mixi yo mu i mayandima i xa wali ra. I tan nan e mayandima, i fa e sare fi, i mu se sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />«I tan langoe ginɛ, i tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra! <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" />I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: I to i xa naafuli ba alako i xa langoeɲa raba i ɲɛngɛe ra, i to kuyee mɔɔli birin ti, i fa i xa die wuli ba sɛrɛxɛ ra e bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" />n fama nɛ i ɲɛngɛe birin malande, naxee nu rafan i ma nun naxee mu nu rafan i ma, n i ɲaibɔɛ masen e bɛ a kɛnɛ ma, i xa yaagi. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" />N i makiitima nɛ alɔ ginɛ yɛnɛla nun faxɛti makiitima ki naxɛ. N nan n gbe ɲɔxɔma nɛ i ma n ma xɔnɛ nun n ma tɔɔnɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" />Na tɛmui n i sama nɛ i ɲɛngɛe sagoe, e i xa langoe yiree kana, e i xa dugie nun i xa xunmasee ba i ma, e fa i lu i mageli ra fɔɛn. <verse eid="EZK 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" />E e malanma nɛ i xili ma, e i magɔnɔ gɛmɛe ra, e i masɔxɔ e xa santidɛgɛmae ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" />E i xa banxie ganma nɛ, e i ɲaxankata ginɛ gbegbe ya xɔri. N i xa langoeɲa danma nɛ, i mu i ɲɛngɛe kima sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" />N na gɛ na rabade i ra, n ma xɔnɛ goroma nɛ i xa yanfanteya xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" />«N fama nɛ i xa wali sare birin nagbilende i ma, barima i mu i ratu i fonike tɛmui ma. I Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. I mu langoeɲa xa sa i xa fe kobi gbɛtɛe fari?»<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />«Taali falɛe fama yi taali falade i xun ma, ‹Nga lu ki yo ki, a xa di ginɛ fan luma na ki nɛ!› <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" />I nga xa di yati nan i ra, naxan mɛ a xa mɔri nun a xa die ra. I taara ginɛmae fan mɛ nɛ e xa mɔrie ra, nun e xa die ra. I nga findixi Xitika nan na, i baba findixi Amorika nan na. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" />Samari findixi i taara ginɛma nan na naxan sabatixi i kɔɔla ma, a nun a xa taa gbɛtɛe kui. Sodoma nan findixi i xunya ginɛma ra naxan sabatixi i yirefanyi ma, a nun a xa taa gbɛtɛe ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" />I bara bira e xa wali ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra, i man bara ɲaaxu dangife e tan na. <verse eid="EZK 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" />N bara n kali, Sodoma nun a xa taae mu i xa ɲaaxuɲa lixi. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 16:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" />«I xunya Sodoma xa yunubie findixi yi nan na: yɛtɛ igboɲa, bannaya, nun kinikinitareɲa tɔɔrɔmixie mabiri. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" />E dɛ igbo, e fe ɲaaxie rabama n ya xɔri. Na kui, n naxa e xa fe ɲɔn! <verse eid="EZK 16:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" />Samari mu yunubi raba alɔ i tan. I xa fe kobi raba gbo dangi a gbe ra pon! Na taa ɲaaxi tinxin i bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />I xa yaagi tun! I xa ɲaaxuɲa kui, a luxi nɛ alɔ i xunyae na fisa i bɛ. I xa na kote xanin.»<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />«Kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi, n fama nɛ Sodoma nun a xa taae nun Samari nun a xa taae xa fe xun nakelide. I fan luma nɛ na xunnakeli kui. <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" />I bara yaagi sɔtɔ i xa wali kobi xa fe ra. Na bara a niya Sodoma nun Samari xili xa fan dondoronti. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />I xunya Sodoma nun a xa taae nun i taara Samari nun a xa taae xun nakelima nɛ alɔ singe. I fan nun i xa taae luma na xunnakeli nan kui. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56" />I nu i yɛtɛ igboma tɛmui naxɛ, i mu tin fe fanyi falade i xunya Sodoma xa fe ra, <verse eid="EZK 16:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57" />beenun i xa ɲaaxuɲa xa sa kɛnɛ ma. Yakɔsi Edon nun a xa taae nun Filisita nun a xa taae, e birin i maberema. <verse eid="EZK 16:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" />Na langoeɲa nun fe kobie yaagi luma nɛ i ma. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />«I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N i sare ragbilenma nɛ i ma sɛriyɛ ki ma, barima i bara n ma kali mabere n ma saatɛ kanafe ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" />Kɔnɔ n tan mu nɛɛmuma won ma saatɛ ma, won naxan tongo i fonike tɛmui. N fama nɛ saatɛ tongode i bɛ naxan mu ɲɔnma abadan. <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" />Na kui, i taara nun i xunya na gbilen i ma, i ratuma nɛ i xa kira ɲaaxi ma yaagi ra. N e fima nɛ i ma, kɔnɔ na fe mu na won ma saatɛ singe kui. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />N saatɛ tongoma nɛ i bɛ, i a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" />N na gɛ i xun sarade i xa yunubie xa fe ra, i fama nɛ ratude fe dangixie ma yaagi kui, i fa i dɛ ragali i xa yaagi xa fe ra. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s">Taali wɔyɛnyi Isirayila bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" />«Adamadi, i xa yi taali fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Won Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Sɛgɛ xungbe, gabutenyi sɛnbɛmae, xabe kuye tofanxie, naxa fa Liban, a sɛdiri bili salonyi bolon a kɔn na. <verse eid="EZK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4" />A naxa na xanin yulɛ bɔxi ma, a a si e xa taa kui.›»<verse eid="EZK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" />«A naxa sansi xɔri nde tongo Isirayila bɔxi ma, a sa na si bɔxi fanyi ma, ye gboxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />Na sansi xɔri naxa bula, a findi wɛni sansi dunke ra naxan salonyie nu kuyama a gbe ra. A salonyie nu fa e ramaxa koore ma, a sanke nu goro ye fenfe ra. Na sansie naxa fan, a salonyie naxa wuya a burɛxɛe naxa fan.»<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />«Sɛgɛ xungbe gbɛtɛ naxa mini naa ra, a gabutenyie xungbo, a xabee wuya. Wɛni bili naxa a sankee nun a salonyie raɲɛrɛ kelife bɔxi ma a nu sixi dɛnnaxɛ, sigafe ra sɛgɛ mabiri ye sɔtɔfe ra. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />A nu sixi bɔxi fanyi nan ma, ye gbegbe nu na dɛnnaxɛ, alako a xa findi a ra, a wɛni bogi fanyi ramini.»<verse eid="EZK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />«A fala e bɛ, ‹Won Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Na wɛni bili fanma? A mu fama a italade, a bogi bira, a xara? A salonyie nun a burɛxɛ kanama nɛ. A italafe mu xɔrɔxɔ. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Hali a itala, a si yire gbɛtɛ, foye naxan kelima sogetede mabiri a mu a xarama xɛ gbiki?›»<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" />«A fala yi bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi bɛ, ‹Wo mu na taali fahaamuxi? Babilɔn mangɛ bara siga Darisalamu, a naa mangɛ nun a kuntigie suxu, a e xanin Babilɔn. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13" />A bara mixi keren sugandi mangɛ bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, a saatɛ xiri a nun na tagi, a a ti mangɛya ra kali ra. A man bara bɔxi kuntigie tan xanin, <verse eid="EZK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14" />alako bɔxi sɛnbɛ xa xurun, han a mu nɔ a ikelide sɔnɔn, fo a nu saatɛ rabatu tun.›»<verse eid="EZK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />«Kɔnɔ na mangɛ sugandixi fan naxa muruta, a xɛɛrae rasiga Misira mangɛ ma soee nun sɔɔrie fende. Na fe mɔɔli sɔɔnɛyama? Naxan matandi tima na ki, a mu tɔɔrɔma yare? <verse eid="EZK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />N bara n kali, n tan Alatala nan xui a ra, a faxama Babilɔn bɔxi nan ma, mangɛ fɛ ma naxan mangɛya soxi a yi ra, a naxan xa saatɛ maberexi, a a kana. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Misira mangɛ mu nɔma a malide gere kui, a yaxuie see yailanma taa tɛtɛ kanafe ra tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />A to a xa kali mabere saatɛ kanafe ra, a fama nɛ na sare sɔtɔde.»<verse eid="EZK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />Na xa fe ra, Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, «N bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, a to n ma kali mabere, a to n ma saatɛ kana, n na sare ragbilenma nɛ a ma. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" />N na n ma yɛlɛ italama nɛ a ya ra, n a suxu n ma gantanyi ra. N a xaninma nɛ Babilɔn bɔxi ma, n fa a ɲaxankata a xa yanfanteya xa fe ra mɛnni, a naxan nabaxi n na. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" />A xa sɔɔrie sɔntɔma nɛ santidɛgɛma ra, mixi dɔnxɔɛ yensenma nɛ. Wo a kolonma nɛ na kui a n tan Alatala nan na natɛ tongoxi.»<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />Won Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, «N sɛdiri salonyi bama nɛ a kɔn na, salonyi fanyi naxan na koore ma, n fa a si geya itexi fari. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" />N a sima nɛ Isirayila geya ma, a salonyie fan, e bogi gbegbe ramini. A findima nɛ sɛdiri wuri bili tofanyi ra. Xɔni mɔɔli birin fama nɛ e malabude, a salonyie niini bun ma a kɔn na. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" />Na kui wuri bili birin a kolonma nɛ, a n tan Alatala nan wuri bili itexi igoroma, n wuri bili igoroxi ite. N wuri xinde xara, n wuri xare rafan. N tan Alatala xui nan na ki. N fama nɛ na rakamalide.»<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s">Yunubitɔɛ sare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" />«Wo yi taali wɔyɛnyi falama nɛ Isirayila bɔxi ma. Wo naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:2">‹Forie na mangoe yɔxɔɛ don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:2">e xa die nan ɲinyie muluxunma.›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:2">Wo na falama munfe ra? <verse eid="EZK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />N bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, a mu lanma wo xa yi taali fala Isirayila bɔxi ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />N tan nan gbe na nii birin na, babɛ ba, di ba. N tan nan gbe e birin na. Nii naxan na yunubi raba, na nii nan bɔnɔma.»<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />«Mixi naxan tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:5">naxan fe fanyi rabama,<verse eid="EZK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" />naxan mu sɛrɛxɛ donma kuye bɛ geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:6">naxan mu a ya tima Isirayila xa kuyee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:6">naxan mu yɛnɛ rabama a dɔxɔboore ginɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:6">naxan mu ginɛ masama a xa kike wali kui,<verse eid="EZK 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" />naxan mu mixi rawalima a yɛtɛ xa geeni xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:7">naxan donifa xa sɛɛkɛ ragbilenma a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:7">naxan mu muɲɛ tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:7">kɔnɔ a fa setare ki, a dugi fi misikiinɛ ma,<verse eid="EZK 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" />naxan mu geeni mɔɔli yo fenma doni kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:8">naxan a yɛtɛ suxuma fe ɲaaxi rabafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:8">naxan kiiti tinxinxi sama mixie tagi,<verse eid="EZK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" />naxan n ma yaamarie rabama, a n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:9">na kanyi findixi tinxintɔɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:9">Na kisima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:9">Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10" />Kɔnɔ xa a sa li a xa di nde na na, naxan mixi bɔnbɔma, a faxɛ tima, a fe ɲaaxi gbɛtɛ raba <verse eid="EZK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11" />a baba mu darixi naxan na, a xa fe na di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:11">A sɛrɛxɛ donma kuye bɛ geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:11">a yɛnɛ raba a dɔxɔboore xa ginɛ ra,<verse eid="EZK 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />a setare nun misikiinɛ tɔɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:12">a muɲɛ tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:12">a tondi sɛɛkɛ ragbilende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:12">a a yae tima kuyee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:12">a fe ɲaaxie rabama,<verse eid="EZK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" />a geeni fenma doni kui.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:13">Na mixi mɔɔli kisima? Ade, a a yɛtɛ nii sare fima nɛ faxɛ ra a xa fe ɲaaxie ma!<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />«Kɔnɔ xa na di ɲaaxi di nde sɔtɔ, naxan bara a baba xa yunubie to, a fa lu a mu tin na wali mɔɔli rabade, a xa fe luma di?<verse eid="EZK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" />A mu sɛrɛxɛ donma kuye bɛ geya fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:15">A mu a ya tima Isirayila kuyee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:15">A mu yɛnɛ rabama a dɔxɔboore ginɛ ra.<verse eid="EZK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />A mu mixi rawalima a yɛtɛ xa geeni xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:16">A mu sɛɛkɛ maxɔrinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:16">A mu muɲɛ tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:16">kɔnɔ a setare kima, a dugi fima misikiinɛ ma,<verse eid="EZK 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />a a yɛtɛ suxuma fe ɲaaxi rabafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 18:17">a mu geeni mɔɔli yo fenma doni kui.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:17">Na di mu bɔnɔma a baba xa fe ɲaaxi xa fe ra. A kisima nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" />Kɔnɔ a baba tan, naxan findi funmala ra, naxan a boore muɲa, naxan fe ɲaaxie raba a xa mixie tagi, a tan nan bɔnɔma a xa yunubie xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" />«Kɔnɔ wo n maxɔrinma, ‹Munfera na di mu a baba xa yunubi kote tongoma?› N xa a fala wo bɛ, na di tinxintɔɛ, naxan bara n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu, a kisima nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" />Naxan na yunubi raba, na nan bɔnɔma. Di mu a baba xa yunubi kote xaninma. Baba fan mu a xa di xa yunubi kote xaninma. Tinxintɔɛ fama nɛ tinxinyi sare sɔtɔde. Yunubitɔɛ tan fama yunubi sare sɔtɔde.»<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />«Kɔnɔ xa yunubitɔɛ gbilen a xa yunubie fɔxɔ ra, a bira Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra tinxinyi kui, a kisima nɛ, a mu bɔnɔma. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" />A fe kobi naxee birin naba, na birin bama nɛ a ma, a fa kisi a xa tinxinyi saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" />N tan wo Marigi Alatala ɲɛlɛxinma yunubitɔɛ xa ɲaxankatɛ ra? A xa gbilen a xa yunubi fɔxɔ ra, a xa kisi, na nan nafan n ma.»<verse eid="EZK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" />«Kɔnɔ xa tinxintɔɛ gbilen a xa tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra, a fa fe ɲaaxi raba alɔ yunubitɔɛ a rabama ki naxɛ, a kisima? A fe fanyi naxee birin naba, na birin bama nɛ a ma, a yunubi sɔtɔ, a fa bɔnɔ a xa fe ɲaaxie saabui ra.»<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />«Wo naxɛ, ‹Marigi xa kira mu tinxin.› Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, wo wo tuli mati n na. N ma kira mu tinxinxi xɛ, ka wo tan nan xa kira mu tinxin? <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" />Xa tinxintɔɛ a kobe so fe fanyi rabafe ra, a bɔnɔma a xa yunubie nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" />Kɔnɔ xa tinxintare a kobe so fe ɲaaxi rabafe ra, a bira tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra, a kisima nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />A to a xa wali kobie birin mato, a natɛ tongo a xa gbilen nee fɔxɔ ra, na nan a ra a kisima, a mu bɔnɔma. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ naxɛ, ‹Ala xa kira mu tinxin.› N tan nan ma kira mu tinxin ba, ka wo tan nan xa kira mu tinxin?»<verse eid="EZK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" />«Na kui Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, n wo kankan makiitima a xa fe rabaxi bɛrɛ nan ma. Wo xa tuubi! Wo gbilen wo xa yunubie rabafe fɔxɔ ra, alako nee naxa wo bɔnɔ. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" />Wo xa wo makuya wo xa yunubie ra wo naxee rabaxi, wo wo bɔɲɛ masara, wo xaxili nɛɛnɛ tongo. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, wo tima bɔnɔɛ kira ra munfe ra? <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" />N mu wama mixi yo xa bɔnɔ. Wo tuubi alako wo xa kisi! Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila mangɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />Wo xa kinikini Isirayila mangɛ suukibae ma yi ki:<verse eid="EZK 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" />«Wo nga findi yɛtɛ ginɛ fanyi nan na yɛtɛe tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:2">A saxi a xa die tagi, a e xuru.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />A naxa a xa di nde ramɔ, a findi sɛnbɛma ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:3">Na di naxa fata a baloe fende, a mixie yati faxa.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />Ɲamanɛe to a xa fe mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:4">e naxa a suxu e xa gantanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:4">e a xanin Misira wure ra a ɲɔɛ kui.»<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />«Na yɛtɛ ginɛ to a to, a xa fe mu sɔɔnɛyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:5">a naxa a xa di gbɛtɛ tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:5">a a findi yɛtɛ sɛnbɛma ra.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />Na di nu a ɲɛrɛma yɛtɛe tagi a sɛnbɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:6">A naxa fata a baloe fende, a mixie faxa.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />A naxa nee xa tɛtɛe kana, a taakae faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:7">Ɲama birin nu bara gaaxu a xa yirindinyi yara.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />Ɲamanɛe man naxa keli a rabilinyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:8">e naxa e xa yɛlɛe itala, e a suxu gantanyi ra.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />E naxa a raso kulɛ kui wuree ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">e a xanin Babilɔn mangɛ xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">Mɛnni e naxa a raso geeli kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:9">A yirindin xui mu mɛ Isirayila geyae fari sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />«Wo nga nu luxi nɛ alɔ wɛni bili naxan sixi xure dɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:10">A nu bogima, a salonyie nu wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:10">barima ye nu gbo a yire.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Salon fanyie nu na a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">naxee fan mangɛ sawuri ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">A nu tixi sansie birin xun ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:11">a xa maite nun a salon wuyaxie xa fe ra.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />Kɔnɔ a bara tala xɔnɛ kui, a rabira bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">Sogetede foye naxa a xara, a bogie kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:12">A salon fanyie naxa lisi, tɛ naxa e gan.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />Yakɔsi a sixi gbengberenyi nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:13">bɔxi xɔrɔxɔɛ, ye mu na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />Tɛ bara mini a salonyi nde kui, a a bogie gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:14">Salon fanyi yo mu na a bɛ sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 19:14">naxan findima mangɛ sawuri ra.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 19:14">Kinikini suuki nan na ki naxan bama nimisɛ kui.<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xa matandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />A ɲɛ solofere nde, kike suuli, xi fu nde ra, Isirayila fori ndee naxa fa n yire, e xa Alatala xa marasi fen. <verse eid="EZK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" />«Adamadi, Isirayila forie maxɔrin munfe ra e faxi n ma marasi fende, n to a fala e bɛ n mu tin e xa n maxandi na ki. Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" />«Adamadi, i xa e makiiti e xa fe ɲaaxie nun e benbae xa fe ɲaaxie xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N Isirayila sugandi tɛmui naxɛ, n na n kali nɛ n bɛlɛxɛ itexi ra Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ bɛ a n tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra. N na n yɛtɛ masen e bɛ Misira bɔxi ma, <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" />n fa n kali e bɛ a n e raminima nɛ mɛnni sigafe ra bɔxi fanyi ma, n dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi e bɛ, kumi nun xiɲɛ xɛlɛma bɔxi naxan ma. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" />N a masen e bɛ, e xa Misira kuyee wɔlɛ, alako e naxa fa e yɛtɛ findi sɛniyɛntaree ra. N tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />«Kɔnɔ e naxa n xui matandi. E mu Misira kuyee wɔlɛ, e mu gbilen nee fɔxɔ ra. Na kui n naxa a masen e bɛ a n fama nɛ n ma xɔnɛ radinde e ma Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" />Na dangi xanbi, n naxa natɛ tongo n xa e ramini naa, alako n xili naxa fa mabere ɲamanɛe tagi e nu dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />N naxa e ramini Misira bɔxi ra, n fa e xun ti gbengberenyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" />Mɛnni n naxa n ma yaamarie so e yi ra, n e rakolon n ma sɛriyɛ ra. Mixi naxee birama nee fɔxɔ ra, e kisima nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" />N naxa malabui lɔxɔɛ xa yaamari fan fi e ma tɔnxuma ra n tan nun e tan tagi, alako e xa a kolon n tan Alatala nan e rasɛniyɛnma.»<verse eid="EZK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />«Kɔnɔ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ naxa e kobe raso n na gbengberenyi ma. E n ma malabui lɔxɔɛ xa yaamari mabere. E mu bira n ma yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, e mu n ma sɛriyɛ suxu, naxee nu nɔma e rakiside. Na kui n naxa a natɛ, n xa n ma xɔnɛ birin namini e ma, n xa e sɔntɔ gbengberen yire. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Hali n mu na raba, alako n xili naxa fa mabere ɲamanɛe tagi, n e ramini naxee ya xɔri Misira bɔxi ra, <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" />n naxa n kali n bɛlɛxɛ itexi ra gbengberenyi ma, a n mu e xaninma na bɔxi fanyi ma sɔnɔn, n nu bara naxan fi e ma, xiɲɛ nun kumi xɛlɛma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" />N na natɛ tongo nɛ, barima e nu n ma yaamarie nun n ma sɛriyɛ nan maberema, e tondi n ma malabui lɔxɔɛ xa yaamari suxude a ki ma. E xa kuye fe nan nu na e bɔɲɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" />Kɔnɔ n naxa kinikini e ma, n mu e sɔntɔ gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="EZK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />N naxa a masen e xa die bɛ mɛnni, n naxɛ, ‹Wo naxa bira wo benbae xa yaamarie nun e xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra de. Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ findi sɛniyɛntaree ra e xa kuyee batufe ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" />N tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra. Wo xa bira n tan nan ma yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, wo xa n ma sɛriyɛ suxu. <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" />Wo xa n ma malabui lɔxɔɛ rasɛniyɛn, alako na xa findi tɔnxuma ra won tagi. Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" />«Kɔnɔ Isirayila die naxa muruta n ma, e mu n ma yaamarie rabatu, e mu e ɲɔxɔ sa n ma sɛriyɛ xɔn ma naxan mixi rakisima, e fa n ma malabui lɔxɔɛ xa yaamari mabere. Na kui n naxa a masen, n xa n ma xɔnɛ birin namini e ma gbengberen yire. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" />Kɔnɔ n mu na raba, alako n xili naxa fa mabere ɲamanɛe tagi, n e ramini naxee ya xɔri Misira bɔxi ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" />Kɔnɔ n na n kali n bɛlɛxɛ itexi nan na gbengberenyi ma, n xa e rayensen yɛ ɲamanɛe tagi, <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" />barima e mu n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu, e n ma yaamarie matandi, e n ma malabui lɔxɔɛ xa yaamari mabere, e man fa e ya rafindi e benbae xa kuyee ma. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" />N naxa e lu e xa bira e yɛtɛ xa yaamari ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra, sɛriyɛ mɔɔli nde naxan mu nɔma sɔɔnɛyade. <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" />N naxa a lu e xa findi sɛniyɛntaree ra sɛrɛxɛ mɔɔli nde xa fe ra, mixi xa di singe faxama sɛrɛxɛ naxan ma fe ra. N nu wama nɛ e xa na fɔxi magaaxuxi to, alako e xa a kolon a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />«Adamadi, i xa a fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe bɛ, i naxɛ, ‹Wo marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Wo benbae bara n finsiriwali, e bara n yanfa. <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" />N to bara e raso bɔxi ma, n na n kali naxan na fife ra e ma, e naxa sɛrɛxɛe ba fɔlɔ kuyee bɛ geyae fari nun wurie bun ma. E nu surayi ganma e bɛ, e minse fan ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. Na birin naxa na xɔnɔ ki fanyi ra, <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />n fa e maxɔrin, Munse na yi yire itexi ra wo sigafe dɛnnaxɛ? Han ya na batudee xili falama Yire itexie.›»<verse eid="EZK 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />«Na nan a ra, a fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Wo wama findife sɛniyɛntaree ra alɔ wo benbae, wo fa bira e xa kuye ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" />Wo na wo xa die ba sɛrɛxɛ ra tɛ xɔɔra, wo na wo xa sɛniyɛnyi nan kanafe na ki. A lanma n xa tin wo xa n maxandi? N tan wo Marigi Alatala, n bara n kali n mu wo luma wo xa n maxandi.›»<verse eid="EZK 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />«Wo naxɛ wo wama nɛ lufe alɔ duniɲa ɲamanɛe, naxee wuri nun gɛmɛ batuma. <verse eid="EZK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />N tan wo Marigi Alatala, n bara n kali a n na n ma mangɛya raɲɛrɛma nɛ wo xun ma sɛnbɛ ra, n na n ma xɔnɛ birin namini wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />N wo raminima nɛ ɲamanɛe ya ma sɛnbɛ ra, n wo malan yire keren n ma xɔnɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" />N wo xaninma nɛ gbengberenyi ma ɲamanɛe tagi, n wo ɲaxankata mɛnni. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" />N naxan nabaxi wo benbae ra Misira gbengberenyi ma, n na fan nabama nɛ wo fan na. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" />N wo radangima nɛ n ma yisuxuwuri bun ma, n fa wo raɲɛrɛ n ma saatɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" />N murutɛlae nun matandilae bama nɛ wo ya ma, naxee na n gerefe. N e raminima nɛ bɔxi ra e sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ konyiya kui, kɔnɔ n mu e xaninma Isirayila bɔxi ma. Na kui wo fama nɛ a kolonde a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />«Wo tan Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi wo bɛ: ‹Xa wo wama sigafe wo xa kuyee batude, awa yire, kɔnɔ xa a sa li wo wo tuli matima n xili sɛniyɛnxi nan na, wo naxa n mabere sɔnɔn wo xa kuye batui ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" />Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan yi ki: Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fama nɛ n batude yi geya itexi sɛniyɛnxi fari. N e rasɛnɛma nɛ a fanyi ra, n e xa sɛrɛxɛ sɛniyɛnxie tongo a nun e xa hadiya birin. <verse eid="EZK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />N na wo ramini ɲamanɛe tagi wo rayensenxi dɛnnaxɛ, n wo rasɛnɛma nɛ a fanyi ra, alɔ surayi xiri fanyi. N na n ma sɛniyɛnyi masenma nɛ ɲamanɛe bɛ wo saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" />N na wo ragbilen wo xa bɔxi ma Isirayila, n na n kalixi naxan fife ra wo benbae ma, wo fama nɛ a kolonde a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" />Mɛnni, wo wo ratuma nɛ wo xa fe ɲaaxie birin ma, naxee wo findi mixi sɛniyɛntaree ra, wo fa lu na yaagi kui tun. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" />N na wo rakisi n xili xa fe ra, n mu wo xa wali ɲaaxie sare fi wo ma, wo fama nɛ a kolonde a n tan nan na Alatala ra. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ Negewi bɔxi bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />«Adamadi, i ya rafindi i yirefanyi ma, i kawandi ti Negewi fɔtɔnyi bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" />A fala: ‹Negewi fɔtɔnyi, i i tuli mati i Marigi Alatala xa masenyi ra. A xui nan ya: N tɛ radɛxɛma nɛ i xɔnyi, naxan i xa wuri xindee nun wuri xaree birin ganma. Na tɛ mu tuma. A fɔxi toma nɛ keli yirefanyi ma han kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" />Mixi birin a kolonma nɛ a n tan Alatala nan na tɛ radɛxɛxi. A mu tuma.›»<verse eid="EZK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" />Na tɛmui n naxa a fala a bɛ, «N Marigi Alatala, ɲama naxɛ, a n taali wɔyɛnyi nan tun falama.» <verse eid="EZK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" />«Adamadi, i ya rafindi Darisalamu ma, i xa kawandi ti hɔrɔmɔlingira xa fe ra. I xa masenyi ti n xili ra Isirayila xili ma. <verse eid="EZK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />A fala Isirayila ɲama bɛ: ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi: N tixi wo kanke. N na n ma santidɛgɛma bama nɛ a tɛɛ i, n fa wo xa tinxintɔɛe nun wo xa tinxintaree faxa. <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />N to natɛ tongo tinxintɔɛe nun tinxintaree xili ma, n ma santidɛgɛma bama nɛ a tɛɛ i yi ɲama birin xa fe ra, naxee na yirefanyi nun kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="EZK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" />Na kui, birin a kolonma nɛ, a n tan nan n ma santidɛgɛma raminixi a tɛɛ i wo xilima. N mu a rasoma sɔnɔn.›»<verse eid="EZK 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />«Adamadi, i xa i wa xui ramini i bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔxi sunnunxi xɔrɔxɔɛ xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" />E na i maxɔrin i wafe fe naxan ma, i xa e yaabi, ‹Xibaaru xɔrɔxɔɛ bara n li. Limaniya bama nɛ mixi birin yi ra na xa fe ra. Mixi birin bɔɲɛ kɔntɔfilima nɛ, mixi birin sanyi sɛrɛn gaaxui kui.› N xa a fala i bɛ, a na fafe. I Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />«Adamadi, n ma xɛɛra iba, a falafe ra, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:14">Santidɛgɛma fanyi, santidɛgɛma xaɲɛnxi!<verse eid="EZK 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />Santidɛgɛma naxan gbaloe rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">santidɛgɛma naxan dangima alɔ seyamakɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">Won nɔma ɲɛlɛxinde n ma di xa mangɛ sa wuri ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:15">Ade, santidɛgɛma fama nɛ birin xun nakanade.<verse eid="EZK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Santidɛgɛma faxi nɛ a fe xa sɔɔnɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:16">a xaɲɛn, a suxuxi faxɛti yi ra.<verse eid="EZK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" />Adamadi, i wa xui ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">barima na santidɛgɛma tima nɛ n ma ɲama kanke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">a Isirayila mangɛe faxa, a nun n ma ɲama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:17">Na kui, i kanke madin sunnunyi kui.›»<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />«Matoe nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:18">Munse fama rabade xa Yudaya mangɛya mu fa nɔ tide yi santidɛgɛma yara?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:18">Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" />«Adamadi, i xa masenyi ti n xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">I xa i bɛlɛxɛe bɔnbɔ keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">Santidɛgɛma man xa bɔnbɔ firin, a xa bɔnbɔ saxan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">Santidɛgɛma nan a ra naxan gbaloe rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:19">naxan faxɛ tima yire birin.<verse eid="EZK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" />Na kui limaniya bama nɛ mixie yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">mixi gbegbe sɔntɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">N ma santidɛgɛma tima nɛ naadɛe birin na faxɛ tife ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:20">A dangima nɛ alɔ seyamakɔnyi.<verse eid="EZK 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" />Santidɛgɛma xabɛ tima nɛ yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:21">a xabɛ ti kɔɔla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:21">a dɛ ya rafindixi yire birin ma.<verse eid="EZK 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" />Na tɛmui, n tan Alatala fama nɛ n bɛlɛxɛe bɔnbɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:22">n ma xɔnɛ fa dan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:22">Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />«Adamadi, i naxan nabama, i xa kira firin nabɔɔ Babilɔn mangɛ xa santidɛgɛma ɲɛrɛma naxee ra. E firin xa keli yire keren, tɔnxuma xa ti yire nde e fatanma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" />Kira keren xa siga Amorikae xɔnyi naxan xili Raaba. Kira firin nde xa siga Yudaya xa taa makantaxi naxan xili Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" />Babilɔn mangɛ tima nɛ na kira firin xunyi ra, a xa sematoe wali raba alɔ xalie mawolife, kuyee maxɔrinfe, nun sube bɔɲɛ matofe. <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" />Na sematoe wali a masenma nɛ a bɛ a xa siga Darisalamu mabiri, a xa geresosee tongo tɛtɛ longori ra, a xa na naadɛe rabira, a fa gbaloe ti taa kui. <verse eid="EZK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />Darisalamukae to saatɛ xiri e nun Babilɔn mangɛ ra, e na sematoe wali toma wule nan na. Kɔnɔ Babilɔn mangɛ mu a tuli matima e ra, barima a naxɛ e fan bara haakɛ sɔtɔ a mabiri. Na nan a ra, a e xaninma konyiya kui.»<verse eid="EZK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Wo xa wali ɲaaxi bara a niya n xa ratu wo xa yunubi dangixie ma, n xa wo xanin konyiya kui. <verse eid="EZK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" />I tan Isirayila mangɛ tinxintare, i xa ɲaxankatɛ lɔxɔɛ bara a li. <verse eid="EZK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" />I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹Mangɛ tɔnxuma ba i xunyi ma! Mangɛya bara ba i yi ra. Mixi magoroxi xa fe itema nɛ, mixi matexi xa fe magoro. <verse eid="EZK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" />I xa mangɛya xun nakanama nɛ, a ɲɔn. Na mangɛya mu gbilenma a ra fo mixi fa, a lan a xa so naxan yi ra. Na fima na kanyi nan ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 21:33" />«Adamadi, i xa masenyi ti n xili ra a falafe ra, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi Amonikae xa konbie xa fe ra, a naxɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:33">Santidɛgɛma bara ba a tɛɛ i gbaloe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:33">A bara raxaɲɛn alako a xa faxɛ ti alɔ seyamakɔnyi.<verse eid="EZK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 21:34" />Wo bara la wule laamatunyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:34">wo bara wo tuli mati sematoe wule falɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:34">Na kui na santidɛgɛma tima nɛ tinxintaree kɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:34">naxee lanma e xa ɲaxankata e xa yunubi kamalixie xa fe ra.<verse eid="EZK 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 21:35" />Wo xa wo xa santidɛgɛma ragbilen a tɛɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:35">N wo makiitima nɛ wo xa bɔxi ma wo daaxi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="EZK 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 21:36" />N na n ma xɔnɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ raminima nɛ wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:36">n wo so xɛmɛ ɲaaxie yi ra naxee fata gbaloe ra.<verse eid="EZK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 21:37" />Wo luma nɛ alɔ yege tɛ xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:37">wo wuli ifili wo xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:37">wo xili ɲɔn feo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 21:37">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 21:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu xa yunubie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" />«Adamadi, a mu lanma xɛ i xa yi taa faxɛti makiiti, i xa a rakolon a xa wali kobie birin na? <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" />A fala a bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Taa nan yi ki, naxan xun nakanama a xa faxɛ tife ra, naxan a findima taa sɛniyɛntare ra a xa kuye batufe ra. <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" />Wo bara yunubi sɔtɔ na faxɛ tife kui, wo bara sɛniyɛntareɲa sɔtɔ na kuyee batufe ra, wo naxee yailanxi wo bɛlɛxɛ ra. A gbe mu luxi wo xa simaya xa ɲɔn, si gbɛtɛe xa wo xili mabere. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Si naxee na rabilinyi nun si naxee na yire makuye, e birin wo mayelema nɛ wo xa yunubie xa fe ra. Wo xa fe xɔrɔxɔ!›»<verse eid="EZK 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />«Wo xa mangɛe faxɛ tima e xa nɔɛ saabui ra, <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" />e mixie baba nun e nga maberema, e wo xa xɔɲɛ nun wo xa kiridie tɔɔrɔma. <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" />Wo n ma se sɛniyɛnxie bɔtɛ baxi, wo n ma malabui lɔxɔɛe maberema. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" />Tɔɔɲɛgɛlae na wo ya ma naxee faxɛ tima. Kuye batue na wo ya ma naxee sɛrɛxɛ bama geya fari, e fa yɛnɛ ɲaaxi raba naa. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" />Xɛmɛe na na naxee sama e baba xa ginɛ fɛ ma, e ginɛ masama naxan mu sɛniyɛnxi a xa kike wali xa fe ra, <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" />e yɛnɛ rabama e dɔxɔboore xa ginɛ ra, e yɛnɛ rabama e xa di xa ginɛ ra, e yɛnɛ rabama e maaginɛ yati ra e nun naxan baba keren. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" />Mixie na wo ya ma naxee sare rasuxuma mixi faxafe ma. Ndee na na naxee geeni sama doni fari, e fuma e ngaxakerenyi ma. Wo bara nɛɛmu n tan ma! Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />«N na n bɛlɛxɛ bɔnbɔma nɛ xɔnɛ kui wo xa naafuli tinxintare nun wo xa faxɛ tife xa fe ra <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" />Sɛnbɛ luma wo bɛ n ma kiiti sa lɔxɔɛ? Wo suusama n na? N xa a fala wo bɛ, n wo ɲaxankatama nɛ. Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" />N wo rayensenma nɛ ɲamanɛe ma, n wo rayensen yɛ bɔxi birin ma. N wo xa sɛniyɛntareɲa ɲɔnma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" />Wo na lu yaagi kui ɲamanɛe tagi, wo fama nɛ a kolonde a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" />«Adamadi, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bara lu n bɛ alɔ gbeti gbi xabude. E maniyaxi na wure gbeeli nan na, yɔxui, wure, nun sunbui naxan bama gbeti raxunuxi ra. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />Na kui, Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹Wo to bara lu alɔ gbeti gbi, n wo malanma nɛ Darisalamu, <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />n ma xɔnɛ fa wo raxunu alɔ gbeti, wure gbeeli, wure, yɔxui, nun sunbui raxunuma ki naxɛ tɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />N wo malanma nɛ n ma bɔɲɛte kui, n fa wo raxunu Darisalamu taa kui. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Wo na raxunu naa, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra, naxan a xa xɔnɛ radinxi wo ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" />«Adamadi, a fala Isirayila bɔxi bɛ, i naxɛ: ‹Bɔxi nan i ra, naxan mu tunɛ toma n ma xɔnɛ lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" />I xa mangɛe xaxili luma nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ xaaɲɛ naxan sube ibɔɔma. E na na mɔɔli rabafe mixie ra. Ginɛe na findife kaaɲɛe ra e xa faxɛ tife xa fe ra. E na muɲɛ tife alɔ fe. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" />I xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe n ma sɛriyɛ matandima, e see sɛniyɛnxi findima se sɛniyɛntare ra. E mu se sɛniyɛnxi nun se sɛniyɛntare tagi rasama, e mu mixie fan nakolonma na tagi rasa ra. E mu n ma malabui lɔxɔɛ xa yaamari suxuma. Na birin kui, e n xili maberema e ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" />I xa kuntigie luxi nɛ alɔ wulai bare naxee sube ibɔɔma. E mixie faxa muɲɛ tife ma. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" />I xa namiɲɔnmɛe dugi felenma na birin ma e xa wule laamatunyie nun e xa wule masenyie ra. E naxɛ, «Ala nan a masenxi,» a fa li Ala mu sese masenxi e bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" />Bɔxikae e bore rawalima tinxintareya kui. E muɲɛ tima, e setaree nun xɔɲɛe tɔɔrɔma. E mu tinxin feo.›»<verse eid="EZK 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" />«N bara mixi nde fen e ya ma, naxan nɔma tɛtɛ rakelide, a fa ti naadɛ ya ra n ya i, alako na bɔxi naxa kana. Kɔnɔ n mu na mixi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" />Na nan a ra, n fama n ma xɔnɛ raminide e ma alɔ tɛ, n e sɔntɔ e xa wali ɲaaxi sare ma. Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s">Di ginɛ firin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />«Adamadi, ginɛ firin xa taruxui nan yi ki, e birin nga keren. <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" />E fonike tɛmui, e naxa e yɛtɛ findi langoe ginɛe ra Misira bɔxi ma. Na ginɛdimɛdie naxa tin xɛmɛe xa e xiɲɛe masuxu. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" />Ginɛ naxan fori, a nu xili Ohola, a xunya xili Oholiba. E nu na n ma ɲama nan ya ma, e fa die bari. Ohola misaalixi Samari nan na, Oholiba misaalixi Darisalamu nan na.»<verse eid="EZK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5" />«Ohola naxa a yɛtɛ mati langoeɲa ra a nu na n ma niini bun ma tɛmui naxɛ. A naxa a ɲɛngɛ maxanu naxee findi Asiriyakae ra, sɔɔri tofanyi naxee <verse eid="EZK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6" />gɛrɛ dugi ragoroma e ma, e findi mangɛe ra, e findi soe ragie ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />A naxa a yɛtɛ fi e ma langoeɲa ra e tide to nu gbo, a man fa bira e xa kuyee fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />A mu a xa langoe fe lu na, a naxan fɔlɔxi Misira bɔxi ma, xɛmɛe xa a xiɲɛ fanyie masuxu, e e waxɔnfe raba a ra.»<verse eid="EZK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" />«Na nan a to, n naxa a lu a ɲɛngɛ Asiriyakae sagoe, a naxee maxanu. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" />Nee nan a rageli ti, e naxa a xa die tongo, e a fan faxa santidɛgɛma ra. A xili naxa findi konbi ra ginɛe tagi a xa ɲaxankatɛ xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" />«A xunya Oholiba naxa na to, kɔnɔ a tan xa ɲɛngɛ suxufe nu xɔrɔxɔ a taara bɛ, a naxa bu langoeɲa kui. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" />A fan nu wama sɔɔri Asiriyakae xɔn, naxee findi mangɛ ra, naxee findi soe ragie ra. E birin tofan e xa sɔɔri dugi kui. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />N naxa a to a fan nu na sɛniyɛntareɲa kui alɔ a taara.»<verse eid="EZK 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14" />«Kɔnɔ a tan bara fe gbɛtɛ sa na fari. A to Kalidikae xa pirinti gbeeli to banxi xalɛ nde ma, <verse eid="EZK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15" />bɛlɛti xirixi e tagi, xun sase dɔxɔxi e xun, naxee findi sɔɔri mangɛ Kalidikae ra, naxee sɔɔri ragise ragima, <verse eid="EZK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" />a naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Kalidi bɔxi ma e xilide barima a nu wama e xɔn. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" />E to fa a yire, e naxa sa e bore fɛ ma, e e sago raba. E to na fe sɛniyɛntare raba, e xa fe naxa raɲaaxu a ma, a gbilen e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />A to nu na na langoeɲa yaagitareya kui, a naxa raɲaaxu n fan ma, n fa a rabolo alɔ n na rabaxi a xunya ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" />A to ratu a xa fonikeya sɛniyɛntareya ma Misira bɔxi ma, a naxa lu langoeɲa raba ra dangife a singe ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />A ɲɛngɛ xa fe nu xɔrɔxɔ a ma. E sɛnbɛ to gboxi yɛnɛ rabade alɔ sofalee nun soee. <verse eid="EZK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />Na nan na ki, wo xa langoeɲa wo fonike ra na xɔli bara wo suxu alɔ a singe ra, Misira xɛmɛe nu wo xiɲɛ masuxuma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />«Oholiba, Alatala yi nan masenxi na xa fe ra: ‹N i ɲɛngɛe bɔɲɛ ratema nɛ i gerefe ma, i mɛxi naxee ra. N e rakelima yire birin fafe ra i gerede. <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" />Babilɔnkae Kalidikae, Pekodikae, Sowakae, Kowakae, nun Asiriyakae xa sɔɔri sɛnbɛmae, mangɛe nun soe ragie, <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" />e birin fama nɛ i xili ma nun e xa geresosee ra, e xa sɔɔri ragisee ra, e xa kote xanin see ra, nun e xa sɔɔri gaali ra. E i rabilinma nɛ, wure lefae na e bɛlɛxɛe, makantasee na e xunyi ma. N i soma nɛ e yi ra, alako e xa i ɲaxankata e gbe ki ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />N n ma xɔnɛ raminima nɛ i ma, e fan i gerema nɛ e xa xɔnɛ ra. E i xa mixie ɲɔɛ nun tulie xabama nɛ. Naxee luxi, e e tan faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra. E i xa die xaninma nɛ. Naxee luxi, e e tan ganma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" />E i xa sosee nun i xa xunmasee tofanyie xaninma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" />N i xa langoeɲa danma nɛ, i naxan fɔlɔxi Misira. I mu i ɲɔxɔ rasigama na ma sɔnɔn.›»<verse eid="EZK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" />«I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹A gbe mu luxi n xa i sa i yaxuie sagoe, naxee nu raɲaaxu i ma a singe ra, i fa gbilen e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29" />E i gerema nɛ, e i harige birin ba i yi ra. E i luma i mageli nan na i xa langoeɲa xa yaagi kui. <verse eid="EZK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30" />I xa wali sɛniyɛntare bara yi gbaloe fi i ma, barima si gbɛtɛe xɔli nu na i ma, i fa fe ɲaaxi raba e xa kuyee ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" />I to iɲɛrɛ i taara xa kira xɔn ma, n a xa ɲaxankatɛ tɔnbili nan soma i yi ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" />«Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">‹I i taara xa ɲaxankatɛ tɔnbili xungbe tongoma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">i fa ɲaxankatɛ gbegbe sɔtɔ, naxan na a kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:32">a fa findi yaagi belebele ra i bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Na ɲaxankatɛ nan a niyama i fa lu alɔ siisila nimisaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:33">Na findima kasarɛ nun kanari nan na i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:33">alɔ a nu na ki naxɛ i xunya Samari bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />I fama nɛ na birin sɔtɔde han a dangi a i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:34">i fa i yɛtɛ xiɲɛ ibɔɔ sunnunyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 23:34">I Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" />«Alatala yi nan masenxi na xa fe ra: ‹I to bara nɛɛmu n ma, i fa i kobe raso n na, a lanma nɛ i xa i xa langoeɲa kote xanin.›»<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, i Ohola nun Oholiba makiitima nɛ? E rakolon e xa wali ɲaaxie ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" />E bara yɛnɛ raba, e bara faxɛ ti, e bara yɛnɛ raba e xa kuyee ra, e bara e xa die fan gan sɛrɛxɛ ra na kuyee bɛ. Na die nu findixi n tan nan gbe ra. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" />E man yi nan nabaxi n na: E bara n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra, e n ma malabui lɔxɔɛe fan mabere. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" />E to nu e xa die bama sɛrɛxɛ ra e xa kuyee bɛ lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, e man so nɛ n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e a findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra. E na nan nabaxi n ma banxi kui.»<verse eid="EZK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" />«E naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ yire makuye, alako mixie xa fa. E to i yire li, i naxa i maxa, i lini ti i yae ra, i i xa xunmase tofanyi gbaku i kɔn ma alako i xa rafan e ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" />I naxa e rasɛnɛ sade fanyi ma, i n ma surayi nun ture dɔxɔ teebili ra.»<verse eid="EZK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />«Ɲama nu na i rabilinyi. Sebakae fan nu na naxee keli gbengberenyi ma. E nu bɛlɛxɛrasoe soma i tan nun i xunya bɛlɛxɛ ra, e fa mangɛ nimitɛ tofanyi dusu wo xunyie ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Na tɛmui n naxa a fala na ginɛ xa fe ra naxan nu bara tagan a xa langoeɲa rabafe ra, ‹Wo xa a tongo langoe ginɛ ra, barima a na gbansan nan kolon.› <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />E naxa sa na ginɛ fɛ ma langoe ki ma. E e sa Ohola nun Oholiba fɛ ma na ki nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" />Kɔnɔ tinxintɔɛ e makiitima nɛ e xa yɛnɛ xa fe ra, a nun e xa faxɛ tife xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹Gali nde xa te e xili ma, e xa e xun nakana, e harige birin xanin. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" />Na gali e magɔnɔma nɛ gɛmɛe ra, a e faxa e xa santidɛgɛmae ra. A e xa die faxa, a e xa banxie gan tɛ ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" />«N langoeɲa ɲɔnma na ki nɛ wo xa bɔxi kui, alako ginɛe xa a kolon a mu lanma e xa ɲɛrɛ wo gbe ki ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" />Wo xa yɛnɛ kote nun wo xa kuye batui kote na dɔxɔ wo xun ma, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s">Tunde taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />A ɲɛ solomanaani nde, kike fu, xi fu nde ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" />«Adamadi, i xa yi ɲɛ, yi kike, nun yi lɔxɔɛ sɛbɛ, barima to Babilɔn mangɛ gere fɔlɔma nɛ Darisalamu. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" />I xa yi taali wɔyɛnyi fala yi bɔnsɔɛ murutaxi bɛ. A fala e bɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:3">‹Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:3">Ye sa tunde kui, tunde dɔxɔ tɛ ma.<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4" />Sube xuti fanyie sa a kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:4">xutie naxee fan a birin bɛ alɔ tabe nun tunki sube,<verse eid="EZK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5" />naxan xabaxi xuruse fate fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:5">Yege sa tɛ han tunde xa satun, sube xa ɲin.›»<verse eid="EZK 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:6">Gbaloe bara yi bɔxi li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:6">Ye bara so sube ra tunde kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:6">Sube xuti birin ba keren kerenyi ra.<verse eid="EZK 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" />Mixi kɔn to raxaba, a raba fanye nan fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:7">Xa a sa raba bɔxi nɛ nu, bɛndɛ nu nɔma a makotode.<verse eid="EZK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />N fan fama nɛ wo wuli rafilide n gbeɲɔxɔɛ ra fanye fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:8">alako a naxa makoto.»<verse eid="EZK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:9">‹Ɲaxankatɛ na yi taa faxɛti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:9">N yege gbegbe sama nɛ na tɛ xɔɔra.<verse eid="EZK 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Wo fan yege sa tɛ, a xa xungbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:10">Sube ɲin a fanyi ra, bɔrɛ se sa a fari, a xɔrie xa gan feo.<verse eid="EZK 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" />Na dangi xanbi, tunde igeli xa dɔxɔ tige wolenxi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:11">han tunde xa fura alɔ wure gbeeli naxan wama raxunufe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:11">alako se birin naxan luxi tunde kui a xa ɲɔn.<verse eid="EZK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Kɔnɔ na mu sɔɔnɛyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 24:12">Tɛ mu nɔma se birin xɔride naxan luma tunde kui.›»<verse eid="EZK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" />«Wo bara findi sɛniyɛntaree ra wo xa yɛnɛ xa fe ra. N bara kata wo rasɛniyɛnde, kɔnɔ wo mu tin. Na kui wo mu sɛniyɛnyi sɔtɔma han n gɛ n ma xɔnɛ birin naminide wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" />N tan Alatala xa a fala wo bɛ, na waxati bara a li. N mu kinikinima wo ma, n mu gbilenma n ma natɛ ma. N wo makiitima wo ɲɛrɛ ki nun wo xa wali nan ma. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan nan ki.»<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />«Adamadi, a gbe mu luxi n xa a niya a naxan nafan i ma dangife i yae yati ra, n fama nɛ na ralɔɛde i ma keren na. Kɔnɔ i naxan nabama, i naxa wa xui yo ramini, i naxa ya ye keren namini. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" />I xa i sabari i xa sunnunyi kui, i naxa i xui ramini alɔ mixie darixi a raba ra faxa mixie bɛ ki naxɛ. I naxa i xunyi mageli ti, i naxa sankiri ba i sanyi, i naxa i yatagi makoto, i naxa donse don mixie darixi naxan don na ɲɔn fe tɛmui.»<verse eid="EZK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />N ma ginɛ naxa faxa na nunmare ra. Na kuye iba gɛɛsɛgɛ, n naxa a raba alɔ Alatala nu bara n yamari ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />Ɲama naxa n maxɔrin, «I na yi ɲɔn fe rabafe ki naxɛ, na munse masenma muxu tan bɛ?» <verse eid="EZK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />N naxa e yaabi, «Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" />‹A fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, wo Marigi Alatala naxɛ, a gbe mu luxi n xa a niya n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra, na banxi naxan nafan wo ma ki fanyi ra. Wo xa die man faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra.› <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" />Na tɛmui wo fama na ɲɔn fe suxude alɔ n a suxu ki naxɛ. Wo mu wo yatagi makotoma, wo mu ɲɔn fe donse donma, <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />wo mu wo xunyi mageli tima, wo mu sankiri bama wo sanyi. Wo mu ɲɔn fe rabama wa xui ra. Wo xa yunubie nan tun wo xun nakanama. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" />Ala man naxɛ, ‹Annabi Esekiyeli findima wo bɛ misaali nan na. A naxan nabaxi, wo fan fama na nan nabade. Na fee na raba, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />«Adamadi, n xa a fala i bɛ, n e xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi, naxan nafanxi e ma ki fanyi ra, a nun e xa die, n nee bama e yi ra lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" />na lɔxɔɛ yati mixi ratangaxi fama nɛ i yire, a na xibaarui fala i bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Na lɔxɔɛ, i nɛnyi fulunma nɛ na mixi ratangaxi ya xɔri, i mu findima boboe ra sɔnɔn. Na birin findima misaali nan na ɲama bɛ, e fa a kolonde a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s">Amon, Mowaba, Edon, nun Filisita xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" />«Adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti Amonikae xili ma. <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Wo wo tuli mati wo Marigi Alatala xui ra. A yi nan masenxi: Wo to yele n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa sɛniyɛnyi kanafe ra, a nun Isirayila xa bɔxi xa kanari, a nun Yuda bɔnsɔɛ sigafe ra konyiya kui, <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" />n wo sama nɛ sogetedekae sagoe. E yonkinma nɛ wo tagi, e wo xa donse don, e wo xa xiɲɛ min. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" />N Raaba findima ɲɔxɔmɛ gɔɔrɛ nan na, n Amoni bɔxi findi yɛxɛɛ malabude ra. Wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹Wo tan bɔɲɛ ɲaaxie to fare boron ɲɛlɛxinyi kui n ma ɲama xa gbaloe xa fe ra, <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />n fama nɛ n bɛlɛxɛ italade wo xili ma, n wo sa si gbɛtɛe sagoe. N wo si ɲɔnma nɛ duniɲa ma. N na gɛ na rabade, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹Mowaba nun Seyiri to bara a fala a Yuda bɔnsɔɛ luxi nɛ alɔ ɲamanɛe birin, <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />n fama nɛ a niyade a xa bɔxi fanyi keli Beti Yesimoti ma, Bali Meyoni, han Kiriyatayimi, birin xa lu a yaxuie sagoe. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10" />N a fima nɛ sogetedekae ma, a nun Amoni bɔxi n fama naxan xili ɲɔnde duniɲa ma. <verse eid="EZK 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11" />N na gɛ Mowaba ɲaxankatade, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹Edon bɔnsɔɛ to a gbeɲɔxɔ Yuda bɔnsɔɛ ma, e bara haakɛ sɔtɔ. <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />Na kui, Alatala yi nan masenxi: N Edon gerema nɛ santidɛgɛma ra, n mixi nun xuruse birin sɔntɔ kelife Teman ma han Dedan. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" />N na n gbeɲɔxɔma nɛ Edon ma n ma ɲama Isirayila saabui ra n ma xɔnɛ bɛrɛ ra. E fama nɛ gbeɲɔxɔɛ kolonde. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹Filisitakae to e gbeɲɔxɔ Yudaya ma e naxan xɔnxi kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye, <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" />n tan wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N Filisitakae gerema nɛ, n Keriti bɔnsɔɛ ɲɔn, n mixie sɔntɔ naxee sabatixi baa dɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" />N na n gbeɲɔxɔma nɛ e ma n ma xɔnɛ kui. Na tɛmui e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s">Tire xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />A ɲɛ fu nun keren nde, kike xi singe ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" />«Adamadi, Tire to bara a kolon a Darisalamu na safe si gbɛtɛe sagoe, a fa a maɲɔxun a nɔma naafuli sɔtɔde na gbaloe raba xa fe ra, <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, ‹Tire, n tixi wo kanke! N fama nɛ si gbɛtɛe ra wo yire, e din wo ra alɔ baa mɔrɔnyie. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" />E Tire tɛtɛe birin yensenma nɛ, e wo xa yire makantaxie kana, wo xɔnyi fa findi fanye mageli ra, <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />yɛxɛsuxuie e xa yɛlɛe raxarama dɛnnaxɛ. Alatala xui nan na ki. N a xa naafuli fima nɛ si gbɛtɛe ma, <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />a xa mixie faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra. Na kui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹N fama nɛ Babilɔn mangɛ xungbe Nebukadansari ra kelife kɔɔla ma, a xa wo tan Tirekae gere a xa sɔɔri gali nun a xa soe ragi gali ra. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" />A wo xa mixie sɔntɔma nɛ santidɛgɛma ra. A yiree mate wo xa tɛtɛe sɛɛti ma alako a xa naa kana. Wo mu nɔma a tɔɔrɔde a xa wure lefae xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />A dinma nɛ wo xa naadɛe nun wo xa yire makantaxie ra a xa geresosee ra, han e bira. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />A xa soe gali xube ratema nɛ han. Wo xa tɛtɛ sɛrɛnma nɛ e xa soe, e xa sɔɔri ragisee, nun e xa se xanin see xui ra, e na so wo xa tɛtɛ biraxi tagi tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />E wo xa kirae boronma nɛ, e wo xa mixie faxa santidɛgɛma ra, e wo xa banxi fanyie rabira. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" />E wo xa naafuli xaninma nɛ, e wo harige xun nakana. E wo xa tɛtɛ rabira, e wo xa banxie kana, naxan na lu, e na wɔlɛ baa ma. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" />N wo xa sigi sa danma nɛ, wo xa kɔra xui mu mɛma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />N i findima fanye mabaxi nan na, yɛlɛ raxarama dɛnnaxɛ. Wo xa taa mu gbilenma ti ra sɔnɔn, barima n xui nan na ki. Wo Marigi Alatala na nan masenxi.›»<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi Tire bɛ, a naxɛ, ‹Si gbɛtɛ naxee sabatixi baa dɛ ra, e fama nɛ wo wa xui mɛde yi gbaloe xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" />E xa mangɛe goroma nɛ e xa kibanyie kui, e e xa dugi fanyie ba e ma, e fa sunnun dugi ragoro e ma, alako e xa dɔxɔ wo sɛɛti ma bɔxi ma yaragaaxui kui. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" />E sunnun suuki nde xabuma nɛ wo xun ma, naxan a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">Wo xa fe xun bara rakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">wo tan taa sɛnbɛma kunkui raɲɛrɛe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">Wo sɛnbɛ nu gbo baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:17">birin nu gaaxuma wo ya ra.<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi si naxee sabatixi baa dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 26:18">e bara gaaxu a fanyi ra wo xa gbaloe xa fe ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹N na wo xa taa kana, mixi yo mu lu naa sɔnɔn, baa ye fa din na yire ma, <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" />na luma nɛ alɔ mixi dangixi naxee bara siga aligiyama. N wo nɔxunma nɛ bɔxi bun ma, wo mu gbilen duniɲa ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" />N wo raɲɔnma nɛ yi gbaloe kui feo. Mixi naxan wo fenma, a mu wo toma sɔnɔn. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s">Sunnun suuki Tire bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" />«Adamadi, sunnun suuki ba Tire bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" />I xa a fala yi bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, naxan sabatixi baa dɛ ra, naxan yulɛya raba duniɲa birin, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:3">Wo tan Tire, wo naxɛ wo tofan dangi birin na.<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Wo sɛnbɛ nu gbo baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:4">wo xa kunkui yailanyie nu walima a fanyi ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />E nu sipirɛ wuri rawalima kelife Seniri bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:5">e nu sɛdiri wuri rawali kelife Liban bɛla ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />E nu konde wuri yailan laala ra naxan kelixi Basan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:6">E nu santali wuri rawali kelife Sipiri bɔxi ma kunkui raxunmase ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:6">e fa gɛmɛ tofanyie raso na wuri kui.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />I xa bɛla yailanxi tasɔxɔɛ tofanyi nan na kelife Misira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">Dugi gbɛtɛe fan nu gbakuma wo xa kunkuie ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:7">naxee findixi garɛ dugi ra kelife Elisaha bɔxi ma.<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />Sidɔnkae nun Arawadakae nan nu na wo xa laalabae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:8">Tirekae nan nu na wo xa kunkui raɲɛrɛe ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />Gebalikae nan nu na wo xa kunkui yailanyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:9">Kunkuie nu fama wo yire kelife duniɲa birin ma yulɛya rabade.›»<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />«Perisekae, Lidikae, nun Putikae nan nu na wo xa sɔɔri galie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:10">e xa geresosee nun e xa makantasee nu gbakuma wo xɔnyi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:10">Na birin findixi xili fanyi nan na wo bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />Arawada nun Helexi sɔɔrie nan nu wo xa tɛtɛ makantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">Gamadikae nan nu mɛɛnima wo xa yire makantaxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">e xa geresosee nun e xa makantasee nu gbakuma wo xɔnyi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:11">Na birin findixi xili fanyi nan na wo bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />Tarasisikae nu gbeti, wure, yɔxui, nun sunbui nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" />Girɛkikae, Tubalikae, nun Mesekikae nu konyie nun wure gbeeli nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />Togaramakae nu soe nun sofale mɔɔli birin nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />Dedankae nu sare soma wo xɔnyi sili ɲinyie nun wuri fanyi nan na.<verse eid="EZK 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />Wo tan nun Aramikae nu yulɛya rabama wo bore tagi. E nu gɛmɛ tofanyi, garɛ dugi, dugi rawalixi, dugi masɔxɔxie, baa bun ma gɛmɛ, nun gɛmɛ tofanyi gbeelie nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" />Yudakae nun Isirayilakae nu mɛngi nun fundenyi maniyɛ naxee kelixi Miniti bɔxi ma, donse ɲɔxunmɛe, kumi, ture, nun seri nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />Damasikae nu fama wɛni nan na kelife Xelebon nun yɛxɛɛ xabe kelife Saxaru, e nu e masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" />Danakae nun Yawanikae naxee kelixi Usali, e nu wure, kasiya wuri, nun seri nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />Dedankae nu fama soe maxiri dugie nan na.<verse eid="EZK 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" />Arabikae nun Kedari mangɛe nu yulɛya rabama wo xɔnyi yɛxɛɛe, si kontonyie, nun sie nan na. <verse eid="EZK 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" />Seeba nun Rama yulɛe nu se xiri ɲɔxunmɛ, gɛmɛ tofanyie, nun xɛɛma nan masarama wo xa yirabasee ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />«Xaranikae, Kannekae, Edenkae, Seebakae, Asiriyakae, nun Kilimadakae birin nu yulɛya rabama wo xɔnyi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />E nu fama dugi tofanyie, garɛ dugie, dugi tasɔxɔɛe, nun dugi masɔxɔxie mɔɔli birin nan na.»<verse eid="EZK 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" />«Tarasisi kunkuie nan wo xa yulɛya see maxaninma wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:25">Wo xa kote gbo naxan ɲɛrɛma baa ma.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />Wo xa laala bae wo xaninma yire makuye baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:26">kɔnɔ foye naxan kelima sogetede mabiri, a wo madulama nɛ baa ma.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />Wo xa naafuli, wo xa yulɛya see, wo xa yirabasee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">wo xa kunkui ragie, wo xa kunkui yailanyie, wo xa sɔɔrie, wo xa yulɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">mixi birin naxee na wo xa kunkuie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:27">e madulama nɛ na gbaloe lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />Kunkui raɲɛrɛe gbelegbele xui mɛma nɛ kelife baa dɛ ra.<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />Laala bae, kunkui raɲɛrɛe birin tima baa dɛ ra na fe ma.<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />E wama, e xa sunnunyi xui ratema wo xa gbaloe xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:30">e xube so e xunyie ma wo xa ɲɔn fe tɛmui.<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />E e xunyie bima nɛ sunnunyi kui, e sunnun dugie ragoro e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:31">E wa e xui itexi ra, e bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔma nɛ ki fanyi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />«Na birin kui e sunnun suuki nde bama nɛ wo bɛ, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:32">‹Si mundun ɲɔnma yi ki alɔ Tire ɲɔnxi ki naxɛ?›<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />Wo xa yulɛya kote to ɲɛrɛma baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:33">ɲamanɛe nu ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ wo xa yirabasee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:33">Wo xa naafuli nun wo harige nan nu a niyama duniɲa mangɛe xa bannaya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi baa tan bara wo xun nakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:34">a bara wo xa kote nun wo xa mixie don gbiki.<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />Mixi naxee sabatixi baa dɛ, e bara gaaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:35">hali mangɛe dɛ bara ixara.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />Yulɛ naxee na duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:36">e birin bara kaaba wo xa gbaloe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 27:36">Wo xa fe bara ɲɔn kerenyi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s">Masenyi Tire mangɛ nun Sidɔn bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" />«Adamadi, a fala Tire mangɛ bɛ, ‹I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:2">I bara la i yɛtɛ ra a falafe ra, «Ala nan n tan na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:2">N dɔxɔxi alae xa kibanyi nan kui baa dɛ ra!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:2">Kɔnɔ i mu findixi ala yo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:2">hali i to a maɲɔxunxi a i xaxili luxi nɛ alɔ Ala gbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:2">Ibunadama tun nan na i ra.<verse eid="EZK 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />I ɲɔxɔ a ma a i xaxili fan dangi Annabi Daniyɛli gbe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:3">I gundo fe birin kolon?<verse eid="EZK 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />I xa xaxilimaya bara a niya i xa bannaya sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:4">xɛɛma nun gbeti gboxi i xa naafuli ya ma.<verse eid="EZK 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />I fata yulɛya rabade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:5">Na bara findi bannaya ra i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:5">kɔnɔ a man bara a niya i xa findi yɛtɛ igboe ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6" />«Na fe ma, i Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:6">I ɲɔxɔ a ma i xaxili luxi nɛ alɔ Ala gbe,<verse eid="EZK 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7" />n i yaxui kobie radinma nɛ i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:7">alako e xa e xa santidɛgɛmae ba e tɛɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:7">e xa wo xa tofanyi nun wo xaxilimaya ragoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:7">i xa fe fanyi xun fa rakana.<verse eid="EZK 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />E i madulama nɛ baa ma, i fa faxɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ, i goro aligiyama.<verse eid="EZK 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />I fama nɛ a falade faxɛtie ya i, ‹Ala na n na›?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:9">Mixi nan tun na i ra naxan faxama mixie bɛlɛxɛ ra.<verse eid="EZK 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />I faxama nɛ yaagi kui alɔ bilakɔrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:10">I Marigi Alatala xui nan nan ki.»<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" />«Adamadi, sunnun suuki nde ba Tire mangɛ bɛ, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:12">‹I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:12">I nu kamalixi xaxilimaya nun tofanyi nan na.<verse eid="EZK 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />A nu luxi nɛ alɔ i sabatixi Ala xa yire fanyi nan kui naxan xili Eden bɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:13">Gɛmɛ tofanyi naxee sare gbo e nu na i yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:13">E xili nu falama: sariduwani, topasi, diyaman, kirosolite, onixi, yasape, safiri, esikaribukulu, nun emerode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:13">Nee nu saxi xɛɛma raxunmasee nan tagi, e findi xurundɛ, bɛlɛxɛrasoe, nun kɔnmagoree ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:13">Ala na nan birin rafalaxi i bɛ i daa tɛmui.<verse eid="EZK 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />N to i ti mangɛ ra, n malekɛ sɛnbɛ so i yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:14">I nu ɲɛrɛma tɛ nan tagi n ma geya fari.<verse eid="EZK 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />I nu sɛniyɛn kabi i daa lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:15">kɔnɔ tinxintareya bara i suxu.<verse eid="EZK 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />I xa yulɛya xa gboe bara i findi yunubitɔɛ ɲaaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:16">Na kui n naxa i keri Ala xa geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:16">n naxa malekɛ sɛnbɛ ba i yi.<verse eid="EZK 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />I xa tofanyi nan a niya i xa findi yɛtɛ igboe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:17">I xa fe kolonyi nan a niya i xun xa rakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:17">Na kui n naxa i xa fe magoro bɔxi ma alako mangɛe xa i to.<verse eid="EZK 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />I xa yunubie nun i xa tinxintareya i xa yulɛya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:18">na bara i xa salidee findi yire sɛniyɛntaree ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:18">N bara tɛ ramini i xili ma naxan i xun nakanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:18">n bara i findi xube ra ɲama ya xɔri.<verse eid="EZK 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />Mangɛ naxee nu i kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:19">e birin bara makaaba i xa gbaloe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:19">I xa fe bara ɲɔn kerenyi ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ,<verse eid="EZK 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />«Adamadi, i xa ti Sidɔn kanke, i xa masenyi ti a bɛ n xili ra, a falafe ra,<verse eid="EZK 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:22">N bara keli i xili ma Sidɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:22">N na n ma nɔrɛ masenma nɛ wo tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:22">N na wo ɲaxankata, mixie a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:22">Na lɔxɔɛ n na n ma sɛniyɛnyi masenma nɛ wo ya ma.<verse eid="EZK 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />N wuganyi radinma nɛ wo ma, mixi gbegbe xa faxa taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:23">N santidɛgɛma rawalima nɛ wo xili ma, mixi gbegbe xa sɔntɔ yire birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 28:23">Na kui mixie a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />«Na tɛmui wo mu luma alɔ tunbee Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma sɔnɔn, e fa a kolon a n tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «N na gɛ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe birin tongode ɲamanɛe tagi e rayensenxi dɛnnaxɛ, n na n ma sɛniyɛnyi masenma nɛ e bɛ ɲamanɛe ya xɔri. Na tɛmui e sabatima nɛ fa e xa bɔxi ma, n naxan fixi n ma konyi Yaxuba ma. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" />E luma nɛ naa xaxilisa kui, e banxie ti, e sansie si. E dɔxɔ naa xaxilisa kui, n na e dɔxɔbooree ɲaxankatama tɛmui naxɛ, naxee nu bara e tɔɔrɔ ki fanyi ra. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan e Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s">Misira xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />A ɲɛ fu nde, kike fu, xi fu nun firin nde ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" />«Adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti Misira mangɛ nun a xa ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" />A fala a bɛ, ‹Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:3">N bara keli i xili ma, i tan Misira Firawuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:3">naxan luxi alɔ sɔɲɛ magaaxuxi xure sɛnkinɛe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:3">I naxɛ, «N bara Nili xure daa n yɛtɛ bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />Kɔnɔ n kɔnyi belebele sɔtima nɛ i banganyie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:4">n a niyama nɛ yɛxɛe xa bɔni i xalee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:4">n fa i rate xure kui, i tan nun na yɛxɛe birin na.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />N i luma gbengberenyi nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:5">i tan nun na yɛxɛe birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:5">Wo luma naa, mixi yo mu wo makɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:5">Wo findima donse nan na wulai subee nun xɔnie bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />Na tɛmui Misirakae birin a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 29:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:6">«Wo bara lu alɔ kale Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ naxan suxu mali se ra,<verse eid="EZK 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" />kɔnɔ wo fa ibɔɔ a bɛlɛxɛ kui, wo a tunki sɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:7">E to e xaxili ti wo ra, wo e yanfa nɛ, e fa lu tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="EZK 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:8">N fama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra wo xa mixie nun wo xa xuruse faxafe ra.<verse eid="EZK 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />Misira bɔxi na findi yire maxaraxi ra naxan nabɛɲinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:9">e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 29:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:9">«Wo to a fala, ‹N bara Nili xure daa n yɛtɛ bɛ,›<verse eid="EZK 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" />n kelima nɛ wo xili ma nun wo xa xuree xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:10">N Misira bɔxi raxarama nɛ, n a rabɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:10">kelife Migidoli ma, han a sa dɔxɔ Asuwan ra, han Kusi naaninyi ra.<verse eid="EZK 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" />Mixie mu dangima naa, subee mu dangima naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:11">Mixi yo mu sabatima naa han ɲɛ tongo naani.<verse eid="EZK 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" />N Misira bɔxi rabɛɲinma alɔ yire gbɛtɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:12">n a xa taae xun nakanama nɛ alɔ taa gbɛtɛe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 29:12">N Misirakae rayensenma nɛ duniɲa yire birin.»<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />Kɔnɔ wo Marigi Alatala man yi nan masenxi: «Ɲɛ tongo naani dangi xanbi, n man Misirakae malanma nɛ, kelife ɲamanɛe ma n e rayensen dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" />N e ragbilenma nɛ e xɔnyi Patirosi mabiri kelife konyiya kui. N e luma nɛ e xa e yɛtɛ yamari, kɔnɔ e xa mangɛya mu sɛnbɛ gbegbe sɔtɔma. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />E mu e xunyi itema bɔxi gbɛtɛ yo xun ma sɔnɔn. N e magoroma nɛ, alako e naxa nɔ ɲamanɛe ra. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" />E mu limaniya fima Isirayila ma sɔnɔn. Isirayila na Misira fe maɲɔxun, e ratuma e xa yunubie nan tun ma, e to e xaxili ti e ra. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />A ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nde, kike singe, xi singe ra, Alatala naxa masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" />«Adamadi, Babilɔn mangɛ Nebukadansari nun a xa sɔɔrie bara kata Tire ragorode, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ a ra fefe ma. E tɔɔrɔ nɛ tun, e mu naafuli yo sɔtɔ na kui. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" />Na nan a ra, wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N Misira bɔxi tan fima nɛ Babilɔn mangɛ Nebukadansari ma, a xa e xa naafuli birin xanin a xa sɔɔri gali sare ra. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" />N na birin fima nɛ a ma, barima a tan nun a xa sɔɔrie na nan nabaxi n tan bɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />Na lɔxɔɛ, n Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ sɛnbɛ gboma nɛ, n i xɛɛma masenyi tide e bɛ. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="s">Sunnun suuki Misira bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" />«Adamadi, i xa yi masenyi ti n xili ra: ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:2">Wo gbelegbele! Gbaloe lɔxɔɛ bara fa!<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Alatala xa lɔxɔɛ bara makɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:3">dimi bara fa gbaloe lɔxɔɛ ra ɲamanɛe bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />Santidɛgɛma fama nɛ Misira xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:4">tɔɔrɛ dinma nɛ Kusikae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:4">Misirakae faxama nɛ, e xa naafuli xanin, e xa tɛtɛe bira.›»<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />Kusi, Puti, Ludu, Arabu, Libiya, nun Ala xa ɲama a saatɛ tongoxi naxan bɛ, e birin faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra a nun Misira.<verse eid="EZK 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />«Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">‹Misira malimae birama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">a yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ ɲɔnma nɛ, a nu laxi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">Kelife Migidoli, han Asuwan, e faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:6">Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />«N Misira bɔxi rabɛɲinma nɛ alɔ yire gbɛtɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:7">n a xa taae xun nakana alɔ taa gbɛtɛe.<verse eid="EZK 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />N na tɛ so Misira ra, n na nɔ e malimae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:8">e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />«Na lɔxɔɛ, n xɛɛrae xɛɛma nɛ kunkuie kui, e xa Kusikae magaaxu, alako a xa bira n fɔxɔ ra. Kɔntɔfili dusuma nɛ e xun na Misirakae xa gbaloe lɔxɔɛ naxan fafe, a mu kanama.»<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:10">‹N Misira xa ɲama wuyaxi sɔntɔma nɛ Babilɔn mangɛ Nebukadansari sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="EZK 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />A tan nun a xa sɔɔri gali, naxan magaaxuxi sɔɔri gali birin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">n e fama nɛ na bɔxi xun nakanade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">E Misirakae faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:11">e bɔxi rafema nɛ na binbie ra.<verse eid="EZK 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />N Nili xure xɔrima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:12">n a bɔxi mati mixi ɲaaxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:12">naxee a niya na bɔxi birin xun xa rakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:12">Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">N wo xa kuyee kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">n wo xa kuyee raɲɔnma nɛ Nofi taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">Mangɛ yo mu luma Misira bɔxi ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:13">N gaaxui luma nɛ na bɔxi birin ma.<verse eid="EZK 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />N Patirosi xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:14">n tɛ din Sowan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:14">n Tebese ɲaxankata.<verse eid="EZK 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />N na n ma xɔnɛ raminima nɛ Sini ma, Misira sɛnbɛ na dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:15">n Tebese xa ɲama birin sɔntɔ.<verse eid="EZK 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />N tɛ soma nɛ Misira ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:16">n Sini rasɛrɛn tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:16">n Tebese xun nakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:16">n Nofi so a yaxuie yi ra.<verse eid="EZK 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />Oni nun Pi Bɛsɛti sɔɔrie birin faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:17">taakae xaninma nɛ konyiya kui.<verse eid="EZK 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />Tapanxɛsi bira lɔxɔɛ xɔrɔxɔma nɛ Misira bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:18">barima na tɛmui, a sɛnbɛ ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:18">a sɛnbɛ a nu laxi naxan na.<verse eid="EZK 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />N Misira ɲaxankatama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 30:19">e fa a kolon a n tan nan Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />A ɲɛ fu nun keren nde, kike singe, xi solofere nde ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" />«Adamadi, n bara Misira Firawuna bɛlɛxɛ gira. A mu maxirima, seri mu sama a ma, sese mu rabama a yalanfe ra, a fa nɔ santidɛgɛma tongode. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N fafe Misira Firawuna xili ma, n xa a bɛlɛxɛ firinyie gira, a bɛlɛxɛ fanyi nun a bɛlɛxɛ kanaxi, alako a xa santidɛgɛma lu naa abadan. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" />N Misirakae rayensenma nɛ duniɲa birin ma. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />N na n ma santidɛgɛma soma nɛ Babilɔn mangɛ yi, n sɛnbɛ fi a ma, kɔnɔ n Firawuna bɛlɛxɛe girama nɛ, a nuunu a ya i alɔ mixi naxan na faxafe. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />N sɛnbɛ fima nɛ Babilɔn mangɛ ma, kɔnɔ n Firawuna tan bɛlɛxɛe igoro. N na n ma santidɛgɛma sa Babilɔn mangɛ bɛlɛxɛ tɛmui naxɛ, a naxa a ite Misira xili ma, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />N Misirakae rayensenma nɛ duniɲa birin ma. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s">Taali wɔyɛnyi Misira xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />A ɲɛ fu nun keren nde, kike saxan, xi singe ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />«Adamadi, a fala Misira Firawuna nun a xa ɲama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:2">‹Wo maniyɛ na minden?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Asiriya bɔxi nu luxi nɛ alɔ sɛdiri wuri bili nde naxan nu na Liban wondi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:3">A salonyie nu tofan, a niini gbo, a ite dangi wuri birin na.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />Tunɛ ye nu bara a ramɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:4">ye naxan na bɔxi bun, na nu bara a rakuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:4">A nu ye radinma a sankee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:4">a fa ye xanin fɔtɔnyi birin kui.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />Na nan a niya, a tan nu ite na fɔtɔnyi wuri bilie birin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:5">a salonyie nu bara wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:5">e nu fa kuya ra na ye saabui ra.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />Xɔnie nu e xɛlɛe sama a salonyie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:6">burunyi subee nu di barima a niini bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:6">ɲamanɛe nu sabatixi a sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />A nu tofan a xa xungbe xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:7">a salonyie nu kuya han, a sanke nu birixi bɔxi bun ma pon ye fenfe ra.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />Sɛdiri bili naxee nu na Ala xa bɔxi ma Eden mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">nee mu a xa kuyɛ sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">A salonyie nu kuya Sipiri salonyie bɛ, e kuya wuri mɔɔli birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:8">A tofanyi maniyɛ yo mu nu na Ala xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />N tan nan a ratofan, n tan na a salonyie wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 31:9">dangife wuri bili birin na Ala xa bɔxi ma Eden mabiri.›»<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />«Na nan a to, wo Marigi Alatala naxa yi masen: A to nu ite dangi wuri birin na, yɛtɛ igboɲa fa lu a bɔɲɛ kui, <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />n a saxi ɲamanɛe xa mangɛe sagoe na nan ma, e xa a ɲaxankata a xa ɲaaxuɲa bɛrɛ ra. N to a bɛɲin, <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" />mangɛ nde naxan kobi a birin bɛ, a bara a fɔn, a fa a lu naa. A salonyie bara bira geyae fari nun gulunbae kui. A salonyi giraxie nu na bɔxi birin ma. Ɲamanɛe naxa keli a niini bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" />Xɔnie nun burunyi subee gbansan nan nu luxi a salonyie tagi. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" />Na kui, a mu lanma wuri yo xa kuya na ki dangi wuri birin na. Wuri naxee ye sɔtɔ a fanyi ra, a mu lan e xa na kuyɛya li. Sɛriyɛ ki ma, e xa faxa alɔ ibunadama naxan sigama aligiyama.»<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: A faxa lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, n a ɲɔn fe raba nɛ ye birin na, ye fa xɔri. N naxa dimi rasin Liban ma a xa fe ra, fɔtɔnyi naxa xara. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" />N naxa ɲamanɛe ragaaxu a bira xui ma, n to a faxa alɔ mixi naxee faxaxi sigama aligiyama. Na tɛmui Eden wuri bilie birin, naxee fan Liban wuri bilie birin bɛ, naxee ye sɔtɔ a fanyi ra, nee naxa raxara. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" />Mixi naxee nu sabatixi na wuri xungbe niini bun ma, e nun naxee nu saataxi, e fan naxa siga aligiyama, e fa mixie li e nu bara naxee faxa santidɛgɛma ra.»<verse eid="EZK 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" />«Eden wuri mundun maniyama wo xa tofanyi nun wo xa sɛnbɛ ra? Hali wo tan goro aligiyama, wo fa lu sunnataree ya ma naxee faxama santidɛgɛma ra. Na birin misaalixi Misira mangɛ Firawuna nun a xa sɔɔri gali nan na. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s">Sunnun suuki Firawuna bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />A ɲɛ fu nun firin nde, kike fu nun firin, xi singe ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" />«Adamadi suuki nde sa Misira mangɛ Firawuna bɛ, a falafe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">‹I luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ ɲamanɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">alɔ yɛxɛ magaaxuxi baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:2">naxan ye imaxama a bɛlɛ ra han a dunda.<verse eid="EZK 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:3">N na n ma yɛlɛ dusuma nɛ i xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:3">gali fa i bɛndun n ma.<verse eid="EZK 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />N i ratema nɛ xare ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:4">n i woli fiili ma, xɔnie nun burunyi subee luga i ra.<verse eid="EZK 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />N i sube sama nɛ geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:5">i xuntunyie lu gulunbae kui,<verse eid="EZK 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />bɔxi bunda i wuli ra han geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:6">i sube to folee kui.<verse eid="EZK 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" />N na i xun nakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:7">n koore makotoma nɛ, n tunbuie xa yanbɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:7">N soge makotoma nɛ nuxui ra, kike fan mu yanbama.<verse eid="EZK 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />N yanbasee birin makotoma nɛ i xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:8">n dimi rasin i xa bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:8">I Marigi Alatala xui nan nan ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />«N na i xa kanari masen ɲamanɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:9">n ɲama gbegbe raxɔnɔma nɛ i xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:9">i mu naxee kolon.<verse eid="EZK 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" />N na n ma santidɛgɛma ba a tɛɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">n si gbegbe ratɛrɛnnama nɛ i xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">e xa mangɛe fa gaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">E na i xa birɛ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:10">e birin gaaxuma nɛ e yɛtɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="EZK 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" />E Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:11">Babilɔn mangɛ xa santidɛgɛma i lima nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" />N i xa sɔɔri galie ragoroma nɛ ɲalamae xa santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">ɲalamae naxee ɲaaxu sɔɔrie birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">E Misirakae xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:12">e e xa sɔɔri galie sɔntɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />N i xa xurusee faxama nɛ Nili xure dɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:13">Mixi yo, xuruse yo, sese mu lu na ye dunda ra.<verse eid="EZK 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />N na ye raxarama nɛ, a xɛlɛ alɔ ture.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:14">I Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />«N na Misira bɔxi findi yire maxaraxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:15">n na a harige birin ba naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:15">n na a xa mixie birin faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZK 32:15">na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />«Sunnun suuki nan na ki, ɲamanɛe fama naxan bade Misira nun a xa sɔɔri galie bɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />A ɲɛ fu nun firin nde, kike fu nun firin, xi fu nun suuli nde ra, Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" />«Adamadi, wa xui rate Misira xa sɔɔri galie nun ɲamanɛe xa fe ra, naxee birin sigama aligiyama. <verse eid="EZK 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />A fala e bɛ, ‹Wo tan xa fe dangi wo booree ra? Wo faxama nɛ, wo nun sunnataree ragata yire keren.› <verse eid="EZK 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />Misira nun a xa sɔɔri galie faxama santidɛgɛma nan saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" />E ɲamanɛ mangɛ ɲalamae lima nɛ aligiyama, naxee a falama Misira xa fe ra, ‹E fan bara siga aligiyama, e fa lu sunnataree fɛ ma naxee man faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />«Asiriya nun a xa sɔɔri gali birin na mɛnni gaburie tagi, a xa mixie birin naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra. <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" />Asiriyakae ragataxi aligiyama, e xa sɔɔri galie saxi e sɛɛti ma, e tan naxee birin gbaloe radin duniɲa ma e xa santidɛgɛma saabui ra.»<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />«Elama nun a xa sɔɔri galie fan na e xa gaburie sɛɛti ma. E fan faxaxi santidɛgɛma nan na, e tan naxee gbaloe radin duniɲa ma, e fan sama nɛ sunnataree sɛɛti ma aligiyama, yaagi na e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />A tan nun a xa sɔɔri galie birin saxi mixi faxaxie ya ma mɛnni, e gaburie a rabilinxi. Na sunnataree birin faxaxi santidɛgɛma nan na. E to gbaloe radin duniɲa ma, e fan sigama nɛ aligiyama yaagi kui, e fa lu mixi faxaxie ya ma.»<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />«Meseki nun Tubali xa sɔɔri galie fan na naa gaburie kui. Na sunnataree birin faxaxi santidɛgɛma nan na, barima e nu gbaloe radinma duniɲa ma. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" />E mu saxi sɔɔri sunnatare gbɛtɛe fɛ ma, naxee sigaxi aligiyama e xa geresosee ra, e xa santidɛgɛma saxi e xunyi bun ma? E xa yunubi sare bara gbilen e xɔrie ma gbaloe xa fe ra, e naxan nabaxi duniɲa ma.»<verse eid="EZK 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />«Misira mangɛ Firawuna fan birama nɛ, a fa sa sunnataree ya ma naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra.»<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />«Edon xa mangɛe nun a xa kuntigie fan na naa. Hali e sɛnbɛ nu gbo, yakɔsi e saxi sunnataree ya ma naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra.»<verse eid="EZK 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />«Mangɛ naxee kelixi kɔɔla mabiri ra, nun Sidɔnkae fan na naa. Hali e sɛnbɛ nu gbo, e fa gbaloe raba duniɲa ma, e fan saxi sunnataree ya ma naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra. Na yaagi na e xun ma aligiyama.»<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />«Misira xa Firawuna nun a xa sɔɔri galie nee toma nɛ, e fa madundu e xa sɔɔrie xa fe ra naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" />Hali n to a lu a gbaloe raba duniɲa ma, Firawuna nun a xa sɔɔri galie sama nɛ sunnataree fɛ ma naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s">Makantama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" />«Adamadi, a fala i ngaxakerenyie bɛ, ‹N na fa santidɛgɛma ra wo xa bɔxi xili ma, na a lima nɛ wo ɲan bara mixi nde sugandi taa makantama ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" />Xa na taa makantama yaxuie to fa ra, a lanma a xa sara fe ɲama rakolonfe ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" />Xa a na raba, kɔnɔ mixi nde fa a bɔtɛ raba na marakolonyi xui ma, a fa faxa gere kui, a bara na faxɛ ragiri a yɛtɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />A to sara fe xui mɛ, kɔnɔ a fa a bɔtɛ raba, a nii kote na a yɛtɛ nan xun ma. Kɔnɔ mixi naxan na marakolonyi mɛ, a fa a suxu sɔɔbɛ ra, na kanyi a nii rakisima nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" />Kɔnɔ xa taa makantama yaxuie to fa ra, a mu sara fe a xa mixie rakolon, na tɛmui mixi naxan faxama na gere kui, hali e xa yunubie bara a niya e xa sɔntɔ, n e nii kote sama taa makantama nan xun ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />«Adamadi, n bara i sugandi taa makantama ra Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ. I xa i tuli mati n ma masenyi ra, i fa e rakolon a ra n tan xili ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />N na a fala mixi kobi bɛ a faxama nɛ, xa i mu a rakolon a xa gbilen a xa kira kobi fɔxɔ ra, na mixi ɲaaxi faxama nɛ a xa yunubi xa fe ra, kɔnɔ n na nii kote sama i tan xun ma. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" />Kɔnɔ xa i a rakolon a xa gbilen a xa kira kobi fɔxɔ ra, a fa lu a mu tin na ra, a faxama a xa yunubi xa fe nan na, kɔnɔ i tan bara i nii rakisi.»<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />«Adamadi, a fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, i naxɛ, ‹Wo yɛtɛ a falama, wo wo xa murutɛ nun wo xa yunubie kolon wo bɔɲɛ kui. Wo wama a kolonfe nɛ wo kisi sɔtɔma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" />Wo Marigi Alatala naxɛ, «N bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, n mu wama mixi kobi xa faxa, n wama nɛ a xa gbilen a xa kira kobi nan fɔxɔ ra, a xa kisi. Yandi, wo xa gbilen wo xa kira kobie fɔxɔ ra. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, wo buma faxɛ kira xɔn ma munfe ra?»›»<verse eid="EZK 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" />«Adamadi, a fala i ngaxakerenyie bɛ, ‹Tinxintɔɛ xa tinxinyi mu a rakisima a na muruta lɔxɔɛ naxɛ. Mixi tinxintare xa tinxintareya mu a ralɔɛma a na gbilen a xa kira kobi fɔxɔ ra lɔxɔɛ naxɛ. Tinxintɔɛ mu a yɛtɛ rakisima a xa tinxinyi dangixi saabui ra, xa a bira fe kobi fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />N na a masen tinxintɔɛ nde bɛ a kisima nɛ, kɔnɔ a fa la a xa tinxinyi dangixi ra, a so fe kobi rabafe, a xa tinxinyi luma nɛ a ma fu. Yakɔsi a faxama nɛ a xa fe kobi xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" />N na a masen mixi kobi nde bɛ a mu kisima, kɔnɔ a fa gbilen a xa yunubi fɔxɔ ra, a so fe tinxinxie rabafe, <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" />alɔ sɛɛkɛ ragbilenfe donima ma, se muɲaxi ragbilenfe a kanyi ma, ɲɛrɛfe sɛriyɛ kui, gbilenfe fe kobi fɔxɔ ra, na tɛmui a kisima nɛ, a mu faxama. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" />A yunubi naxan birin naba tɛmui dangixi, na birin xafarima nɛ. Xa a bara ɲɛrɛ sɛriyɛ nun tinxinyi ra, a kisima nɛ.›»<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />«I ngaxakerenyie a falama, ‹Marigi mu tinxin.› Kɔnɔ n xa a fala i bɛ, e tan nan mu tinxin. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Xa tinxintɔɛ a kobe so a xa tinxinyi ra, a so tinxintareya rabafe, a faxama nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Xa mixi tinxintare gbilen a xa fe kobie fɔxɔ ra, a so fe tinxinxie rabafe, a kisima nɛ na saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" />N xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ naxɛ n mu tinxin, kɔnɔ n fama nɛ wo tan makiitide, kankan xa a ɲɛrɛ ki sare fi.›»<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />A ɲɛ fu nun firin nde ra, kike fu, xi fu nun suuli nde ra muxu xa konyiya kui, mixi nde kelife gere yire, a naxa fa, a fala n bɛ, a e bara Darisalamu suxu. <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" />Na kɔɛ ra beenun na mixi xa fa, Alatala nu bara a bɛlɛxɛ sa n dɛ ma, a n nɛnyi rafulun alako n xa nɔ wɔyɛnde, n naxa lu boboya kui sɔnɔn.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" />«Adamadi, ɲama dɔnxɔɛ naxee sabatixi Darisalamu kanaxi tagi, nee na a falafe, ‹Iburahima naxa nɔ yi bɔxi sɔtɔde a keren. Won tan naxan findixi ɲama ra, Ala tondima yi bɔxi fide won ma?› <verse eid="EZK 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" />Na kui a lanma i xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Wo to sube donma wuli na a kui, wo to kuye batuma, wo to faxɛ tima, a lanma yi bɔxi xa findi wo gbe ra? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Wo laxi wo xa santidɛgɛma gbansan nan na, wo fe ɲaaxie rabama tɛmui birin, wo yɛnɛ rabama wo dɔxɔboore xa ginɛ ra. Hali wo to na birin nabama, wo wama nɛ yi bɔxi man xa findi wo gbe ra?›»<verse eid="EZK 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />«A fala e bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Ala yi nan masenxi: N bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, naxee luxi Darisalamu kanaxi tagi, nee faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra. Mixi naxee luxi wulai, burunyi subee nee faxama nɛ. Mixi naxee e nɔxunxi geya fari gɛmɛe longori ra, nee faxama nɛ wuganyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" />N na bɔxi findima nɛ yire maxaraxi ra, n yɛtɛ igboe xa fe xun nakana, n a niyama nɛ si gbɛtɛ mixie mu dangi Isirayila geyae ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />N na na bɔxi kana e xa fe ɲaaxie xa fe ra, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />«Adamadi, i tan to a ra, i ngaxakerenyie na a makɔyikɔyife e xɔnyi a falafe ra, ‹Wo fa, wo fa wo tuli mati. Alatala na masenyi mundun tife yi ki?› <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" />N ma ɲama fama nɛ i yire, e e tuli mati i xa masenyi ra, kɔnɔ e mu a rabatuma feo. E a falama e wama n ma fe xɔn, kɔnɔ e bɔɲɛ biraxi naafuli tinxintare nan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" />I luxi nɛ e bɛ alɔ sigisa xui ɲɔxunmɛ, naxan fe fanyie falama. E i xa masenyi mɛma, kɔnɔ e mu tinma birade a fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="EZK 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" />«N ma masenyi birin na kamali nɔndi ki ma tɛmui naxɛ, e a kolonma nɛ a namiɲɔnmɛ nde nu na e ya ma.»<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s">Xurusee nun a dɛmadonyi xa taali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" />«Adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti Isirayila yareratie bɛ naxee luxi alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyie, a falafe ra, ‹Wo Marigi Ala yi nan masenxi: Ɲaxankatɛ na wo bɛ, wo tan Isirayila xuruse dɛmadonyie. Wo wo ɲɔxɔ sama wo yɛtɛ nan tun xɔn ma. Xuruse dɛmadonyi mu lanma xɛ a xa xurusee makanta? <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" />Wo xurusee xiɲɛ minma, wo e xabe yailanma dugi ra, wo e sube donma, kɔnɔ wo mu wo ɲɔxɔ sama e xɔn ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" />Wo mu xuruse sɛnbɛtare ralimaniyama, wo mu xuruse furaxi dandanma, wo mu xuruse maxɔnɔxi maxirima seri ra. Wo mu xuruse lɔɛxie fenma, e xa gbilen gɔɔrɛ kui. Wo e yamarima nɔɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ nan tun na. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" />E yensenxi, barima xuruse dɛmadonyi mu nu na e fɔxɔ ra. Na kui wulai sube bara ndee ibɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />N ma xuruse gali bara yensen yɛ geya itexie ma, e lɔɛ duniɲa birin ma, kɔnɔ mixi yo mu mini e fende.›»<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />«Xuruse dɛmadonyie, wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra: <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" />N tan wo Marigi Alatala, n bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, wo to n ma xurusee rabɛɲin, e findi wulai subee xa baloe ra, wo to mu wo ɲɔxɔ saxi e xɔn ma, wo mɛɛni wo yɛtɛ gbansan ma, <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />wo tan xuruse dɛmadonyie xa wo tuli mati Alatala xa kiiti ra. <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N fafe na xuruse dɛmadonyie nan xili ma, e xa n sare fi gɔɔrɛ xa fe ra. N e bama nɛ xuruse dɛmadonyi wali kui, alako e naxa na raba e yɛtɛ xa geeni gbansan ma. N na n ma xurusee ratangama nɛ e ma, alako e naxa n ma xurusee tɔɔrɔ.»<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N tan yati sigama nɛ n ma xurusee fende, <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" />alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi a rabama a xa xuruse rayensenxie bɛ ki naxɛ. N e ragbilenma nɛ yire birin e lɔɛxi dɛnnaxɛ na lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" />N e raminima nɛ ɲamanɛe birin longori ra, n e xanin e xɔnyi. N mɛɛnima nɛ e ma e xa geyae fari nun e xa gulunbae kui, e xa lu e yɛtɛ xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" />N e dɛ madonma nɛ fiili fanyie ma Isirayila geyae fari. Mɛnni e e malabuma nɛ yire fanyi ma, e balo Isirayila geyae fari. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />N tan nan yati n ma xurusee dɛ madonma, n malabui fima e ma. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan nan ki. <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" />N xuruse lɔɛxi fenma nɛ, n xuruse maxɔnɔxi dandanma nɛ, n xuruse sɛnbɛtare ralimaniyama nɛ. Kɔnɔ xuruse naxee bara xungbo, naxee bara nɔ booree ra, n nee tan faxama nɛ kiiti tinxinxi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />«Wo tan n ma xurusee, wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N kiiti sama nɛ xurusee tagi, yɛxɛɛ kontonyie nun sikɔtɛe tagi. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Wo na sɛxɛ fanyi don fiili ma, na mu wo wasama, fo wo xa a dɔnxɔɛ fan iboron? Wo na ye tinsexi min, na mu wo wasama, fo wo xa a dɔnxɔɛ dunda? <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />A lanma n ma xurusee xa sɛxɛ don wo naxan iboronxi? A lanma e xa ye min, wo naxan dundaxi?»<verse eid="EZK 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />«Na kui wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi nee xa fe ra: N yɛtɛ yati nan fama kiiti sade xuruse xungbee nun a lanmae tagi. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Wo bara din n ma xuruse sɛnbɛtaree ra wo ferie ra, han e bara mini gɔɔrɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />N fama nɛ n ma xurusee rakiside, alako mixi naxa fu e ma sɔnɔn. N kiiti sama nɛ xurusee tagi. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" />N xuruse dɛmadonyi nde tima nɛ n ma xurusee xun ma, naxan fama e dɛ madonde a ki ma. N ma konyi Dawuda nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" />N tan findima nɛ e Marigi Ala ra, n ma konyi Dawuda findi mangɛ ra e tagi. N tan Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />«N bɔɲɛsa saatɛ tongoma nɛ e bɛ. N wulai sube xaaɲɛe ɲɔnma nɛ bɔxi ma, alako mixi xa nɔ sabatide yire birin bɔɲɛsa kui. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" />N baraka ragoroma nɛ e ma. N tunɛ rafama nɛ a waxati, alako bɔxi xa fan n ma geya sɛniyɛnxi rabilinyi. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" />Wurie bogima nɛ, bɔxi xɛe fan. N ma ɲama sabatima nɛ bɔɲɛsa kui a xa bɔxi ma. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra, a n tan nan yɔlɔnxɔnyie bolonma, n e ratanga e yaxuie ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Ɲamanɛe mu e tɔɔrɔma sɔnɔn, sube xaaɲɛe fan mu e donma sɔnɔn. E sabatima xaxilisa nan kui, mixi yo mu e magaaxuma. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />N e xa sansi bilie rafanma nɛ ɲamanɛe ya xɔri. Kaamɛ mu e suxuma sɔnɔn, e xa yaagi e xa setareɲa kui. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" />Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan e Marigi Alatala na e fɔxɔ ra, e man a kolon a e tan Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ findixi n ma ɲama nan na. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" />Wo tan n ma xurusee, n naxee dɛ madonma, adamadi nan wo ra. N tan nan na wo Marigi ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ na Edon bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" />«Adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti n xili ra Edonkae bɛ, naxee sabatixi Seyiri geya ma, <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" />a fala e bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N fama nɛ wo tan Edonkae xili ma, n na n sɛnbɛ ramini wo ma, n Seyiri geya findi yire maxaraxi ra. <verse eid="EZK 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" />N wo xa taae xun nakanama nɛ, nee xa findi yire rabɛɲinxi ra. Na tɛmui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" />«Wo to Isirayilakae xɔn kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye, han wo bara e yanfa, wo e sa wo yaxuie sagoe e xa ɲaxankatɛ waxati, <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" />n tan wo Marigi Alatala naxɛ, ‹N bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, n a niyama nɛ wo xa bu gere kui. Wo to gbata wuli raminide, n a ragirima nɛ na fe mɔɔli xa bira wo fɔxɔ ra tɛmui birin. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />N Seyiri geya findima nɛ yire maxaraxi ra mixi mu sigama dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" />Binbie luma nɛ wo xa bɔxi birin ma, naxee faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra wo xa geyae fari, wo xa gulunbae kui, nun wo xa folee longori ra. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" />N wo xa bɔxi findima nɛ yire maxaraxi ra, mixi yo mu sabatima wo xa taae kui. Na tɛmui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />«Wo to a fala Yudaya nun Isirayila findima nɛ wo gbe ra, hali n nu na e fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" />n bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra, n tan wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹N fan wo gerema nɛ wo xa xɔnɛ nun tɔɔnɛ bɛrɛ ma, naxan nu na wo bɔɲɛ kui e tan mabiri. N na wo makiiti tɛmui naxɛ, n na n yɛtɛ masenma nɛ e tan bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Na kui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan Alatala bara wo xa konbie birin mɛ, wo naxee ilanxi Isirayila xa geyae ra. Wo nu bara a fala, Mɛnnikae xun bara rakana, alako na bɔxi xa findi muxu gbe ra. <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />Wo xa yɛtɛ igboya kui, wo bara n mabere n ma yaragaaxuitareɲa kui. N na birin mɛ nɛ.›»<verse eid="EZK 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Duniɲa birin na lu sɛɛwɛ kui, n wo xun nakanama nɛ a ɲaaxi ra. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" />Seyiri geya nun Edonkae birin, n wo xun nakanama nɛ feo. Na tɛmui wo a kolonma nɛ, a n tan nan na Alatala ra!»<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s">Masenyi Isirayila bɔxi bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />«Adamadi, i xa masenyi ti n xili ra Isirayila xa geyae bɛ, i naxɛ, ‹Isirayila geyae, wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: Wo yaxuie bara a fala wo xa geyae findima nɛ e gbe ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" />Na kui, i xa masenyi ti n xili ra, a falafe ra, Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: E to bara wa wo xun nakanafe, e wo raxɛtɛn alako wo xa lu si gbɛtɛe sagoe naxee wo maberema, e wo mafala, <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" />n tan wo Marigi Alatala n xa a masen wo bɛ, wo tan geyae, gulunbae, folee, taa kanaxi naxee harige birin bara xanin si gbɛtɛe saabui ra, <verse eid="EZK 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" />n bara natɛ tongo n ma xɔnɛ kui si gbɛtɛe nun Edon xili ma, barima e tan bara n ma bɔxi findi e gbe ra sɛɛwɛ birin na e bɔɲɛ ɲaaxi kui, alako e xa e xa xurusee dɛ madon naa.›»<verse eid="EZK 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" />«Na kui, i xa masenyi ti n xili ra Isirayila bɔxi bɛ. A fala geyae, folee, nun gulunbae bɛ, i naxɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N na masenyi tife xɔnɛ nun tɔɔnɛ nan kui, barima si gbɛtɛe bara yo wo ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />Na xa fe ra, wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N bara n kali n bɛlɛxɛ itexi ra, ɲamanɛ naxee wo rabilinxi, e xa marasɔtɔɛe gbilenma nɛ e ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />«Wo tan Isirayila geyae, wo fama nɛ wuri bilie raminide, naxee salonyie bogi fanyie fima n ma ɲama Isirayila ma, barima a gbe mu luxi e xa gbilen e xɔnyi. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" />N mɛɛnima nɛ wo ma. N hinnɛma nɛ wo xa xɛ safe ma, <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" />nun wo xa taa tife ra. N wo xa mixie rawuyama nɛ, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xa sabati naa. <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" />N mixi nun xuruse rawuyama nɛ wo bɛ, e findi di barie ra dangi a singe ra. Na tɛmui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" />N ma ɲama Isirayila a xa nɔɛ raɲɛrɛma nɛ wo fari, wo findi e kɛ ra, wo mu e xa die ba e yi ra sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="EZK 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: ‹Mixie to a falama, a wo tan Isirayila bɔxi mixie donma, wo a niya e xa xanin konyiya kui, <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />n a niyama nɛ na mixi donfe mu fala wo xun sɔnɔn, nee birin faxa. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />N si gbɛtɛe xa marasɔtɔɛ danma nɛ wo mabiri, e mu yo wo ma sɔnɔn, wo mu wo sabati boore rabira sɔnɔn. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />Alatala man naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" />«Adamadi, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ to nu sabatixi a xa bɔxi ma, a ɲɛrɛ ki naxa a findi sɛniyɛntare ra n ya i, alɔ ginɛ naxan na a xa kike wali tofe. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" />N naxa n ma xɔnɛ dusu e xun na e xa faxɛ tife nun e xa kuye batufe xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" />N naxa e rayensen yɛ ɲamanɛe ma e ɲɛrɛ ki xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" />E siga dɛnnaxɛ duniɲa ma, mixie bara n xili sɛniyɛnxi mabere e xa fe ra, a falafe ra, ‹Ala xa ɲama nan yi ki, naxan kelixi a xa bɔxi ma!› <verse eid="EZK 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />N nu wama nɛ n xili sɛniyɛnxi matangafe, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nu naxan maberefe ɲamanɛe tagi.»<verse eid="EZK 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />«Na nan a ra, i xa a fala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe bɛ, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N fama nɛ fe nde rabade, kɔnɔ n mu a rabama wo tan bɛ, n a rabama n xili sɛniyɛnxi nan xa fe ra, wo bara naxan mabere ɲamanɛe ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" />N na n xili xungbe xa sɛniyɛnyi masenma nɛ, wo naxan maberexi. N na n ma sɛniyɛnyi masenma wo saabui ra e ya xɔri, duniɲa ɲamanɛe a kolonma nɛ a Alatala nan n na. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" />«N wo tongoma nɛ ɲamanɛe tagi, n wo ragbilen wo xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" />N ye sɛniyɛnxi kasanma nɛ wo ma wo rasɛniyɛnfe ra. N wo xa sɛniyɛntareɲa birin bama nɛ wo ma naxee fatanxi wo xa wali kobie nun wo xa kuye batufe ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" />N bɔɲɛ nɛɛnɛ nun xaxili nɛɛnɛ fima nɛ wo ma. N wo xa bɔɲɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ masara bɔɲɛ fanyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" />N na n xaxili sama nɛ wo bɔɲɛ ma, n fa a niya wo xa n ma yaamarie rabatu, wo xa bira n ma sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" />Wo sabatima nɛ bɔxi ma, n naxan fi wo benbae ma. Wo findima nɛ n ma ɲama ra, n fan findi wo Marigi Ala ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" />N wo rakisima nɛ wo xa sɛniyɛntareɲa ma, n baloe rawuyama nɛ wo bɛ, alako wo naxa lu kaamɛ kui sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" />N wuri bogie nun xɛ sansie rawuyama nɛ, alako kaamɛ naxa wo rayarabi ɲamanɛe tagi sɔnɔn. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" />Na tɛmui, wo wo ratuma nɛ wo ɲɛrɛ ki ɲaaxie ma, wo nimisa wo xa yunubie xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Wo xa a kolon a n mu yi rabama wo tan xa fe xa ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ, wo wo xun sin, wo xa yaagi wo xa fe ɲaaxi rabaxie ra.»<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: N na wo rasɛniyɛn wo xa yunubie ma lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, n wo xa taae rafema nɛ ɲama ra, n wo xa yire kanaxie yailan. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" />Xɛe fama nɛ sade bɔxi ma, naxan nu bara xara dangi mixie ya tode ra. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" />E man a falama nɛ, ‹Yi bɔxi naxan nu xaraxi, na man bara lu alɔ Eden sansi yire. A taa kanaxie man bara ti sɛnbɛ ra, mixie bara sabati e kui.› <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" />Na tɛmui, ɲamanɛ naxee luma wo rabilinyie, nee a kolonma nɛ a n tan Alatala bara yire kanaxi yailan, n bara xɛe sa bɔxi ma naxan nu bara xara. N tan Alatala xui nan na ki. N naxan fala, n na nan nabama.»<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />«Wo Marigi Ala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: N man Isirayila xa maxandi suxuma nɛ yi fe rabafe ra e bɛ. N e rawuyama nɛ alɔ xuruse gali <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />naxan toma Darisalamu sali lɔxɔɛe. Isirayila taa kanaxie rafema nɛ mixi gali ra, e fa a kolonde a n tan nan na Alatala ra.»<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s">Xɔri xaraxie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />Alatala sɛnbɛ naxa goro n ma, a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa n tongo, a sa n ti gulunba nde tagi xɔrie gbegbe nu na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />A naxa n naɲɛrɛ na xɔrie longori ra, e birin xaraxi gben. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" />A naxa n maxɔrin, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, yi xɔrie man nɔma balode?» N naxa a yaabi, «N Marigi Alatala, i keren nan a kolon!»<verse eid="EZK 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" />Na tɛmui a naxa a masen n bɛ, «I xa masenyi ti yi xɔrie bɛ n xili ra. I xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Xɔri xaraxie, wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi wo tan xɔri xaraxie bɛ, a naxɛ: N xa nii foye rafa wo ma, wo man xa balo. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" />N fasɛe yailanma nɛ wo bɛ, n fate sube nun fate kiri sa wo ma, n ɲɛngi raso wo fate i, wo fa gbilen balo ra. Na tɛmui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />N naxa a xa masenyi radangi alɔ a n yamari a ra ki naxɛ. N to nu wɔyɛnma a namiɲɔnmɛ ki ma, xui nde naxa mini xɔrie tagi, e wundu, e fa so e masofe e bore ra. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />N naxa fasɛe, sube, nun kiri to e ma, kɔnɔ nii foye mu nu rasoxi e fate.<verse eid="EZK 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" />Na tɛmui a naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti nii foye bɛ a falafe ra, ‹I Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: I tan nii foye, i xa keli duniɲa tunxun naanie ra, i xa so yi mixi faxaxie fatee, e xa keli faxɛ ma, e xa balo!› <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" />Awa, n naxa na masenyi radangi alɔ a n yamari ki naxɛ. N to na raba, nii foye naxa so e fate i, e naxa balo, e keli, e ti e sanyi xun na. Ɲama gbegbe nan nu nee ra.»<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />Na tɛmui a naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, yi xɔrie misaalixi Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nan na. E naxɛ, ‹Muxu xɔrie bara xara, muxu xaxili tidee bara ɲɔn, muxu bara rabolo.› <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" />I xa yi masenyi ti e bɛ n xili ra, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N ma ɲama, n wo xa gaburie rabima nɛ, n wo rate e kui, n wo xanin Isirayila bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />N na gɛ na rabade, wo tan n ma ɲama, wo a kolonma nɛ a Alatala nan n na. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" />N na n Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoroma nɛ wo ma, wo man gbilen balo ra, n wo rasabati wo xa bɔxi ma. Na tɛmui, wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan Alatala bara wɔyɛn, a n tan Alatala bara na rakamali. Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" />«Adamadi, i xa wuri nde tongo, i a sɛbɛ a ma, ‹Yuda nun a malan boore Isirayilakae gbe.› I xa wuri gbɛtɛ tongo, i a sɛbɛ na tan ma, ‹Yusufu xa di Efirami nun a malan boore Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ gbe.› <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" />Na tɛmui i xa e suxu i bɛlɛxɛ ra, e xa lu alɔ wuri keren.»<verse eid="EZK 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" />«I ngaxakerenyie na i maxɔrin na fatanfasife ra e bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />i xa e yaabi, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N Yusufu xa wuri tongoma nɛ, naxan na Efirami nun a malan boore Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe yi ra, n xa dɔxɔ Yuda xa wuri ra, e xa findi keren na n bɛlɛxɛ kui. <verse eid="EZK 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20" />I xa na wurie itala e mabiri, sɛbɛli tixi naxee ma, <verse eid="EZK 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21" />i a fala e bɛ, Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N Isirayilakae tongoma nɛ ɲamanɛe kui, n e ragbilen e xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" />N e birin findi si keren na Isirayila geyae fari. Mangɛ keren nan e birin yamarima. E mu mɛɛma e bore ra sɔnɔn findife si firin na. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" />E mu findima sɛniyɛntaree ra sɔnɔn, kuye batufe ra nun fe ɲaaxi rabafe ra. N e ratangama nɛ na birin ma, n e rasɛniyɛn. E findima nɛ n ma ɲama ra, n fan findi e Marigi Ala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" />«N ma konyi Dawuda nan findima e xa mangɛ ra, xuruse kantɛ keren lu e birin bɛ. E birama nɛ n ma yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, e n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu a ki ma. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" />E sabatima nɛ bɔxi ma, n naxan fi n ma konyi Yaxuba ma, wo benbae sabati dɛnnaxɛ. E tan, e xa die nun e xa mamadie sabatima nɛ mɛnni, n ma konyi Dawuda nan findima e xa mangɛ ra abadan. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" />N bɔɲɛsa saatɛ tongoma nɛ e bɛ, naxan mu kanama abadan. N e rasabatima nɛ naa, n e bɔnsɔɛ rawuya. N ma hɔrɔmɔlingira luma nɛ e tagi abadan. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" />E findima nɛ n ma ɲama ra, n fan findi e Marigi Ala ra, n ma hɔrɔmɔlingira fa lu e ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />N ma hɔrɔmɔlingira na sabati e tagi abadan, si gbɛtɛe a kolonma nɛ a n tan Alatala nan Isirayila rasɛniyɛnxi.»<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa masenyi mangɛ Gogo bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" />«Adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti Magogo bɔxi mangɛ Gogo bɛ, naxan Rosi, Meseki, nun Tubali taae yamarima. <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />A fala a bɛ, ‹Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Rosi, Tubali nun Meseki xa mangɛ Gogo, n fafe i xili ma. <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" />N wure rasoma nɛ i banganyie kui, n i ramini, i tan nun i xa sɔɔri galie birin: i xa soee, e ragima tofanyie, i xa sɔɔrie nun e xa wure lefa yanbaxie, <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />sɔɔri Perisekae, sɔɔri Kusikae, sɔɔri Putikae, e birin nun e xa wure lefae nun e xun makanta see, <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />Gomeri nun a xa sɔɔri gali, Togarama nun a xa sɔɔri gali kelife kɔɔla ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />«I xa na sɔɔri galie birin yailan a fanyi ra i xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" />Tɛmui xɔnkuye na dangi, n i xilima nɛ gere tife ra. I fama nɛ sigade bɔxi nde ma naxan bara gere raba, e xanin konyiya kui ɲamanɛ ma, e fa gbilen e xɔnyi, e sabati bɔɲɛsa kui Isirayila geyae fari. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" />I mɛnni lima nɛ alɔ turunnaadɛ, i tan nun i xa sɔɔri galie naxee kelixi duniɲa birin ma. Wo luma nɛ alɔ nuxui ifɔɔrɔxi naxan tima bɔxi xun na.»<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />«Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: Na lɔxɔɛ, i natɛ ɲaaxi tongoma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" />I a falama nɛ, ‹N sigama nɛ bɔxi xili ma, tɛtɛ mu naxan nabilinxi. Naakae mu yailanxi gere tife ra, e birin sabatixi bɔɲɛsa kui. Tɛtɛ mu na e xa taae rabilinyi, naadɛ balanxie mu na e xɔnyi. <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />N e harige birin tongoma nɛ e xa taa yailanxie kui, e gbilenxi dɛnnaxɛ kelife ɲamanɛ ma. Naafuli nun xuruse gbegbe na mɛnni bɔxi tagi.› <verse eid="EZK 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />Seebakae, Dedankae, Tarasisi yulɛe, nun e xa mixie birin i maxɔrinma nɛ, ‹I na sigafe naafuli nan tongode? I bara sɔɔri galie xili wo xa muɲɛ belebele ti, alɔ xɛɛma, gbeti, xurusee, nun se fanyi gbɛtɛe?›»<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />«Na nan a ra, adamadi, i xa n ma masenyi ti Gogo bɛ, i naxɛ, ‹Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: N ma ɲama Isirayila na sabati xaxilisa kui lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, i fama na tode. <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />I kelima nɛ i xɔnyi kɔɔla mabiri, i tan nun sɔɔri gali wuyaxie kelife duniɲa birin ma, e birin tixi soee fari, e bira i fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />I fama nɛ n ma ɲama Isirayila xili ma, alɔ nuxui ifɔɔrɔxi naxan dusuma bɔxi xun na. Na tɛmui n i rafama nɛ n ma bɔxi xili ma, alako duniɲa xa n ma sɛniyɛnyi kolon i saabui ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />«Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: Tɛmui dangixi n ma konyi namiɲɔnmɛ Isirayilakae nu bara i xa fe fala, n i xɛɛma e gerede ki naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />Yi nan fama rabade na lɔxɔɛ: Gogo na din Isirayila ra, n ma xɔnɛ tema nɛ alɔ tɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" />Isirayila bɔxi sɛrɛnma nɛ n ma xɔnɛ xungbe kui. <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" />Yɛxɛe, xɔnie, wulai subee, bubusee, nun adamadie birin, e gaaxuma nɛ n ya ra. Geyae nun tentenyie birama nɛ, banxie xalɛe kana. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" />N gere ya rafindima nɛ Gogo ma n ma geyae birin fari! Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. A xa sɔɔrie e xa santidɛgɛma raminima nɛ e tɛɛ kui e ngaxakerenyie xili ma. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" />N Gogo xun nakanama nɛ wuganyi nun faxɛ tife ra. N tunɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ, balabalanyi, nun tɛ ragoroma nɛ a ma, a nun a xa sɔɔri galie ma kelife duniɲa birin ma. <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" />Na kui, n na n ma mangɛya nun n ma sɛniyɛnyi masenma nɛ duniɲa si birin bɛ. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a Alatala nan n na.»<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛ Gogo raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />«Adamadi, n ma masenyi xɔrɔxɔɛ ti mangɛ Gogo bɛ, a falafe ra, ‹Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Meseki nun Tubali mangɛ Gogo, n bara ti i kanke! <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" />N i mafindima nɛ alɔ n wama a xɔn ki naxɛ. N i rakelima i xɔnyi kɔɔla ma, n fa i ra Isirayila geyae ma gere tife ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" />Mɛnni n i xa xali nun i xa xali woli se rabirama nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" />I tan nun i xa sɔɔrie birin faxama nɛ na geyae longori. N wo findima yubɛe nun burunyi subee xa donse nan na, <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />wo binbie fa lu kɛnɛ ma. Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" />N tɛ soma nɛ Magogo ra, nun yire raxaraxi baa dɛ ra. Na tɛmui, e a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›»<verse eid="EZK 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />«N na n xili sɛniyɛnxi masenma nɛ n ma ɲama Isirayila bɛ, n man mu tinma sɔnɔn e xa n mabere. Si gbɛtɛe fama nɛ a kolonde, a n tan Alatala nan na Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" />Na fe birin fama nɛ rabade. Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. Lɔxɔɛ na a ra, n naxan xa fe fala.»<verse eid="EZK 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />«Isirayilaka naxee sabatixi taae kui, e minima geresosee matongode bɔxi ma, alɔ wure lefae, xalie, xalie woli see, tanbɛe, nun wuri faxɛti see, e fa e gan yege fari. Na e hayi fanma ɲɛ solofere nan bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" />E mu yege fenma fiili nun fɔtɔnyi ma sɔnɔn, barima geresosee nan findima yege ra e bɛ. Naxee bara wa harige bafe e yi ra, e tan nan fama harige bade nee yi ra. Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />«Na lɔxɔɛ, n a niyama nɛ Gogo xa ragata Isirayila bɔxi ma, gulunba nde kui mixie dangima dɛnnaxɛ sigafe ra baa dɛ ra sogetede mabiri. Na gulunba kira ibolonma nɛ Gogo nun a xa sɔɔrie ragatade xa fe ra. E mɛnni xili sama nɛ ‹Gogo xa ɲama xa gulunba.›»<verse eid="EZK 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" />«Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ kike solofere nan nabama na mixie ragatafe ra, alako e xa bɔxi xa sɛniyɛn. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" />Ɲama birin luma nɛ na wali raba ra. N ma nɔrɛ to lɔxɔɛ findima fe belebele nan na e bɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />E mixie sugandima nɛ bɔxi rasɛniyɛnde. Nee tan nun e booree luma nɛ bɔxi birin iɲɛrɛ ra binbie ragatafe ra. Na wali buma nɛ ɲɛ solofere. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />E na gɛ na ra, e man bɔxi iɲɛrɛma nɛ mixi xɔrie fende. E na nde to, e tɔnxuma nde ti naa alako gaburi gemae xa a to, e xa na xɔrie xanin Gogo xa ɲama xa gulunba yire. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />E bɔxi rasɛniyɛnma na ki nɛ. Taa nde tima naa, naxan xilima Hamona. Xili nan na ki naxan a falama ‹Ɲama› e gbe xui ra.»<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />«Adamadi, i Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: A fala wulai xɔnie nun sube mɔɔli birin bɛ, ‹Wo birin xa fa be, n xa n ma sɛrɛxɛ xungbe rafala Isirayila geyae ma. Mɛnni wo sube nun wuli donma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" />Wo sɛnbɛmae sube donma nɛ, wo bɔxi mangɛe wuli min alɔ xuruse naxee raturaxi Basan bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />Na sɛrɛxɛ tɛmui, wo wasama nɛ e sube ra, wo siisi e wuli ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />Wo lugama nɛ soe nun a ragimae sube ra, mangɛe nun sɔɔri mɔɔli birin sube. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />«N na n ma nɔrɛ masenma nɛ duniɲa birin bɛ Gogo ɲama xa ɲaxankatɛ saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Keli na lɔxɔɛ ma, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" />Si gbɛtɛe a kolonma nɛ a Isirayila xa yunubie nan a niya e xa siga konyiya kui. E to n yanfa, n naxa n kobe raso e ra, n fa e sa e yaxuie sagoe. Na nan a ra, e naxa faxa santidɛgɛma ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />N e ɲaxankataxi e xa yunubie nun e xa sɛniyɛntareɲa nan ma. Na nan a niyaxi n xa n kobe so e ra.»<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />«Awa, i Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: Yakɔsi, n Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ragbilenma nɛ kelife konyiya kui. N kinikinima nɛ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma, n fa a ragiri n xili xa binya. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" />E na sabati e xɔnyi xaxilisa kui, mixi yo mu e tɔɔrɔ, yaagi man luma nɛ e ma e xa yanfanteya xa fe ra n tan mabiri. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" />N na e raminima nɛ ɲamanɛe kui, n fa e ra e xɔnyi, ɲamanɛe fa n ma sɛniyɛnyi tode na saabui ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />Na tɛmui, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na e Marigi Alatala ra, barima hali n to e rasiga konyiya kui ɲamanɛe tagi, n man bara e birin nagbilen, mixi yo mu lu e xanbi ra. <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" />N mu n kobe soma e ra sɔnɔn, barima n na n Xaxili luma nɛ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ ma. I Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="s">Hɔrɔmɔbanxi nɛɛnɛ xa tɛtɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />Muxu xa konyiya ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nde ra, ɲɛ kike singe ra, xi fu nde ra, naxan nu ilanxi Darisalamu xa kanɛ dangi xanbi ɲɛ fu nun naani nde ma, na lɔxɔɛ yati yati, Alatala sɛnbɛ naxa goro n ma, <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" />a n xanin laamatunyi ki ma Isirayila geya itexi nde fari. N naxa taa nde to kɔɔla mabiri. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" />Alatala to n xanin naa, n naxa xɛmɛ nde to, naxan fate nu yanbafe alɔ wure gbeeli. A nu tixi sode dɛ ra, luuti nun maniya se wuri suxuxi a yi ra. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" />Na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, i ya ti a fanyi ra, i tuli mati n xui ra. N fe naxan birin masenma i bɛ, i xa i ɲɔxɔ sa a xɔn ma, barima i rafaxi nɛ be alako i xa na kolon, i xa na birin tagi raba Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />N naxa tɛtɛ nde to naxan hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinxi. Wuri maniya se nu na na xɛmɛ yi ra, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya senni a nun suxui senni. A naxa tɛtɛ xɛlɛ xa maigboe nun a xa maite maniya, e firinyi birin lan na wuri maniyase ya keren nan ma.<verse eid="EZK 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" />A naxa siga sode dɛ ra, naxan ya rafindixi sogetede ma. A naxa te na tede ra naxee nu na a ya ra, a sode dɛ xa maite maniya, naxan lan na wuri maniyase ya keren ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7" />Hɔrɔmɔlingira kantamae xa tede nu na sode dɛ sɛɛti ma, kankan xa maite nun maigboe lan na wuri maniyase ya keren nan ma. Xɛlɛ naxan nu na e tagi, na lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. Buntunyi sode dɛ xa maite fan lan na wuri maniyase ya keren nan ma, naxan ya nu rafindixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi ma.<verse eid="EZK 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8" />A naxa buntunyi maniya, <verse eid="EZK 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9" />naxan xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya solomasaxan ma, a kinkie lan nɔngɔn ya firin ma. Na buntunyi ya nu rafindixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi nan ma tɛtɛ kui.<verse eid="EZK 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi kantamae tide senni nu na sogetede sode dɛ sɛɛtie ma, sɛɛti keren saxan, sɛɛti boore fan saxan. Nee birin xa maniyɛ xasabi lan, e kinkie fan birin xa maniyɛ xasabi lan. <verse eid="EZK 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />A naxa sode dɛ xa maigboe maniya, naxan lan nɔngɔn fu ma, a xa maite lan nɔngɔn fu nun saxan nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />Xɛlɛ di nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi kantamae xa tidee ya ra, naxan nu ite nɔngɔn ya keren. Na tidee xa maigboe nun e xa maite lan nɔngɔn ya senni nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />A naxa a maniya kelife kantama singe xa tide xanbi ra, han boore kantama xa tide xanbi ra, na fa lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli ma, kelife yire fanyi ma, han kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" />A naxa xɛlɛ birin maniya na sode dɛ longori han tɛtɛ kui, na lan nɔngɔn ya tongo senni nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Kelife sode dɛ ra, han tɛtɛ kui buntunyi xanbi ra, na lan nɔngɔn ya tongo suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" />Wundɛrie nu na na xalɛe ma sode dɛ mabiri, alɔ wundɛri gbɛtɛe to nu na xalɛe ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi mabiri. Tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi na longori birin.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />A to n naso tɛtɛ kui, n naxa yire tongo saxan to naxee fatuxi tɛtɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Bɔxi nu yailanxi gɛmɛ fanyie nan na naxan xa maite lan tɛtɛ sode dɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Na xɛmɛ naxa a maniya kelife sode dɛ fɔlɛ ma, han tɛtɛ gbɛtɛ sode dɛ ra naxan nu na na tɛtɛ singe kui. Na lan nɔngɔn kɛmɛ nan ma sogetede mabiri nun kɔɔla mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa tɛtɛ sode dɛ maniya naxan nu na kɔɔla mabiri. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi kantamae tidee fan nu na mɛnni alɔ boore sode dɛe ra. Saxan nu na sɛɛti keren, saxan nu na boore sɛɛti. Na xa maite lan nɔngɔn tongo suuli nan ma, a maigboe lan nɔngɔn mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />A xa wundɛrie, a xa buntunyi, a xa tugi fɛnsɛ naxee masolixi a ma, nee nun sogetede sode dɛ xa maniyɛ xasabi lan. Santide solofere nan nu na a bɛ tede ra, a xa buntunyi nu na nee nan ya i. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Tɛtɛ firin nde sode dɛ nu na tɛtɛ singe sode dɛ nan ya ra kɔɔla nun sogetede mabiri. Nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nu na e tagi.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin tɛtɛ sode dɛ yirefanyi mabiri. Mɛnni xa maniyɛ xasabi lan boore sode dɛe xa maniyɛ nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Wundɛrie nu na na sode dɛ nun a xa buntunyi bɛ e rabilinyi birin ma, alɔ boore sode dɛe. Na sode dɛ nu ite nɔngɔn ya tongo suuli, a nu igbo nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Santide solofere nan nu na a bɛ tede ra, a xa buntunyi nu na nee nan ya i. Tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi a kinkie sɛɛti birin ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Tɛtɛ firin nde sode dɛ fan nu na yirefanyi mabiri. Kelife na sode dɛ ma han na tɛtɛ singe sode dɛ yirefanyi mabiri, a lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin na tɛtɛ firin nde kui naxan nu na boore tɛtɛ kui. A naxa n naso na yirefanyi sode dɛ ra. A naxa na maniya. A tan nun sode dɛ booree birin nu lan. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />A kantamae tidee, a xa kinkie, nun a xa buntunyi xa maniyɛ xasabi lan booree xasabi nan ma. Wundɛrie nu na na sode dɛ nun a xa buntunyi birin nabilinyi ra. Kelife na sode dɛ fɔlɛ ma, han tɛtɛ kui lan nɔngɔn ya tongo suuli nan ma, a igboe lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />Buntunyi naxee nu na na tɛtɛ firin nde kui, e xa maigboe lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma, e xa maite lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Na buntunyi ya nu rafindixi tɛtɛ singe nan ma. Tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi e kinkie ma, tede solomasaxan nan nu na e bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin yi tɛtɛ firin nde sode dɛ ra naxan nu na sogetede mabiri. A naxa na maniya. A tan nun sode dɛ booree birin nu lan. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />A kantamae tidee, a xa kinkie, nun a xa buntunyi xa maniyɛ nu lanxi booree xa maniyɛ nan ma. Wundɛrie nu na na sode dɛ nun a xa buntunyi rabilinyi birin ma. A xa maigboe lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma, a xa maite lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Na buntunyi ya nu rafindixi tɛtɛ singe nan ma. Tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi e kinkie ma, tede solomasaxan nan nu na e bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin yi tɛtɛ firin nde sode dɛ ra, naxan nu na kɔɔla mabiri. A naxa na maniya. A tan nun sode dɛ booree birin nu lan. <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />A kantamae tidee, a xa kinkie, nun a xa buntunyi xa maniyɛ nu lanxi booree xa maniyɛ nan ma. Wundɛrie nu na na sode dɛ nun a xa buntunyi rabilinyi birin ma. A xa maigboe lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma, a xa maite lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Na buntunyi ya nu rafindixi tɛtɛ singe nan ma. Tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi e kinkie ma, tede solomasaxan nan nu na e bɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />Yire nde nu na kankan xa sode dɛ ra, xuruse naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, nee nu maxama mɛnni nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" />Teebilie nu na sode dɛ buntun firinyi kui, firin nu na sɛɛti keren ma, firin nu na boore sɛɛti fan ma. Xurusee kɔn naxabama na teebilie nan fari, naxee findi sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Teebili gbɛtɛe nu na sode dɛ tede sɛɛtie ma, firin sɛɛti keren, firin boore sɛɛti fan ma, tɛtɛ fari ma buntunyi kui. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Na nan a ra teebili naani nu na sode dɛ sɛɛti keren na, naani nu na boore sɛɛti ra. Xurusee nu rafalama na teebilie nan fari beenun e xa ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Na teebili naanie nu yailanxi gɛmɛe nan na, e nu kuya nɔngɔn ya keren nun a tagi, e nu igbo nɔngɔn ya keren. Yirabasee nu sama nee nan fari, naxee nu lanma e xa rawali xuruse rafalafe ra naxee nu findima sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun sɛrɛxɛ mɔɔli gbɛtɛe ra. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Wuree nu na banxi xɛlɛ ma xurusee nu gbakuma dɛnnaxɛ, e sube sa teebilie fari.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />Tɛtɛ firin nde sode dɛ sɛɛti firinyie ma, yire nde nu na naxan ya rafindixi yirefanyi ma, yire nde fan nu na naxan ya rafindixi kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" />Na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, a naxɛ: «Yire naxan ya rafindixi yirefanyi ma, na findixi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe gbe nan na, naxee hɔrɔmɔbanxi makantama. <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" />Yire naxan ya rafindixi kɔɔla ma, na findixi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe gbe nan na, naxee sɛrɛxɛbade makantama. Nee findi Sadɔki xa die nan na, naxee findi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi ra, naxee gbansan lan e xa makɔrɛ Alatala yire ra e xa wali kui.»<verse eid="EZK 40:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" />Na xɛmɛ naxa tɛtɛ maniya. A xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma, a xa gboe fan lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma. Sɛrɛxɛbade nu tixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi nan yatagi.<verse eid="EZK 40:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa buntunyi ra. A naxa buntunyi xɛlɛ bun se maniya. Keren lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma, boore fan naxa lan nɔngɔn ya suuli ma. Sode dɛ xa gboe lan nɔngɔn ya fu nun naani nan ma. Banxi xɛlɛ naxee nu na na sɛɛti firinyie ma lan nɔngɔn ya saxan nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" />Na buntunyi xa maigboe lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma, a xa maite lan nɔngɔn ya fu nun firin nan ma. Tedee nu na a bɛ. Kinki firin nu tixi buntunyi xɛlɛ sɛɛtie ma.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="s">Hɔrɔmɔbanxi nɛɛnɛ xalɛe nun naadɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire sɛniyɛnxi kui. A naxa a kinkie maniya naxee nu na naadɛ sɛɛtie ma. Kankan xa gboe naxa lan nɔngɔn ya senni ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" />Sode dɛ xa gboe lan nɔngɔn ya fu nan ma. Banxi xɛlɛ naxee nu na na sɛɛti firinyie ma, e lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. A naxa na hɔrɔmɔbanxi maniya. A xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya tongo naani nan ma, a xa gboe lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma.<verse eid="EZK 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa so hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire sɛniyɛnxi fisamante kui. A naxa a kinkie maniya naxee nu na naadɛ sɛɛtie ma. Kankan xa gboe naxa lan nɔngɔn ya firin ma. A sode dɛ lan nɔngɔn ya senni nan ma. Banxi xɛlɛ naxee nu na na sɛɛti firinyie ma, e lan nɔngɔn ya solofere nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" />A naxa a xa kuyɛ nun a xa gboe maniya, kankan naxa lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn ma. A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Yire sɛniyɛnxi fisamante nan yi ki.»<verse eid="EZK 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" />A naxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xɛlɛ maniya. A xa marabinye naxa lan nɔngɔn ya senni ma. Yire naxee nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi ma, kankan xa gboe lan nɔngɔn ya naani nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Na yiree nu dɔxɔxi e bore nan kɔn na dɛki saxan na. Konkoe tongo saxan nan nu na na dɛki keren keren birin ma. Bun se nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi, kɔnɔ e mu nu rasoxi hɔrɔmɔbanxi xɛlɛ tan kui. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Dɛkie nu te igbo ra e bore bɛ alako naxan na koore ma naxa igbo dangi lanbanyi daaxi ra. Tedee nu na keli lanbanyi ma a sa dɔxɔ dɛki dɔnxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="EZK 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8" />N naxa a rabɛn, sanbunyi nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi ma, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya senni. Na yire naxee nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi, e nu tixi na sanbunyi fari. <verse eid="EZK 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9" />Na yiree xɛlɛ xa marabinye lan nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. Kɛnɛ naxan nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi <verse eid="EZK 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10" />nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa konkoe tagi, a lan nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma, a rabilinyi birin na. <verse eid="EZK 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11" />Na yire naxee nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi, e sode dɛ keren nu na kɔɔla ma, keren fan nu na yirefanyi ma. Kɛnɛ nu na e rabilinyi ma, naxan lan nɔngɔn ya suuli ma.<verse eid="EZK 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Banxi gbɛtɛ nde nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi sogegorode mabiri, naxan xa maigboe nu lanxi nɔngɔn ya tongo solofere ma, a xa kuyɛ nu lanxi nɔngɔn ya tongo solomanaani nan ma. A xɛlɛ xa marabinye nu lanxi nɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma.<verse eid="EZK 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Na xɛmɛ naxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi maniya. A xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma. Kɛnɛ, banxi, nun a xɛlɛ, nee fan xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />Kɛnɛ naxan nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi sogetede mabiri, a lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma.<verse eid="EZK 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15" />Na xɛmɛ naxa banxi maniya, naxan nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi xanbi ra, nun dangide naxee nu na a sɛɛti firinyi ma, na lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ nan ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15">Hɔrɔmɔbanxi, a xa buntunyi, <verse eid="EZK 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16" />a sode dɛe, nun a wundɛrie, na birin nu ratofanxi wuri fanyi nan na, kelife lanbanyi ma han koore. <verse eid="EZK 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17" />Sode dɛ xun ma nun banxi xɛlɛ birin nabilinyi, a kui nun a fari, <verse eid="EZK 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18" />malekɛe nun tugi fɛnsɛe nan nu masolixi a ma a raxunmase ra. Tugi fɛnsɛ keren nan nu masolixi malekɛ firin tagi. Yatagi firin nan nu na na malekɛ birin bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" />a mixi daaxi nun a yɛtɛ daaxi. Na mixi yatagi nu rafindixi tugi fɛnsɛ nan ma, na yɛtɛ yatagi nu rafindixi tugi fɛnsɛ nan ma boore sɛɛti mabiri. <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />Malekɛe nun tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi kelife hɔrɔmɔbanxi lanbanyi ma han koore.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Sode dɛ nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa yire sɛniyɛnxi ma, a maniyɛ fan nu na a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi fisamante ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" />Sɛrɛxɛbade nde nu na mɛnni, naxan nu rafalaxi wuri ra, a xa maite lan nɔngɔn ya saxan nan ma, a xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya firin nan ma, a xa maigboe nu lanxi nɔngɔn ya firin nan ma. A tunxunyie, a dɛ kirie, nun a sɛɛtie birin nu yailanxi wuri nan na. Na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «Yi teebili nan na Alatala ya i.» <verse eid="EZK 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" />Naadɛ firin nan nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire sɛniyɛnxi sode dɛ ra, naadɛ firin nan nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire sɛniyɛnxi fisamante sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />Naadɛ bɛla firin nan nu na na sode dɛ firinyi, naxee nu ragalima sode dɛ ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" />Malekɛe nun tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛe ma, alɔ a nu masolixi a xɛlɛe ma ki naxɛ. Wurie fan nu na buntunyi ma koore ma. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" />Wundɛrie nu na buntunyi xɛlɛ ma a sɛɛtie ma, tugi fɛnsɛe nu masolixi wundɛrie sɛɛtie ma. Wurie fan nu na na yiree xun na, naxee nu tixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa banxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />Na dangi xanbi, na xɛmɛ naxa n namini na tɛtɛ singe kui kɔɔla ma. A naxa n xanin banxi yire, naxan nu na tɛtɛ singe xɛlɛ kɔɔla mabiri nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi tagi. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Na banxi xa sode dɛ ya nu rafindixi kɔɔla nan ma. Na banxi nu kuya nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ, a nu igbo nɔngɔn ya tongo suuli. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" />Sɛɛti naxan nu kuya tɛtɛ mabiri nɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn, a nun sɛɛti naxan nu na hɔrɔmɔbanxi mabiri, konkoee yire dɛki saxan nde nu tixi na yire firinyi ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />Ɲɛrɛdee nu na na sɛɛti firinyi ma naxee nu igbo nɔngɔn ya fu, e nu kuya nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ alɔ banxi. Konkoee sode dɛe nu rafindixi kɔɔla nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5" />Konkoe naxee nu na koore dɛki saxan nde ma, nee nu ixutu dangife boore ra lanbanyi. <verse eid="EZK 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6" />Kinki yo mu nu na na dɛki saxan nde bɛ, e ixutuxi na nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7" />Xɛlɛ nu tixi konkoe nun tɛtɛ singe tagi, a nu kuya nɔngɔn ya tongo suuli. <verse eid="EZK 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8" />Boore sɛɛti hɔrɔmɔbanxi mabiri a nu kuya nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9" />Konkoe naxee nu na lanbanyi, e sode dɛe nu na sogetede mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />Konkoe gbɛtɛe nu na yirefanyi mabiri tɛtɛ singe xɛlɛ longori ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi ya i. <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />Ɲɛrɛde nde nu na e ya ra. Na konkoe nu maniyaxi konkoe nan na naxee nu na kɔɔla mabiri. E firin nafala ki, e xa kuyɛ nun e xa gboe, na birin lan. <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />E xa sode dɛe nu na yirefanyi nan ma. Naadɛ xungbe nde nu na sogetede mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />Na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Konkoe naxee na yirefanyi nun kɔɔla ma tɛtɛ ya i, nee findixi yire sɛniyɛnxie nan na, Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe sɛrɛxɛ sube donma dɛnnaxɛ. E sɛrɛxɛ sɛniyɛnxie ragatama mɛnni nɛ naxee findixi sansi xɔri sɛrɛxɛe, yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛe ra. Yire sɛniyɛnxi nan mɛnni ra. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe na so yire sɛniyɛnxie, a mu lanma e xa mini ɲama ya ma tɛtɛ kui, fo e xa e xa dugi sɛniyɛnxie ba.»<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Na xɛmɛ to gɛ hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire maniyade, a naxa n namini sogetede sode dɛ ra, a fa na tɛtɛ rabilinyi birin maniya. <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16" />A naxa a fɔlɔ sogetede mabiri. Na sɛɛti xa kuyɛ lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17" />Na tɛmui, a naxa kɔɔla sɛɛti maniya, naxan xa kuyɛ fan lan a ya kɛmɛ suuli ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18" />Na tɛmui, a naxa yirefanyi sɛɛti maniya, naxan xa kuyɛ fan lan a ya kɛmɛ suuli ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19" />A raɲɔnyi, a naxa sogegorode sɛɛti maniya, naxan xa kuyɛ fan lan a ya kɛmɛ suuli ma. <verse eid="EZK 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" />A naxa tɛtɛ rabilinyi birin maniya a xa wuri maniyase ra. Tɛtɛ sɛɛti naanie birin lan wuri ya kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. Na tɛtɛ nu tixi yire sɛniyɛnxi nun yire sɛniyɛntare nan tagi.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa nɔrɛ gbilenfe hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin sogetede sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" />N naxa Isirayila Marigi Ala xa nɔrɛ to fafe ra kelife sogetede mabiri. A nu xui naxan naminima, na nu luxi nɛ alɔ baa xungbe mɔrɔnyie, bɔxi fan nu iyalanma a yanbɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" />N laamatunyi naxan to, na nu luxi nɛ alɔ n naxan to Marigi fa lɔxɔɛ Darisalamu kanade. A nu luxi nɛ alɔ n naxan to Kebara xure dɛ ra. N to a to, n naxa n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" />Alatala xa nɔrɛ naxa so hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui sogetede sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" />Na tɛmui, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa n tongo, a n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ firin nde kui, Alatala xa nɔrɛ nu bara gbo dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="EZK 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />N nu na na xɛmɛ sɛɛti ma, kɔnɔ n naxa xui nde mɛ wɔyɛnfe n na kelife hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" />Na xui naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, n ma kibanyi yire nan ya, n sanyi tima dɛnnaxɛ. N sabatima nɛ be Isirayilakae ya ma abadan. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ nun a xa mangɛe mu n xili sɛniyɛnxi maberema sɔnɔn e xa langoeɲa ra, nun e xa gaburi tife ra e xa salide itexie ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />Mangɛe na e xa banxi sode dɛe nun e xa banxi xalɛe ti n gbee sɛɛti ma, e n xili sɛniyɛnxi maberexi na ki nɛ e xa wali kobi ra. N e sɔntɔxi n ma xɔnɛ kui na nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Yakɔsi fa, e xa e xa kuye batui nun e xa mangɛe furee makuya n na, alako n xa lu e ya ma abadan.»<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10" />«Adamadi, i xa yi hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe masen Isirayilakae bɛ, alako e xa yaagi e xa yunubie ra. E xa yi banxi ti ki mato. <verse eid="EZK 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11" />Xa e bara yaagi e xa wali kobie ra, yi banxi xa fe rakolon e ra, a tixi mɔɔli naxan na, a sode dɛe nun a minide dɛe na ki naxɛ, nun a xa fe raba kɛɲa, alako e xa bira na yaamarie fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="EZK 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" />«Hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa sɛriyɛ nan ya: Bɔxi naxan birin na yi geya fari, na birin sɛniyɛnxi. Hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa sɛriyɛ nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />«Sɛrɛxɛbade xa maniyɛ xasabi nan yi ki, naxan maniyaxi maniyase ra singe maniyase nu dangi naxan na bɛlɛxɛ suxu keren. Fole naxan gexi sɛrɛxɛbade rabilinyi, a tilin nɔngɔn ya keren, a igbo nɔngɔn ya keren. A dɛ kiri igboe lanxi nɔngɔn tagi nan ma. Sɛrɛxɛbade xa maite <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14" />kelife na fole ma han sɛrɛxɛbade bunyi, a lanxi nɔngɔn ya firin nan ma. A igboe lanxi nɔngɔn ya keren nan ma. Sɛrɛxɛbade xa maite kelife a bunyi ma han a koore, na lanxi nɔngɔn ya naani nan ma, a igboe lanxi nɔngɔn ya keren nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15" />Sɛrɛxɛbade xa tɛ sade tilinyi lanxi nɔngɔn ya naani nan ma. Feri naani tixi sɛrɛxɛbade tunxunyie ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16" />Na tɛ sade xa kuyɛ lanxi nɔngɔn ya fu nun firin nan ma. A igboe fan lanxi nɔngɔn ya fu nun firin nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" />A dɛ rabilinyi xa kuyɛ lanxi nɔngɔn ya fu nun naani nan ma, a igboe fan lanxi nɔngɔn ya fu nun naani nan ma. Na dɛ rabilinyi dɛ kiri lanxi nɔngɔn tagi nan ma, a dɛnnaxɛ kui igexi a lanxi nɔngɔn ya keren nan ma. Sɛrɛxɛbade santidee ya nu rafindixi sogetede nan ma.»<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, i Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹Sɛriyɛ nan yi ki sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi xa fe ra nun wuli kasanfe xa fe ra yi sɛrɛxɛbade bɛ a ti tɛmui. <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" />A lanma i xa tuura keren so Lewi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe Sadɔki bɔnsɔɛ yi ra, naxee na bama yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" />E xa na wuli di sa sɛrɛxɛbade ferie ma, a tunxun naani birin ma lanbanyi, nun a dɛ rabilinyi birin ma. Sɛrɛxɛbade rasɛniyɛnma na ki nɛ, a findi xunsare ra a bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" />E xa na tuura tongo, naxan bama yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, a xa gan hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui a lanma a xa gan dɛnnaxɛ sɛriyɛ ki ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />«Na lɔxɔɛ kuye iba, e xa sikɔtɛ keren tongo, lanyuru yo mu na naxan ma, e xa a ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra sɛrɛxɛbade rasɛniyɛnfe ra, alɔ e a raba ki naxɛ tuura ra. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23" />E na gɛ sɛrɛxɛbade rasɛniyɛnde na ki, e man xa tuura keren nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren tongo, lanyuru yo mu naxee ma, <verse eid="EZK 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24" />e xa nee ba Alatala bɛ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe lanma e xa fɔxɛ kasan na birin ma.»<verse eid="EZK 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" />«Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ han xi solofere, e xa sikɔtɛ keren ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra, a nun tuura nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Han xi solofere bun ma, yi sɛrɛxɛbade rasɛniyɛnma na ki nɛ, a xa findi wo xa sɛrɛxɛbade ra. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" />Na lɔxɔɛe na ba a ra, keli a xi solomasaxan nde ma, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe luma wo xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun wo xa sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexie ba ra nɛ mɛnni fa. Na kui, n wo rasɛnɛma nɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s">Naadɛ balanxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />Na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ sode dɛ ra, naxan nu na sogetede mabiri. Na naadɛ nu balanxi. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «Na naadɛ balanxi, a mu rabima. Ibunadama yo mu soma naa, barima, n tan Isirayila Marigi Alatala nan soxi mɛnni ra. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila mangɛ nan gbansan nɔma dɔxɔde na sode dɛ ra a sɛrɛxɛ don n ya i. A soma buntunyi sode dɛ nan na, a man mini mɛnni ra.»<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />Na dangi xanbi, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ sode dɛ kɔɔla biri ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi ya i. Mɛnni n naxa Alatala xa nɔrɛ to so ra a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, n fa n yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Adamadi, i xa i tuli mati n ma masenyi ra a gbengbenyi, n tan Alatala naxan masenma i bɛ n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra. I xa i ɲɔxɔ sa na sode dɛe nun a minidee xɔn ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" />I xa a fala Isirayila matandilae bɛ, ‹N tan Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Na lan. Wo xa fe ɲaaxie bara dangi a i! <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" />Wo man bara a xunmasa, sunnataree rasofe n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi kui, naxee bɔɲɛ makuya n na. Na kui wo bara fe raharamuxi raba n ma banxi ra, hali wo to nu donse, ture, nun wuli bafe sɛrɛxɛ ra a kui. Wo bara n ma sɛriyɛ kana na mɔɔli ra. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" />Wo bara tondi n ma wali sɛniyɛnxi rabade, wo fa na wali so mixi gbɛtɛ yi ra. <verse eid="EZK 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: Sunnatare yo naxa so n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, naxan bɔɲɛ makuya n na, hali e sabatixi Isirayilakae ya ma.›»<verse eid="EZK 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" />«Lewi bɔnsɔɛ to e makuya n na, e bira e xa kuyee fɔxɔ ra, a nun Isirayila ɲama, n nee sare ragbilenma nɛ e ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" />N e luma nɛ e xa wali kui n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire, e xa na sode dɛe kanta, e xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun sɛrɛxɛ gbɛtɛe ba ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" />Kɔnɔ e to n ma wali raba e xa kuyee ya i, e a niya Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fan xa bira yunubi fɔxɔ ra, n bara n kali n bɛlɛxɛ itexi ra, e fama nɛ na sare sɔtɔde. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan nan ki. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" />Yakɔsi n mu tinma e xa e maso n na sɛrɛxɛ bade, n mu tinma e xa e maso n ma se sɛniyɛnxie ra, n mu tinma e xa e maso n ma se sɛniyɛnxi fisamantee ra. A lanma e xa yaagi sɔtɔ e xa fe ɲaaxie xa fe ra. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" />Kɔnɔ n e luma nɛ e xa wali nde raba n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire, e xa e ɲɔxɔ sa naa xɔn ma.»<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />«Isirayilakae to nu e makuyama n na, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛe tan, Sadɔki xa mixie, e nu bara e tunnabɛxi n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa wali kui. Na nan a ra, n naxa a lu nee peti xa e maso n na, e xa ture nun wuli ba sɛrɛxɛ ra n bɛ. Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" />Nee nan gbansan soma n ma yire sɛniyɛnxi kui, e fa n ma wali raba n ma teebili ya i.»<verse eid="EZK 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" />«E na so n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa tɛtɛ kui naxan na na tɛtɛ singe kui, a lanma e xa suwa dugi ragoro e ma. E naxa dugi binye ragoro e ma e nɛ walima hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ sode dɛe yire tɛmui naxɛ, xa na mu a ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />A lanma e xa suwa dugi nan xiri e xunyi e raxunmase ra, e man xa suwa dugi xiri e tagi. E naxa sese ragoro e ma, naxan kuyefure raminima e fate ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" />Beenu e xa mini boore tɛtɛ kui ɲama tixi dɛnnaxɛ, e xa e xa sose sɛniyɛnxie ba e ma, e xa e lu e xa konkoe kui hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire. Na ki e mu mixi rasɛniyɛnma e xa dugie ra.»<verse eid="EZK 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" />«A mu lanma e xa e xunyi bi, a mu lanma e xa e xunsɛxɛ rakuya. E xa a maxaba a sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" />A mu lanma sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa bere yo min, e na so hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe mu lan e xa kaaɲɛ ginɛ dɔxɔ, a mu lan e xa ginɛ dɔxɔ, xɛmɛ nde mɛxi naxan na. E xa Isirayila ginɛ dimɛdi gbansan nan dɔxɔ, xa na mu sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nde xa kaaɲɛ ginɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" />E xa n ma ɲama xaran se radaxaxi nun se raharamuxi tagi raba kolonde. E xa a masen e bɛ naxan findi se sɛniyɛnxi nun se sɛniyɛntare ra.»<verse eid="EZK 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" />«Ɲɔxɔnsɔsɔɛ na mini ɲama tagi, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nan kiiti sama n ma sɛriyɛ ki ma. E xa n ma yaamarie suxu, e xa n ma salie raba, e xa n ma malabui lɔxɔɛe binya.»<verse eid="EZK 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" />«Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa a maso fure ra, xa na mu a ra a findima nɛ sɛniyɛntare ra. Kɔnɔ xa a baba, a nga, a xa di xɛmɛma, xa na mu a ra ginɛma sa faxa, na tɛmui a nɔma a masode nee tan fure ra. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" />Na dangi xanbi, a xa a yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, a fa mamɛ ti xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" />A na so hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui a xa wali sɛniyɛnxi rabade, a xa fɔlɔ yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ma a yɛtɛ bɛ. Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />«N tan nan findixi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe kɛ ra. Wo naxa bɔxi fi e ma Isirayila bɔxi ma, barima n tan nan findixi e kɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" />E baloma sɛrɛxɛe nan na, alɔ sansi xɔri sɛrɛxɛ, yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ, yunubi sɔtɔɛ sɛrɛxɛ, nun se birin naxee fixi Ala ma Isirayila bɔxi ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" />E gbe nan sansi bogi singe ra, a nun hadiya birin naxee fima wo ya ma. A man lanma wo xa taami fi e ma sɛrɛxɛ ra, alako wo xa denbaya xa baraka sɔtɔ. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe mu lanma e xa xɔni nun xuruse sube yo don naxan faxa a yɛtɛ ma, xa na mu a ra, wulai sube naxan ibɔɔxi.»<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s">Bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />«Wo na Isirayila bɔxi itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma tɛmui naxɛ, wo xa yire nde ragata a xati ma Alatala bɛ, a xa findi a xa yire sɛniyɛnxi ra. Na yire xa kuyɛ lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma, a xa gboe lan nɔngɔn ya wulu fu ma. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" />Na kui, yire gbɛtɛ xa maniya hɔrɔmɔbanxi tima dɛnnaxɛ. Na xa kuyɛ lanma nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ suuli nan ma, a xa gboe fan lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ suuli ma, nun yire nde naxan xa tilinyi nɔngɔn ya tongo suuli lima, na xa lu na rabilinyi. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" />Wo xa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi ti na yire kui, naxan xa kuyɛ nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli lima, a igboe nɔngɔn ya wulu fu. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" />Yire sɛniyɛnxi na a ra, naxan bama Isirayila bɔxi ra sɛrɛxɛdubɛe bɛ, naxee tima Alatala ya i a xa wali rabafe ra a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. E xa banxie fan tima naa nɛ Alatala xa yire sɛniyɛnxi sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" />Na bɔxi naxan xa kuyɛ nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli lima, naxan xa gboe nɔngɔn ya wulu fu lima, na findima Lewi bɔnsɔɛ gbe nan na, naxee walima hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. E sabatide nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />«Wo xa yire gbɛtɛ maniya yire sɛniyɛnxi fɛ ma, naxan findima taa gbe ra. A xa kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli, a igboe nɔngɔn ya wulu suuli. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin gbe nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />«Isirayila mangɛ xa bɔxi luma na yire sɛniyɛnxi nun taa xa bɔxi sɛɛtie nan ma sogetede nun sogegorode mabiri, han Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe naaninyie ra. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" />Na bɔxi findima a gbe nan na. A hayi mu na sɔnɔn Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe tɔɔrɔfe ma e xa bɔxi xa fe ra. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin xa e gbe sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi: ‹Isirayila mangɛe, na xa wo wasa! Wo naxa n ma ɲama tɔɔrɔ, wo naxa fe xɔrɔxɔɛ raba e ra! Wo xa bira sɛriyɛ nun tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra! Wo xa ba n ma ɲama kɛ muɲafe! Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.›»<verse eid="EZK 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" />«Wo xa maniyasee xa kamali. Wo xa busali xa findi busali yati nan na. Wo xa fifa xa findi fifa yati nan na. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Na firinyie xa lan, hali keren to rawalima sansi xɔri maniyafe nan na, boore rawali ture maniyafe ra. Na busali nun na fifa, e birin xa maniyase nde ya fu li a sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" />Kɔbiri kole naxan xili ‹sikili,› na xa lan maniyase nde ya mɔxɔɲɛn ma, naxan xili ‹gera.› Sikili tongo senni lanxi maniyase nde nan ma, naxan xili ‹mina.›»<verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />«Wo xa hadiyae xa findi yi see nan na: mɛngi maniyɛ xɔri konbo ya mɔxɔɲɛn kui, wo xa konbo ya saxan ba a ra, fundenyi maniyɛ xɔri konbo ya mɔxɔɲɛn kui, wo xa konbo ya saxan ba a ra, <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />ture fifa keren kui, wo xa litiri firin ba a ra (fifa keren findi litiri kɛmɛ firin litiri mɔxɔɲɛn nan na), <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" />yɛxɛɛ kɛmɛ firin ya ma, wo xa yɛxɛɛ keren ba a ra Isirayila bɔxi fanyi birin ma. Yie nan bama sansi xɔri sɛrɛxɛe ra, sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie ra, xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe ra ɲama xunsare xa fe ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki. <verse eid="EZK 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Isirayila ɲama birin xa lu na fe kui e xa mangɛ malife ra. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" />Mangɛ lanma a xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun sansi xɔri nun minse sɛrɛxɛe ba kike salie nun malabui lɔxɔɛ sali tɛmui. A man xa yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛe, sansi xɔri hadiyae, sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie, nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe ba Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xunsare xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ, ‹Kike singe, xi singe, wo xa tuura keren ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, lanyuru yo mu na naxan ma, hɔrɔmɔbanxi rasɛniyɛnfe ra. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nde xa xuruse wuli tongo, naxan baxi yunubi xafari xa fe ra, a a maso hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ sɛɛtie ra, sɛrɛxɛbade tunxui naani ra, a nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ sode dɛ sɛɛtie ra. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />Wo man xa na raba na kike xi solofere nde ra, barima xa mixi nde bara yunubi raba a mu naxan kolon, na sɛrɛxɛ hɔrɔmɔbanxi rasɛniyɛnma nɛ.›»<verse eid="EZK 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" />«Kike singe, xi fu nun naani nde ra, wo xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba xi solofere bun ma. Wo naxa taami lɛbinitare yo don na tɛmui. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" />Na sali lɔxɔɛ, mangɛ xa tuura keren ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra a yɛtɛ bɛ a nun ɲama bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" />Na sali xi solofere bun ma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, mangɛ xa tuura solofere ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, a nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi solofere lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. A man xa sikɔtɛ keren ba yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛ ra lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ na xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" />A man xa sansi xɔri konbo ya saxan nun ture litiri ya naani ba sɛrɛxɛ ra na tuurae nun na yɛxɛɛ kontonyie birin sɛɛti ma.»<verse eid="EZK 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" />«Na sali waxati, na xi solofere bun ma, a man xa na mɔɔli ba sɛrɛxɛ ra yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛe sɛɛti ma, a nun sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie sɛɛti ma, a nun sansi xɔri nun ture hadiyae sɛɛti ma. Na sali fɔlɔma kike solofere, xi fu nun suuli nde nan na.»<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: «Sode dɛ xa naadɛ, naxan na hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui sogetede biri ra, na balanma nɛ xi senni bun ma, kɔnɔ a rabima malabu lɔxɔɛ nun kike nɛɛnɛ sali tɛmui nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" />Mangɛ a maso naa buntunyi sode dɛ ra, a ti mɛnni. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ a xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun a xa xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe bama tɛmui naxɛ, a xa a xinbi sin. A na gɛ na rabade, a xa mini. Sode dɛ naadɛ mu balanma, fo nunmare. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" />Ɲama e xinbi sinma nɛ naa Alatala ya i malabui lɔxɔɛ nun kike nɛɛnɛ sali lɔxɔɛe ra. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" />Mangɛ tan xa yɛxɛɛ xɛmɛ senni nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren ba sɛrɛxɛ ra malabui lɔxɔɛ. Lanyuru yo naxa lu e ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" />Sansi xɔri busali keren xa ba hadiya ra yɛxɛɛ kontonyi sɛɛti ma. A man xa sansi xɔri nde ba hadiya ra yɛxɛɛ booree sɛɛti ma, a wama xasabi naxan xɔn, a nun ture litiri naani sansi xɔri busali keren bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" />Kike nɛɛnɛ xi singe, a xa tuura keren, yɛxɛɛ xɛmɛ senni, nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi keren nan ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, lanyuru yo mu na naxee ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />A xa sansi xɔri busali keren ba tuura bɛ, a xa keren ba yɛxɛɛ kontonyi bɛ, a nun a wama naxan xɔn yɛxɛɛ xɛmɛ booree fan bɛ. A xa ture litiri naani sa busali keren keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Mangɛ xa so buntunyi sode dɛ ra, a man xa mini mɛnni nan na.»<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />«Ɲama na fa tɛmui naxɛ Alatala batude sali lɔxɔɛe ma, naxan na so kɔɔla sode dɛ ra, a xa mini yirefanyi sode dɛ ra. Naxan na so yirefanyi sode dɛ ra, a xa mini kɔɔla sode dɛ ra. Mixi yo naxa mini a soxi dɛnnaxɛ ra. A xa mini naadɛ gbɛtɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Mangɛ fan xa lu e ya ma, e so tɛmui nun e mini tɛmui.»<verse eid="EZK 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />«Sali lɔxɔɛe nun lɔxɔɛ sugandixie, mangɛ xa sansi xɔri busali keren ba tuura bɛ, a xa keren ba yɛxɛɛ kontonyi bɛ, a nun a wama naxan xasabi xɔn yɛxɛɛ xɛmɛ booree bɛ. A xa ture litiri naani sa busali keren keren sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" />Mangɛ na wa sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi bafe Alatala bɛ, naxan findixi sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi, xa na mu a ra, xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ, a lanma sogetede naadɛ xa rabi a bɛ. A xa a xa sɛrɛxɛe ba alɔ a a bama ki naxɛ malabui lɔxɔɛ. A na gɛ na ra, a xa mini, naadɛ fa balan.»<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />«Gɛɛsɛgɛ birin wo xa yɛxɛɛ ɲɛ keren daaxi ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, lanyuru mu na naxan ma. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Wo xa sansi xɔri konbo ya saxan nun ture litiri keren ba na yɛxɛɛ sɛɛti ma gɛɛsɛgɛ birin. Yaamari na a ra naxan mu kanama abadan. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Na kui gɛɛsɛgɛ birin, yɛxɛɛ, sansi xɔri, nun ture xa ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />«Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: Xa mangɛ bɔxi nde fima a xa di nde ma, na findima a xa di bɛ kɛ nan na, a fa lu a xa di xa die bɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" />Kɔnɔ xa a bɔxi nde fi a xa konyi nde ma, na luma nɛ na yi ra han xɔrɛya ɲɛ waxati. Na tɛmui, na bɔxi man gbilenma mangɛ nan ma. Mangɛ xa bɔxi findima a xa die kɛ nan gbansan na. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" />Mangɛ mu lanma a xa mixi yo kɛ ba a yi ra ɲama ya ma, a a keri a xɔnyi. A xa a yɛtɛ kɛ fi a xa die ma, alako n ma ɲama naxa fa makuya e xa bɔxi ra.»<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Na tɛmui, na xɛmɛ naxa n xanin hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ sode dɛ ra, naxan na kɔɔla biri ra, a sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xɔnyi masen n bɛ. A naxa yire nde masen n bɛ mɛnni sogegorode mabiri, <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" />a a fala n bɛ: «Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa xuruse sube ɲinma be nɛ, naxan bama yunubi xafari sɛrɛxɛe ra, nun yunubi sɔtɔɛ sɛrɛxɛ ra. E man sansi xɔri sɛrɛxɛ ganma be nɛ, alako na se sɛniyɛnxie naxa ɲama tan nasɛniyɛn.»<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Na xɛmɛ naxa n namini tɛtɛ xungbe kui, a a tunxun naanie birin masen n bɛ. Tɛtɛ gbɛtɛe nu na na tunxun naani birin na, <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />naxee xa kuyɛ nɔngɔn ya tongo naani lima, e igboe nɔngɔn ya tongo saxan. Na tɛtɛ naani birin nu lan. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Teebili gɛmɛ daaxie nu fatuxi na tɛtɛe xɛlɛe ma. Yiree nu na na teebilie bun ma tɛ nu xuruma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" />Na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, a naxɛ, «Kuri nan ya, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ɲama xa sɛrɛxɛe ɲinma dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s">Xure naxan minima hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />Na xɛmɛ naxa n nagbilen hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra sogetede mabiri, banxi ya nu rafindixi dɛnnaxɛ ma. Mɛnni n naxa ye to mini ra. Na ye nu kelima sɛrɛxɛbade kɔɔla mabiri nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Na xɛmɛ naxa n namini kɔɔla sode dɛ ra, muxu tɛtɛ mabilin tande biri ra, han tɛtɛ sode dɛ ra sogetede mabiri. Ye nu xalɛma sode dɛ yirefanyi biri ra.<verse eid="EZK 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" />Na xɛmɛ to mini sogetede biri ra, luuti nu na a yi ra, a naxa nɔngɔn ya wulu keren maniya mɛnni. A fa n nagiri ye ma, naxan nu bara te han n san kɔnyi. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />A man naxa nɔngɔn ya wulu keren maniya, a n nagiri ye ma, naxan nu bara te han n xinbi. A man naxa nɔngɔn ya wulu keren maniya, a n nagiri ye ma, naxan nu bara te han n tagi. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />A to nɔngɔn ya wulu keren gbɛtɛ maniya, na ye nu bara findi xure ra mixi mu nu nɔma naxan igiride, fo a xa ye masa. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Na tɛmui a naxa n maxɔrin, «Adamadi, i bara yi fe to a fanyi ra? A naxa n xanin xure dɛ ra. <verse eid="EZK 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" />Mɛnni n naxa wuri bili gbegbe to, e tixi xure dɛ firin na.» <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" />Na xɛmɛ naxa a fala n bɛ, «Yi xure xun tixi sogetede nan na, a sa goro Yurudɛn farɛ ma, a sa sin baa ma, naxan ye mu fanxi. Xure ye na baa li dɛnnaxɛ, baa ye fanma nɛ a fanyi ra, <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />yɛxɛe fa balo. Yɛxɛ wuyama nɛ mɛnni na xure ye xa fe ra, naxan baa ye fanma. Na xure ye na lu dɛnnaxɛ, nimasee baloma nɛ a fanyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" />Keli En Gedi ma, han a sa dɔxɔ Egelayimi ra, yɛxɛsuxuie dinma nɛ mɛnni birin na, e e xa yɛlɛe sa. Yɛxɛ mɔɔli birin nan suxuma naa, alɔ naxee toma Baa Xungbe ma. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Ye yire ndee mu fanma, alako fɔxɔɛ xa lu naa. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" />Wuri bili mɔɔli birin nan bulama na xure dɛ firinyi ma. E burɛxɛ mu lisima, e bogi fan. Kike yo kike e bogima nɛ a fanyi ra na xure ye xa fe ra naxan kelima hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. E bogi findima baloe nan na, e burɛxɛ findi seri ra.»<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13" />«Wo Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, a naxɛ: Wo xa yi bɔxi itaxun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firinyie ma, a xa findi e kɛ ra. N xa na naaninyie masen wo bɛ. Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ bɔxi itaxunxi firin nan sɔtɔma, <verse eid="EZK 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14" />naxee birin lan. Isirayila bɔxi findima wo birin kɛ nan na, alɔ n na n kali wo benbae bɛ ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />Bɔxi naaninyie nan ya: A kɔɔla sɛɛti fɔlɔma Baa Xungbe nan ma, a siga Xetelon kira ra, a dangi Lebo Xamata ra, Tisedadi, <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />Berota, Sibirayima, naxan na Damasi nun Xamata tagi, han a sa dɔxɔ Xaseri Tikoni ra, naxan na Xawuran naaninyi ra. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Na kui, na naaninyi kelima baa xungbe nan ma, a siga han Xasari Enan, naxan na Damasi kɔɔla mabiri. Tisafoni bɔxi na kɔɔla nan ma. Isirayila naaninyi nan na ki kɔɔla mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />Isirayila bɔxi naaninyi sogetede mabiri kelima Damasi nɛ, a siga Xawuran. Yurudɛn xure findixi naaninyi nan na Galadi bɔxi nun Isirayila bɔxi tagi, a sa baa li sogetede biri ra. Isirayila naaninyi nan na ki sogetede mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 47:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />Isirayila bɔxi naaninyi yirefanyi mabiri kelima Tamari, a siga han Meriba Kadesi, han Misira xure nun baa xungbe ma. Isirayila naaninyi nan na ki yirefanyi mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />Isirayila bɔxi naaninyi sogegorode mabiri kelima baa xungbe nan ma, han Lebo Xamata longori. Isirayila naaninyi nan na ki sogegorode mabiri.<verse eid="EZK 47:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />«Wo xa yi bɔxi itaxun wo bore ma Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ki nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" />A xa findi wo kɛ ra, a nun mixie kɛ ra naxee sabatixi wo xɔnyi a nun e xa die. Wo xa e tongo alɔ Isirayila lasiri, naxee kɛ sɔtɔma Isirayila bɔxi ma wo ya ma. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Na xɔɲɛe sabatixi bɔnsɔɛ naxan ya ma, e xa e kɛ sɔtɔ mɛnni nɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe naaninyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />«Bɔnsɔɛe xilie nan ya: Dana bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na kɔɔla mabiri nɛ Xetelon kira ra, kelife Lebo Xamata, a sa dɔxɔ Xasari Enan ra, naxan na Damasi nun Xamata naaninyi ra kɔɔla mabiri. A keli naaninyi ra naxan na sogetede mabiri han baa xungbe.»<verse eid="EZK 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />«Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Dana bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede naaninyi ma han sogegorode naaninyi.»<verse eid="EZK 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />«Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" />«Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />«Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />«Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />«Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />«Yire sɛniyɛnxi na Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode. Na bɔxi xa gboe nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli, a kuya kelife sogetede naaninyi han sogegorode naaninyi. Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tixi a tagi.»<verse eid="EZK 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />«Na yire sɛniyɛnxi naxan sama a xati ma Alatala bɛ, a xa kuyɛ lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli nan ma, a xa gboe lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu fu nan ma. <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe luma na yire sɛniyɛnxi nan kui, naxan xa kuyɛ lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli ma kɔɔla biri ra, a xa gboe nɔngɔn ya wulu fu sogegorode biri ra, a xa gboe sogetede biri ra nɔngɔn ya wulu fu, a xa kuyɛ yirefanyi biri ra nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli. Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tima na yire sɛniyɛnxi nan tagi. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" />Mɛnni findima sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nan gbe ra, naxee sugandixi Sadɔki bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. E nu n nabatuma a fanyi ra, e mu n yanfa alɔ Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi gbɛtɛ naxee e makuya n na Isirayilakae muruta tɛmui. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Na yire sɛniyɛnxi saxi a xati ma e tan nan bɛ Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa yire sɛɛti ma.»<verse eid="EZK 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" />«Na yire xa kuyɛ nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli, a xa gboe nɔngɔn ya wulu fu, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa bɔxi. <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" />A mu lanma e xa na bɔxi mati, a mu lanma e xa na masara bɔxi gbɛtɛ ra, a mu lanma e xa na fi mixi yo ma, barima bɔxi hagigɛ na a ra naxan sɛniyɛnxi Alatala bɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />«Bɔxi naxan luxi, naxan xa gboe lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu suuli ma, a xa kuyɛ nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli, na findima taa gbe nan na banxie nun mɛrɛ luma dɛnnaxɛ. Taa yati luma nɛ na bɔxi tagi. <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />Na bɔxi sɛɛti naanie birin lan nɔngɔn ya wulu naani ya kɛmɛ suuli nan ma, a kɔɔla sɛɛti, a yirefanyi sɛɛti, a sogetede sɛɛti, nun a sogegorode sɛɛti. <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />Na bɔxi naxan luma taa sɛɛti ra, na bɔxi sɛɛti naanie fan birin lan nɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ firin ya tongo suuli nan ma, a kɔɔla sɛɛti, a yirefanyi sɛɛti, a sogetede sɛɛti, nun a sogegorode sɛɛti. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Bɔxi dɔnxɔɛ naxan luma bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi xa kuyɛ sɛɛti firinyi ra, naxan nɔngɔn ya wulu fu lima a sogetede nun a sogegorode, na findima mɛrɛ nan na taa walikɛe bɛ, <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />naxee kelima Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe birin ma. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" />Na bɔxi birin xa kuyɛ lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn ya wulu suuli nan ma, a xa gboe fan lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn ya wulu suuli nan ma. Na birin saxi a xati nan ma taa nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra.»<verse eid="EZK 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21" />«Bɔxi naxan na yire sɛniyɛnxi nun taa sɛɛti ra, na findima mangɛ nan gbe ra. A kelima bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi nɛ, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli sogetede mabiri, a siga han Isirayila naaninyi sogetede mabiri. A man kelima bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi nɛ naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun suuli sogegorode mabiri, a siga han Isirayila naaninyi sogetede mabiri. Na bɔxi luma Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe xa bɔxi sɛɛti nan na. Yire sɛniyɛnxi nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi luma na bɔxi nan tagi. <verse eid="EZK 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22" />Na kui, taa yire nun Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi luma mangɛ xa bɔxi nan tagi, naxan na Yuda bɔnsɔɛ nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa naaninyie sɛɛti ra.»<verse eid="EZK 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />«Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />«Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />«Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />«Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />«Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi na Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi naaninyi sɛɛti nan na, kelife sogetede han sogegorode.»<verse eid="EZK 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />«Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi xa naaninyi yirefanyi mabiri, a kelima Tamari nɛ han Meriba Kadesi xa ye yire, Misira xure goroma baa xungbe ma dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="EZK 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" />«Bɔxi nan yi ki, wo fama naxan itaxunde Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe ma, a xa findi e kɛ ra. Wo Marigi Alatala xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30" />«Taa sode dɛe xilie nan yi ki: Naadɛ naxee na taa kɔɔla sɛɛti, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu naani kɛmɛ suuli, <verse eid="EZK 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ Ruben, Yuda, nun Lewi xilie nan sama e xun ma.»<verse eid="EZK 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />«Naadɛ naxee na taa sogetede sɛɛti, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu naani kɛmɛ suuli, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ Yusufu, Bunyamin, nun Dana xilie nan sama na naadɛ saxanyi xun ma.»<verse eid="EZK 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />«Naadɛ naxee na taa yirefanyi sɛɛti, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu naani kɛmɛ suuli, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ Simeyɔn, Isakari, nun Sabulon xilie nan sama na naadɛ saxanyi xun ma.»<verse eid="EZK 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />«Naadɛ naxee na taa sogegorode sɛɛti, naxan kuya nɔngɔn ya wulu naani kɛmɛ suuli, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ Gadi, Aseri, nun Nafatali xilie nan sama na naadɛ saxanyi xun ma.»<verse eid="EZK 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" />«Taa rabilinyi lanma nɔngɔn ya wulu fu nun solomasaxan nan ma. Fɔlɔfe na lɔxɔɛ ma, na taa xili falama nɛ, ‹Alatala na mɛnni.›»<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>